window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1201,"title":"Chapter 1201 - How Dare She Come!","paragraphs":["Two days later, at Old Master Wei’s funeral.","Everyone who was supposed to be in Beijing was here.","The entrance of the Wei residence was filled with all kinds of cars. The license plate number of each car was extraordinary.","The Wei family, including Wei Ling and Shen Jingyan, were all wearing black suits. They stood at the door solemnly to welcome the people who came to pay their respects.","Wei Ying stood beside Wei Ling and was supported by her. She looked sad. Her eyes were red from crying, and her expression was haggard.","!!","Except for her daughter, Wei Ling, and her son-in-law, Shen Jingyan, everyone in the family treated her strangely.","It seemed contemptuous and unconsciously distant.","No one else was willing to stand together with her.","Everyone seemed to have agreed to stay away from her.","Wei Ying stood on the left. There was nothing behind her, and only Wei Ling and Shen Jingyan stood with her.","Wei Mingxuan stood on the right. Other than Wei Lou, the Wei family’s relatives were all standing together.","In comparison, the difference was even more obvious.","Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that Old Master Wei had left in a hurry, but the Wei family seemed to have already chosen their future successor.","Everyone was smart enough to know which way the wind would blow in the future.","All the guests who came to pay their respects first went to comfort Wei Mingxuan. When they passed by Wei Ying’s family, they went in after exchanging a few pleasantries.","Their priorities were obvious!","Their attitudes differed greatly.","Wei Ying gritted her teeth and pinched her palm with all her might. If not for Wei Ling supporting her, she would have been so angry that she could not stand.","However, today was Old Master Wei’s funeral. As a direct descendant of the Wei family, she had to survive today no matter what.","Especially after what happened at the hospital that day, she had lost all face in the Wei family. She was already very glad that Wei Mingxuan did not publicize this scandal. How would she dare to provoke her brother at this time and cause trouble at their father’s funeral?","Wei Ying had been forcing herself not to flare up. It was difficult for her to hold it in, and she could barely maintain the peace on the surface.","Until the girl’s restrained and arrogant figure appeared in her vision.","Wei Ying’s indifferent face instantly twisted. She gritted his teeth and whispered, “She still dares to come!”","Shen Jingyan pulled her back when he saw that his mother-in-law was about to flare up. He shook his head and said, “Mom, Nian Nian is also here to pay her respects. Please don’t make a fuss today. Otherwise, it won’t be good for us.”","Wei Ying took a deep breath and pursed her thin lips without saying anything.","Then, she saw that her brother had changed from his calm and capable appearance. He walked towards the girl and said warmly, “Miss Qiao, you’re here.”","Qiao Nian was not wearing a cap today. She was wearing a black sweater and matching canvas shoes. Hearing this, she nodded and greeted the man. “Uncle Wei.”","Wei Mingxuan remembered that if Qiao Nian had not acted righteously in the hospital three days ago, he might not have been able to see his father for the last time. His expression became exceptionally gentle as he patted the girl’s shoulder and asked worriedly, “Isn’t it school time today? Will it affect your studies?”","“Not so bad.”","Qiao Nian’s eyelashes were drooping, dark, and restrained. “I don’t have class this morning.”","“Yes.” Wei Mingxuan nodded. His strong facial features were well-defined, and his nose bridge was high and straight, giving off a sharp feeling. However, his attitude towards Qiao Nian was very friendly, as if she was an elder he had known for many years and he couldn’t stop worrying. “It’s good that it didn’t affect your studies.”"]},{"number":1202,"title":"Chapter 1202 - Wei Lou: Sympathy From a Girl","paragraphs":["“I’m glad you came. I received the book the other day. Don’t worry, I’ll fulfill my father’s wishes and transfer money to the people recorded in the book every month.”","He checked the name list that Qiao Nian had given him. They were all his father’s old comrades.","Wei Mingxuan pursed his lips, unable to hide the emotion on his face. He whispered to the girl, “Qiao Nian, thank you. If it weren’t for you...”","Before he could finish, Wei Lou walked over and grabbed his arm to interrupt him. He was sloppy as if he didn’t care about anything. “Dad, why are you talking so much? Enough, let Qiao Nian go in first. What will others think if you block the door?”","Many guests came to pay their respects to the Wei family today. They were all famous figures in Beijing. Wei Mingxuan presided over the family.","He was the absolute master of the day.","The host had neglected so many guests and went to talk to a young girl instead. That in itself was eye-catching.","A lot of people were looking in this direction.","They sized Qiao Nian up as if trying to figure out her background.","Wei Mingxuan had been through a lot. With his son’s reminder, he realized that this was not a good time to catch up.","He rubbed his forehead and laughed a little helplessly. “Look at me. I’ve been too busy.”","He raised his head and looked at the girl apologetically. “Miss Qiao, don’t mind me. I’ll come to thank you personally after I’m done.”","Qiao Nian was not good at dealing with such situations. She raised her hand and subconsciously wanted to pull at the brim of her cap. However, she realized that she wasn’t wearing a baseball cap today. She lowered her hand. Her fair skin shone in the sunlight, making her eyes look exquisite. “Uncle Wei, you don’t have to be polite with me. I’ve already said that Wei Lou and I are friends. Grandpa Wei is also my elder. It’s just that I didn’t manage to help you. I’m quite sorry.”","For the first time, she had not been able to snatch anyone back from Death.","It was also because of Old Master Wei that she realized for the first time that death was very close to her.","Life was so short. It was as if a person was gone in the blink of an eye.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips. She raised her hand and patted the young man gently on the shoulder when she passed by him. She was expressionless, but her actions were warm. “My condolences.”","She patted his shoulder and retracted her hand. With one hand in her pocket, she walked straight into the mourning hall.","Wei Lou waited until the girl was far away.","Only then did he see the girl’s retreating figure.","He looked startled for a second. The corners of his mouth curled up, and he almost revealed the sloppy smile from when he was circling the city. However, the corners of his mouth only curled up halfway before falling down again, leaving only endless bitterness.","He had been in Rao City for three years. For the past three years, he had been thinking about how to improve his relationship with Qiao Nian and become more intimate with her.","He had not thought that he would finally wait for his sweetheart to approach him under such circumstances.","This feeling of sympathy from a girl whom he had been secretly in love with for years...","Wei Lou’s lips twitched and he almost cursed.","Damn it!","...","Old Master Wei’s mourning hall was decorated solemnly.","The guests who came in to pay their respects were all lined up orderly. Everyone walked to the front of the mourning hall and put down the white flowers they had brought. After bowing, they were replaced by the next person.","Qiao Nian was at the back of the line.","After bowing to the old man in the photo, putting down the white flowers, and turning to leave, Qin Si saw the eye-catching girl in the queue."]},{"number":1203,"title":"Chapter 1203 - The Big Boss of the Tian Chen","paragraphs":["He was stunned for a moment and quickly caught up to the man in front. “Master Wang, Sister Qiao is here too.”","Ye Wangchuan was also wearing black today. His figure was slender and well-proportioned. Black did not look out of place on him at all. Instead, it made him look even nobler.","Hearing this, he turned around and saw the girl in the queue.","His eyes narrowed. In this situation, it was not convenient for him to go over and greet her. He could only find a corner and wait for Qiao Nian to finish paying her respects.","The queue moved quickly.","It was Qiao Nian’s turn not long after.","She stood in front of the photo and watched as the old man looked at the camera. His eyes were wise and determined. She thought of the small notebook he had handed her before he left and the long list of names in it. She felt quite sad. She first bowed three times solemnly and then offered a fresh bouquet of white chrysanthemums in silence.","The white chrysanthemums looked as if they had just been picked.","They still had dew on them.","It stood out in the pile of chrysanthemums.","After Qiao Nian put down the chrysanthemum, she straightened her back and no longer lingered to offer her condolences. She let the people behind her continue.","Qin Si was dumbfounded as he watched the girl bow and offer flowers. He couldn’t help but say in a low voice, “This is the first time I’ve seen Big Boss lower her head.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened. “Old Master Wei is worth it.”","“...” Qin Si glanced at him and saw a look of understanding.","Looking at Qiao Nian, who wasn’t wearing a baseball cap today, he seemed to understand something and didn’t say anything else.","Of course, Old Master Wei’s life was worth it.","However, he didn’t expect Sister Qiao to know these things at her age. Young people nowadays rarely paid attention to these things. Sister Qiao usually didn’t seem convinced by anyone. He didn’t expect her to bow three times in Old Master Wei’s mourning hall. She looked more serious than everyone else.","That was what he was thinking when a sudden commotion broke out outside.","Qin Si frowned. Annoyed, he stuffed his hands into his pockets. “What’s going on outside? Why are they suddenly arguing? Could it be that Wei Ying and the others are causing trouble again?”","After he found out from Qiao Nian about Old Master Wei’s will, he quickly went home and told his family that Wei Mingxuan knew about the will.","As for whether Wei Ying knew, he did not know.","However, Wei Ying had never been easy to deal with. When Old Master Wei was around, he felt guilty towards her. Wei Ying was almost invincible in Beijing.","The children he raised were also like little tyrants.","The family had no upbringing at all.","It was not impossible for Wei Ying to cause a scene in Old Master Wei’s mourning hall.","After all, this family could do it!","Qin Si pricked up his ears and listened to what was going on outside.","“People from Tian Chen Corporation are here.”","“I think it’s Lu Zhi.”","“The rumored boss behind Tian Chen?”","“This person has been in the illegal district, right? He’s as mysterious as Sun of the Red Alliance. I didn’t expect him to be so young.”","Qin Si was also from the Ninth Branch, so he knew more than others.","Hearing “Tian Chen” and “Lu Zhi”, he immediately perked up and carefully asked the man beside him, “Why is Lu Zhi here? Is he friends with Old Master Wei?”","“I don’t know.” Ye Wangchuan’s eyes narrowed dangerously.","Lu Zhi was a shrewd person. He could be said to be able to cover the sky with one hand in the illegal district. It was not a problem for him to be called the King of the illegal district.","Tian Chen was an international corporation. It did both legal and black business, so it had more business on the surface."]},{"number":1204,"title":"Chapter 1204 - Why Did Lu Zhi Come to Beijing?","paragraphs":["However, Lu Zhi was not a simple businessman from what he knew.","This person was extremely dangerous.","Many things in the world were related to him.","However, Lu Zhi kept a very low profile. It was completely different from his style of doing things. Lu Zhi rarely appeared in front of others and rarely accepted interviews. There was not a single photo of him online.","The Ninth Branch did have a photo of Lu Zhi, but it was only a half-body photo. It was an old photo from many years ago.","Why would such a dangerous person come to Beijing?","Moreover, he had not received any news of his arrival in the country.","Why did Lu Zhi suddenly come to Beijing?","A thousand thoughts flashed through Ye Wangchuan’s mind. In the blink of an eye, he saw the person coming in.","Wei Mingxuan accompanied the man. The man was very young, about 27 or 28 years old. His facial features weren’t particularly outstanding, but his eyes were beautiful, similar to Qiao Nian’s. They were like starlight slowly falling into the distant wilderness, giving off an amiable impression.","That was not even the point.","The point was that the man hadn’t walked in. He was in a wheelchair, pushed in by a bodyguard in black.","He had a checkered blanket draped over his legs, just about covering his legs.","Such an outstanding man looked especially out of place in a wheelchair!","It was as if a piece of porcelain had been snapped in half.","“F*ck, Lu Zhi is...”","Qin Si almost blurted out the word “cripple”.","He was mid-sentence when a hand tugged at him, just in time to interrupt him. “Why are you two here?”","Qin Si forgot what he wanted to say as he turned around and met the goddess’ dark eyes. Her emotions could not be seen.","He was stunned for a second before he reacted. “Ah, we came to see Old Master Wei off. Sister Qiao, why didn’t you tell us you were coming? We saved him together.”","“It was a last-minute decision.” Qiao Nian glanced casually in the direction of the person who had entered the room, but she didn’t seem to be looking at him. She calmly put her hands in her pockets and said to Qin Si, “I’m done paying my respects. Are you leaving?”","Her glance at Lu Zhi was very casual. Qin Si did not notice it at all, but Ye Wangchuan did.","He realized that Qiao Nian wasn’t the only one who had looked at him.","Lu Zhi seemed to be looking in their direction as well.","Moreover, he was not looking at him and Qin Si. His gaze was stubborn. At a glance, it was as if there was no one else in his eyes.","He only saw one person—Qiao Nian!","He subconsciously frowned and unobtrusively blocked that gaze. Qin Si, who was still dawdling and wanted to stay a little longer, said in a low voice, “Let’s go home.”","Qin Si looked at him in shock and touched the bridge of his nose. He didn’t understand why Master Wang was in a hurry to leave.","Wasn’t Lu Zhi here?","Didn’t Master Wang want to know what Lu Zhi was doing in Beijing?","However, since Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan had already said that they were leaving, there was no reason for him to stay behind alone. He followed behind the two of them and left.","Qiao Nian had no classes in the morning.","Thus, she returned to the Rhine Apartments with Ye Wangchuan.","Qin Si shamelessly stayed in the apartment.","Gu San was not around today. Ye Wangchuan seemed to have arranged something else for him. No one would make tea without him around.","Qiao Nian didn’t mind. When she returned, she opened the fridge and took out a bottle of cold mineral water. She unscrewed the cap and drank."]},{"number":1205,"title":"Chapter 1205 - Big Bosses Are More Shameless Than The Other","paragraphs":["As a young master, Qin Si was used to being serviced. However, he suddenly had to make tea for himself. He kept complaining, “Master Wang, you’re not short of money, at least hire a servant for the family. You can also hire a part-timer. Every time Gu San isn’t around, I don’t even have a sip of water. It’s too infuriating.”","“I have no money.” The man stretched and was quite shameless. He spread his hands in a lazy pose.","Qin Si: “???”","“It doesn’t cost much to hire a servant, does it?”","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him from the corner of his eye and said calmly, “I still don’t have money. I have no choice. I have to save money if I want to raise a girlfriend.”","Qin Si almost smashed the teapot he was holding.","What!","He was just here to freeload. It was fine if he did it himself, but he also had to be a lightbulb.","However, he didn’t dare to provoke someone. He turned his head and looked resentfully at the girl who was drinking water. “Sister Qiao, look at him. He’s simply a hooligan.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and casually capped the bottle. She glanced at him, her expression cold. “Don’t look for me. I don’t have money, either.”","Guan Yan had been looking for her a few days ago and had drawn a sum of money from her account. She was penniless now, and all she lacked was to go out and perform.","Qiao Nian’s pale fingers closed the bottle cap. Then, she remembered. Oh, she had almost forgotten. A month ago, she had even transferred a sum of money for rare earth.","A few hundred million.","The corners of Qin Si’s mouth twitched. He was completely speechless at the two of them.","The two big shots were claiming to be poorer than the other.","He, a poor man, was actually rendered speechless!","This society was too shameless. They didn’t want the poor to live anymore!","He silently brewed a cup of tea and brought it to Ye Wangchuan. He knew that Master Wang was even lazier than him in life. He was the type of person who would not do anything unless he had to. He went to find two teacups and poured a cup of tea for himself and Ye Wangchuan.","He sighed as he picked up his teacup and took a sip. “No wonder I said a few days ago that doing it myself is fragrant. I can taste the taste of an immortal when I make my own tea. Tsk, I can start a tea shop with my skills.”","Ye Wangchuan uncrossed his legs and took a sip of his own cup. Then, he put it down expressionlessly and glanced at him. “Do you want to commit a crime?”","Qin Si: “???”","“You made tea with warm water?”","Qin Si touched his cup. The temperature was just right. He was puzzled. “Isn’t it fine as long as the water is hot? I saw that every time the tea is boiled, it takes half a day to drink it, so I didn’t wait for the water to boil. I reckon it’s about time to pour it into the teapot. Isn’t this just enough to drink without scalding my mouth?”","Seeing that Ye Wangchuan couldn’t be bothered with him, he looked aggrieved and turned to Qiao Nian for help.","“Don’t you agree, Sister Qiao?”","Qiao Nian was speechless. She only gave him a thumbs up!","Awesome!","Brewing tea with warm water.","Only Qin Si could think of it.","Qin Si felt a little better after finding his presence with Qiao Nian. He was no longer as depressed. He held his teacup and took a few more sips. The more he drank, the more fragrant it became.","Seeing Qiao Nian walk over with the mineral water, he asked her kindly, “Sister Qiao, do you want a cup of tea?”","Silence ensued.","Qiao Nian shook the bottle of mineral water and refused. “No, I’ll drink plain water.”","Then, she found a corner of the sofa, sat down, and leaned there sleepily, with her arms on the arms of the sofa and her legs crossed. They were straight and long and rather undisciplined. Suddenly, she said, “Is there a software competition this year?”"]},{"number":1206,"title":"Chapter 1206 - Sister Nian: I Happen to Know","paragraphs":["Qin Si was still struggling with his tea brewing skills. He looked up and thought for a moment upon hearing what she said. “There seems to be a competition like this.","“Sister Qiao, why are you asking about this competition? Are you going to participate?”","That wasn’t right. It wasn’t Qiao Nian’s personality.","Just as Qin Si thought this.","The girl’s eyes were quite delicate. She said after only a second’s pause, “Yes, I want to sign up for it.”","Ye Wangchuan continued before Qin Si could speak, “Are you talking about that World Software Competition?”","Qiao Nian supported her face with her hand, her eyes dark. Only now did she know that the software competition was called the World Software Competition. She nodded and said, “I think so.”","“Why do you suddenly want to go to the competition?”","He had the same thought as Qin Si. Qiao Nian didn’t like to join in the fun. Moreover, unlike Jiang Xianrou and most of the others, she didn’t care about her reputation.","She wouldn’t have caused so much trouble because of Zhui Guang if she valued those empty titles.","She was afraid of trouble.","She rarely told outsiders about many things even though she was already at the top of the industry.","Not to mention participating in competitions and competing for rankings.","Qiao Nian moved and changed her posture. She crossed her legs and looked sloppy. However, her expression was a little serious when she spoke. “It’s nothing. I just suddenly wanted to do something for the country. Then, I thought about it and realized that I didn’t have any special skills. I remembered that there was a competition. I happen to know how to use a computer, so I want to try it out.”","The corners of Qin Si’s mouth twitched when she said “I happen to know how to use a computer”.","A big shot was a big shot.","Qiao Nian knew how to use the computer.","Most of the technicians outside probably belonged to a standard that didn’t know how to use computers!","Ye Wangchuan nodded but did not say anything. He just said to her, “There is such a competition. Qing University also has a spot.”","Qiao Nian nodded in understanding.","That was good.","Old Master Wei’s matter had touched her greatly. She couldn’t explain why, but she felt quite upset.","Especially after hearing about Old Master Wei’s contributions to the country when he was young.","Come to think of it, she never seemed to go out of her way to do anything.","Wei Lou said that when Old Master Wei was at the peak of his illness, he still insisted on working until three in the morning before he was willing to sleep. He often said that he did not dare to lie down because he was afraid that he would fall asleep the moment he did. He still had many things to do. If he did not do them, who would? Some things had to be done. He would rather be the one to do them.","Qiao Nian’s heart skipped a beat at this thought. It was as if she had been pricked by a thin needle. It didn’t hurt, but she felt a little uncomfortable.","Her expression did not change, but her mind seemed to have changed.","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl frowned, then relaxed, then frowned again. There seemed to be something different about her from before, but it also seemed that Qiao Nian was still Qiao Nian. His eyes deepened. “But this is a world-class competition. You can bring the software you made to the school tomorrow to register with Principal Liang if you want to participate. The school will first choose the software that can represent the school’s best standards, then send it to the organizing committee. The domestic organizing committee will then choose the best one to represent the country.”","Qiao Nian had a rough understanding of the registration process. She nodded and got up. “Alright, I’ll go prepare the software first.”","There were many self-developed software in her notebook, but many of them were things she usually did for fun and had never announced to the public."]},{"number":1207,"title":"Chapter 1207 - World-Class Competition, What Do You Think?","paragraphs":["She would occasionally share some with Slim Waist Control.","Other times, she had not studied them seriously.","After Qiao Nian stood up, she said naturally to the two people on the sofa, “I’ll go upstairs first. I still have a song to finish. Have fun.”","She had promised to write the tune for Wen Ruxia.","A theme song for a sports project.","She had done a rough outline a few days ago.","The name had already been chosen. It would be called ‘Spark’.","Qiao Nian planned to write the song today and send it to Wen Ruxia. She could edit it again if there were any problems.","...","Qin Si waited until Qiao Nian went upstairs and the door closed before speaking.","He craned his neck and looked up, then asked the man sitting opposite him playing with his phone worriedly, “Master Wang, how’s the soundproofing in your room? Sister Qiao can’t hear us from the room upstairs, right?”","Ye Wangchuan crossed his legs and glanced at him lazily before pulling his gaze back to the phone. “She can’t hear us. Just say what you want to say.”","“Then, I’ll tell you.” Qin Si couldn’t hold it in anymore. He had a lot of questions. “What competition is that? I only know that there’s a software competition. Is that competition as awesome as you said?”","“A world-class competition. What do you think?” Ye Wangchuan put down his phone indifferently and glanced at him. He knew the answer even without saying it.","Qin Si felt terrible.","“That awesome????”","He was worried again. “So what kind of competition is this! What’s a software competition?”","“I just checked. The World Software Competition is quite prestigious. It’s recognized internationally and can be considered a top-notch software competition that represents the country. The sponsor is Tian Chen. In the past, the country’s IT was always criticized by the foreign media for being weak. Qiao Nian will have to go through many obstacles before she can enter the group stages.”","Ye Wangchuan spoke calmly, but Qin Si was not a fool. From his words, one could tell that he was in hell.","“What do you mean? You mean the others can go straight into the group stages and we still have to fight our way in from the periphery?”","“Something like that.”","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and fiddled with the silver bracelet on his wrist. He had been wearing it ever since Qiao Nian had given him this bracelet. He would fiddle with it whenever he had something to do. However, he was usually not in a good mood when he did so.","“You know that in the past, the level of technology in the country was limited. No one outside the country approved of our scientific research, especially in the IT area. Software is also within the scope of its development.”","His voice was soft, and he spoke slowly. “We also participated in this competition in the past years, but the results were not ideal.”","“?”","“There will be a selection competition before the group stages of this world’s software competition. The selection competition is mainly targeted at places with relatively less advanced technology. We have not achieved good results in these competitions before, so we can only start with the selection competition. There will be a total of 16 people participating in the selection competition, representing 16 regions.”","Ye Wangchuan stopped fiddling with his bracelet for a moment before continuing.","“Only two people among the 16 will enter the group stages. The real competition will begin from the group stages.”","“Only two out of 16?” Qin Si exploded. “This is f*cking unfair!”","Ye Wangchuan was calm. His eyebrows did not move, and his voice was slightly hoarse. “There is no absolute fairness in this world. Fairness is a rule set for the strong. The weak can only obey the other party’s rules!”"]},{"number":1208,"title":"Chapter 1208 - Top 16 Every Year, Getting Stronger Every Year","paragraphs":["Originally angry, Qin Si instantly cooled down when he heard this.","That’s true.","Domestic technology had always been inferior to the outside world. They had suffered a lot over the years.","Everyone held their breaths, wanting to amaze the world.","That was not true of everyone in the Ninth Branch.","He hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to be referring to this competition.","Qin Si took a long time to speak. “Then, where will this competition be held? It won’t be overseas, right?”","Ye Wangchuan knew more about this. “It was overseas in the past. But it’s a little special this year. The venue of the competition will be in the country.”","“?” Qin Si was about to ask why it wasn’t overseas this year.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what he was going to ask. The corners of his lips curled up slightly. He was quite reserved, but he could not hide the pride at the corners of his eyes. “Because of the rise of the domestic technology level in the past two years, in addition to the illegal region’s chip; Professor Jiang and the others announced the chip’s results to let the foreign people see the progress of the domestic technology level. Therefore, they set the venue for the competition in the country this time.","“It’s going to be held in a place she’s familiar with.”","Qin Si asked, “Where?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and slowly spat out a name. “Rao City.”","...","The next day, Qiao Nian brought her things to school early in the morning.","Many people came to sign up outside Liang Conglin’s office. Most of them were third- and fourth-year computer science students.","There were also some retention graduate students.","Everyone’s face glowed with youthful confidence.","Other than the computer science students, there were also students from other departments, such as computer science majors.","Zhou Yang and Fu Ge were also among these people.","However, unlike Fu Ge, Zhou Yang was not here to sign up for the competition. He was accompanying a friend from the Computer Science Department and happened to see Fu Ge there, so he greeted him and stood together to chat.","“Do you think we can do it this year?”","Fu Ge was a student in the Finance Department and was studying with Professor Cheng Wu. Finance contained knowledge about computers and advanced mathematics.","He was also a boy.","Boys were naturally more talented in science than girls.","Fu Ge’s results had always been top-notch since he was young. It was the same when he reached Qing University. His results in his specialization were definitely top-notch.","He had used his free time to create a small software. The level was passable. He happened to hear from Cheng Wu about this competition, so he wanted to try his luck.","Before coming, he had looked up information about the World Software Competition online and knew the general situation of the competition every year.","Domestic results had never been ideal.","Therefore, he replied calmly, “I don’t know.”","Zhou Yang pursed his lips and muttered softly when he heard this, “Don’t be like the previous years, getting into the top 16 in the selection every year and getting stronger every year!”","Fu Ge said nothing.","He didn’t hold out much hope.","It was just that this year was different from the previous years. This world-class competition was always held overseas.","But China was chosen this year for some reason.","It would be extremely embarrassing if they didn’t even enter the group stages.","There was another person in the crowd in addition to them. Among the large number of boys who came to register, the girls stood out.","Yin Wenzhi was still wearing a cotton dress. The style of the dress was old, but it was clean and tidy.","And she was tall and good-looking."]},{"number":1209,"title":"Chapter 1209 - The Chinese Medicine Faculty Is","paragraphs":["Zhou Yang noticed a junior among the applicants. “Oh, do you know that girl over there?”","Fu Ge was not interested in girls. He only took a look and found her familiar. He said, “I think she’s a freshman this year.”","He thought for a moment and added, “From the Chinese Medicine Faculty.”","He didn’t pay much attention to the girls in school. He just subconsciously paid attention to the people around Qiao Nian.","He had seen Yin Wenzhi around Qiao Nian a few times and found her familiar, so he recognized her.","“Oh.” Zhou Yang touched his head and said in a puzzled tone, “Why did a person from the Chinese Medicine Faculty come to sign up for the software competition?”","Zhou Yang realized that he had said something wrong after he finished speaking.","After all, Fu Ge was not a computer science major. So, he tried to smooth things over. “She probably has a specialty in this area. Junior girls nowadays are really awesome.”","It was obvious who the other one was.","Fu Ge did not speak. He stood there with a cold expression, waiting for the form to be handed over.","...","This competition was very valuable.","Mostly because it was a world-class competition.","All computer science students with some confidence wanted to give it a try, so many students came to sign up.","Other than Liang Conglin, there were also a few computer science teachers in the principal’s office.","They were mainly responsible for accepting students and recording their names.","Liang Conglin held the rosewood teapot and drank tea while standing at the side to watch the students enthusiastically sign up.","Initially, his attitude was very easygoing, as if he was not interested in the registration.","After all, Qing University had always been inferior to Nanjing University in terms of computing. In the past, the participants who represented the country were all students from Nanjing University.","Qing University... Every year, it was all about participation!","It would probably be the same this year.","He was used to it.","Until an arrogant figure appeared and handed a USB flash drive to the teacher. She said casually, “I want to sign up. I’m Qiao Nian from the Chinese Medicine Faculty.”","“Pfft!” Liang Conglin almost did not swallow a mouthful of tea. It was stuck in his throat, and he almost spat it out. He slapped his chest and coughed violently. “Cough, cough, cough!”","A few of the computer science teachers saw that his face was red from coughing and quickly brought him tissue paper.","Liang Conglin finally managed to swallow the saliva that was stuck in his throat. The redness on his face had yet to fade when he hurriedly widened his eyes and looked at the girl standing not far away calmly with her hands crossed. He felt extremely conflicted. “Uh... Qiao Nian, you’re participating?”","Qiao Nian looked at the USB flash drive that she had already put on the table. She seemed to think that he was talking nonsense, but she was still very polite. “Yes.”","“Aren’t you from the Chinese Medicine Faculty?” Liang Conglin could no longer drink his tea.","How free were Master Huang and Master Nie? They didn’t even have time to teach their disciples?","Qiao Nian looked at him with a puzzled expression and asked leisurely, “Can’t the Chinese Medicine Faculty participate in the competition?”","“Not really,” Liang Conglin denied immediately.","Several teachers in the Computer Science Department had heard that the top scorer of this year’s college entrance examination was very impressive, but they had never seen Qiao Nian in person.","Hearing Liang Conglin speak to Qiao Nian, they knew that she was the only child of the Chinese Medicine Faculty. Instantly, the way they looked at her changed.","A girl from the Chinese Medicine Faculty had also signed up for this software competition.","Here came another one.","The Chinese Medicine Faculty was going to defy the heavens this year!"]},{"number":1210,"title":"Chapter 1210 - Young Master Wen, Your Goddess Is Participating in the Competition","paragraphs":["A round-faced computer teacher turned around and asked Liang Conglin, “Principal, are you going to write this name?”","Liang Conglin looked at Qiao Nian and recalled what he had experienced in the illegal district. Without thinking, he narrowed his eyes and said, “Write it! Why wouldn’t I write it?”","Qiao Nian was going to participate in the competition. He was suddenly filled with confidence in this year’s software competition!","They had always been in the top 16 in the past. This year, they should enter the group stages, right?","Liang Conglin looked at the girl’s overly eye-catching face again and sighed in his heart. He wondered if their school would be chosen this year.","...","Qiao Nian handed in her software and registration form and left.","She didn’t stay long at the registration office.","The back view was cool and sassy.","On the other hand, Zhou Yang and the others were behind Yin Wenzhi. Seeing that Qiao Nian had signed up, Zhou Yang watched as she came over to sign up like the wind and left in a carefree manner.","After returning to Room 3306 with Fu Ge.","Seeing that Wen Ziyu had just returned from playing basketball in the dormitory, he said, “Young Master Wen, do you know who I saw today?”","Wen Ziyu had been in a bad mood these past few days and went to the field every day to train himself. He wore a sports band on his forehead and looked handsome. He threw the basketball into the basket, dragged the stool away, and sat down. “Oh, who did you meet?”","He knew that Zhou Yang had gone to the principal’s office with Fu Ge to sign up for the software competition. He was not interested in Fu Ge.","Unexpectedly, Zhou Yang said a name. “Your goddess, Qiao Nian.”","Wen Ziyu stood up and frowned. “Who are you talking about?”","“Your goddess, Qiao Nian, also signed up for this software competition. I didn’t expect her to know how to use a computer.”","Wen Ziyu hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to know how to use a computer.","His heart had been empty ever since he found out from his aunt that Qiao Nian was Zhui Guang on the day of the school’s anniversary celebration. For the first time, the insufferably arrogant Young Master Wen realized that there was a girl more awesome than him. He was already very disappointed.","He had mixed feelings upon discovering that Qiao Nian was going to participate in a world-class software competition. He couldn’t tell if he was happy or unhappy, but his feelings were quite complicated.","Zhou Yang was also a boy and saw that his reaction was not right.","Coming back to his senses, he roughly guessed what Wen Ziyu was thinking. He walked up to him and patted his shoulder to comfort him. “Aiya, don’t think too much. Qiao Nian is just going to register, not represent the school in the selection. Fu Ge also registered. Do you think your goddess’s computing skills are higher than Fu Ge’s?”","Wen Ziyu said nothing.","He was unhappy that Zhou Yang compared Qiao Nian with Fu Ge.","However, he had been friends with Fu Ge and had lived with him for a long time. He knew that Fu Ge’s computer skills were not bad. He was even better than some computer professionals.","He also liked to write software in his spare time.","He still wanted to enter Tian Chen Corporation in the future.","Qiao Nian was a Chinese medicine major and a freshman. Wen Ziyu really couldn’t bring himself to say that Qiao Nian could compare to Fu Ge.","“That’s why you shouldn’t think too much about it.” Zhou Yang patted his shoulder again and said naturally, “Anyway, the results will be out tonight. You’ll know when you see the list released on the school’s website.”","After the Qing University’s name list was selected, they would submit the competition software to the organizing committee together with the people selected from the hundreds of universities in the country.","In the end, only one person would be chosen to represent the country.","Zhou Yang said that the results would be out at night. Who knew that the results would come out even faster than that?"]},{"number":1211,"title":"Chapter 1211 - The Results Are Out","paragraphs":["In the principal’s office.","Several computer science teachers had already checked the homework handed in by the applicants in the order of registration.","Until the results came back.","Du Mingwei, the head of the Computer Science Department, was still in a daze.","Liang Conglin was more concerned about the “homework” that Qiao Nian had handed over. He was the last to check the software that Qiao Nian had handed over. After checking it, he sat there without saying a word. He was even more anxious than Du Mingwei. He placed a hand on the back of the chair, leaned forward, and hurriedly asked, “How is it?”","!!","Du Mingwei was speechless.","He stared at the desktop computer in front of him in a daze. His mind went blank for a long time.","“Teacher Du, how is it? Didn’t you read the software submitted by all the students? Whose software is our school going to submit this year?”","Silence ensued.","The other computer science teachers did not say anything, either. Their expressions were filled with doubt.","Liang Conglin became even more anxious.","He had just sent a message to Old Master Ye about Qiao Nian’s participation in the competition.","Old Master Ye even asked him about the results.","No one in the group said anything. He wasn’t sure. “So, who exactly was chosen this year?”","After Du Mingwei was in a daze for a long time, his expression was extremely complicated. He finally looked at Liang Conglin. His expression was simply amazing!","“Principal, are you sure Qiao Nian signed up for the Chinese Medicine Faculty?”","“?????”","“What do you mean?”","Du Mingwei looked at the software and felt uncomfortable. He said in a muffled voice, “Why is such a good seedling studying medicine!”","Liang Conglin: “???”","He couldn’t hold it in anymore and asked in a low voice, “Teacher Du, if you have anything to say, just say it. You stopped halfway. I don’t understand what you mean.”","Only then did Du Mingwei heave a sigh of relief. His expression relaxed slightly, but his expression was still very complicated. “Do you know what software Qiao Nian submitted?”","“What?”","“A downloader.","“She’s made a complete downloader that can speed things up. It’s twice as fast as the existing ones on the market, and it’s very small and portable.”","Du Mingwei couldn’t describe his excitement at this moment.","This was not a software that a freshman could create!","No, it should be said that even a mature technician might not have such skill and strength.","Most importantly, such a talented student was actually studying Chinese medicine?!","The few computer science teachers felt as if their hearts were being roasted on a fire. It was torture!","Such a good seedling was actually not from their computer science department.","Liang Conglin understood now. “You mean you’ve chosen Qiao Nian’s software?”","Du Mingwei made eye contact with the other teachers. He smiled bitterly at what he said first. “Do we have any other choice?”","This time, about 20 people from the Computer Science Department signed up.","Among them were many students they thought highly of.","Their software wasn’t bad. It performed at a normal level.","But that was all!","Compared to Qiao Nian’s software, they were all trash and not worth mentioning.","Liang Conglin was already mentally prepared. He knew that Qiao Nian might not be as simple as she looked. Since Qiao Nian knew the illegal district, it was normal for people from the Red Alliance to know how to use computers.","Unexpectedly, the moment Qiao Nian made her move, the professors from Qing University’s Computer Science Department all reacted as if they had found a treasure."]},{"number":1212,"title":"Chapter 1212 - A Slap in the Face","paragraphs":["He came back to his senses after his shock. “If you’re sure that you want to choose Qiao Nian, I’ll submit the name list. The organizing committee still has to review it. It might not work in the end.”","“Principal Liang, just you wait and see. The person representing the country in this competition will definitely be Qiao Nian!” Du Mingwei said. “The person that Nanjing University submitted this year is definitely not as good as Qiao Nian!”","Who could compete with Qiao Nian’s software?","No one could compare!","Including the Freshman King from Nanjing University next door this year. What was his name? He was also from Rao City. He seemed to be called Chen Yuan.","!!","But so what?","There was no contest!","At night, the Qing University website announced that Qiao Nian’s name was on the list they submitted. Qing University and Nanjing University were special.","They had two more spots than other universities.","Qing University submitted three names. The name list contained the names: Qiao Nian, Fu Ge, and Yin Wenzhi.","Qiao Nian’s name was at the top of the list.","The school network exploded when this result came out.","To put it bluntly, the World Software Competition was a computer science competition. In the end, none of the people on the list were from this major.","Two of them were freshmen from the Chinese Medicine Faculty!","That night, the Chinese Medicine Faculty had evening self-study.","Qiao Nian didn’t go.","But Song Tian, Zhou Moyan, and the others were all there.","They all congratulated Yin Wenzhi as she came in.","“I saw the list on the school website. Congratulations. You’ve been chosen.”","“Yeah, Junior. I didn’t know you were so good with computers. You actually beat a bunch of computer majors and got one of the three spots.”","Faced with the compliments of the seniors from the same department, Yin Wenzhi held a computer science book and appeared very calm.","“I was just lucky,” she said modestly.","“This doesn’t just depend on luck. You must pass the test to be chosen!” A senior flattered her.","Yin Wenzhi smiled faintly and found a seat alone. She said softly, “Qiao Nian was also selected. This list is only temporary. It’s not certain who will represent the country in the end. I’m already very honored to be selected by the school.”","She spoke easily.","Song Tian, who was sitting diagonally in front of her, rolled her eyes in disgust. She said bluntly, “That’s right. It’s just a list of candidates now. It’s not certain who will be able to participate in the competition in the end! Tonight is Professor Shen’s professional class. There’s no need for you to bring a computer book, right? Isn’t it possible? Then, let’s wait for the results before preparing. There’s no need to be so anxious!”","Yin Wenzhi’s face turned pale.","She dug her nails into the computer book. Her face turned pale after being mocked by Song Tian. She wanted to scold back, but she felt that it was demeaning to argue with someone like Song Tian.","Fortunately, Song Tian only mocked her a little and did not continue to make things difficult for her. She turned around and spoke to Zhou Moyan and the others.","Yin Wenzhi took a deep breath and suppressed the dissatisfaction in her heart. With a straight face, she returned to her usual cold appearance and focused on flipping through the books she had borrowed from the library.","She had never treated Qiao Nian as a competitor.","Apart from Fu Ge, whom she had worked hard to surpass, Qiao Nian was not worthy of being compared to her.","She suspected that Qiao Nian had only gotten on the list because she had used her connections.","Yin Wenzhi turned a page in frustration and forced herself to concentrate on the book again."]},{"number":1213,"title":"Chapter 1213 - The Little Demon King Becomes Sister Nian’s Little Puppy","paragraphs":["In any case, this name list had to be submitted. They wouldn’t choose Qiao Nian even if she couldn’t participate in the competition. At most, it would be someone from Nanjing University representing the country.","She was different from Qiao Nian. She would try her best to seize it as long as there was a chance.","So, regardless of the outcome, she definitely had to prepare in advance for the competition.","After all, the final list of participants representing the country would be announced in three days.","...","Qiao Nian, whom she was thinking about, was sitting in a hotpot restaurant in the central business district.","The bottom of the pot had just been delivered.","The waiter tactfully closed the door of the private room for them.","Ye Lan rolled up her sleeves and was about to pour drinks for the two of them when a little kid reacted much faster than her.","Before she could pour the drink, he grabbed the Coke bottle and struggled with his short legs to pour a cup. He immediately brought it to her and spoke with a sweet voice. “Sister, drink.”","Qiao Nian hadn’t seen the little guy in a long time. The indifference in her eyes faded when she looked at Ye Qichen.","The corners of her mouth turned up. She was obviously in a particularly good mood. “Thank you.”","“You’re welcome.” Ye Qichen’s fair and tender face was very obedient. He even poured a glass of Coke for Ye Lan and handed it over. “Grandma, your Coke.”","The little devil in the family never gave anyone a good time.","He usually only talked when he was happy.","If he was unhappy, he might not even reply if you whispered in his ear for an hour.","They had always pampered him.","It was only because of Ye Qichen’s lawless personality and the fact that he was born with dysentery that his personality was even stranger than children his age.","Ye Lan had never enjoyed the ‘protection’ of her biological grandson.","She immediately took the cup the little guy handed her with both hands and was flattered. “Chen Chen, what about you? Do you want me to get the waiter to give you that bib?”","Ye Qichen sat in his chair and looked at her silently. He sat upright, looking like a well-educated child.","“I don’t need a bib.”","He pursed his pink lips and stole a glance at Qiao Nian, then added awkwardly, “I won’t dirty my clothes.”","“Okay, okay, okay. You don’t need a bib.” Ye Lan had always doted on this grandson unconditionally. When he said he didn’t want it, Ye Lan immediately agreed.","Ye Qichen seemed to heave a sigh of relief. He then took the initiative to pick up some food for Qiao Nian.","Ye Lan could finally tell that this little ancestor of hers wasn’t suddenly sensible. It was mainly because Qiao Nian was here and he wanted to show off in front of her.","Seeing this, Ye Lan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. As she waited for the dishes to be cooked in the hotpot, she chatted with Qiao Nian. “I brought Chen Chen overseas for a checkup some time ago. Chen Chen’s left leg has started to develop normally. They said that Chen Chen will be like an ordinary child in the future and won’t suffer anymore!”","Ye Lan grew excited at the mention of this. Her eyes welled up as she looked at the girl and said, “Nian Nian, thank you.”","“Aunt Ye, don’t say that.” Qiao Nian wasn’t used to such things.","Ye Lan had spent some time with her and understood her personality. She smiled through her tears and stopped mentioning it. “That’s true. We’re all family. It’s too distant to talk about this.”","She said it especially smoothly.","Qiao Nian had been grilling a piece of tender beef in a clear soup pot. Hearing this, her fingers tightened around her chopsticks, but she didn’t deny it."]},{"number":1214,"title":"Chapter 1214 - I Want to Live With Qiao Nian","paragraphs":["Ye Lan changed the topic to the software competition.","She asked her some questions about it.","In the end, she was full of confidence. She smiled and said, “I’m sure you’ll be chosen!”","She paused again, with her own worries. “It’s just, it’s not necessarily a good thing that you were chosen. What if—”","This year, the competition would be held in the country. It would be embarrassing if they couldn’t even enter the group stages.","She didn’t want Qiao Nian to get involved in this mess, but she supported Qiao Nian’s decision unconditionally. “Forget it. It’s useless to think about this now. Let’s look at the final results first. If the person chosen is you, we can still make it in time.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian didn’t take the software competition to heart. Seeing that the beef in the pot was ready, she placed the tender beef in the tomato pot into the small bun bowl. Then, she raised her chin and said gently, “Hurry up and eat. There’s no chili in this.”","Ye Qichen’s obsidian eyes lit up as he nodded like a chicken pecking at rice. He immediately grabbed his chopsticks, afraid that Qiao Nian would think that he didn’t like it.","He took a bite first. With his mouth still wrapped in food, he mumbled, “Sister, eat too~”","Qiao Nian changed her posture and placed her hand on the chair. She sat sideways, not in a hurry to eat. “You eat first.”","Ye Lan looked at her grandson, who seemed to like Qiao Nian very much. She was a little depressed and a little helpless. She slowly said, “Chen Chen has been asking to come back every day because he misses you. Nian Nian, do you have time?”","Qiao Nian looked at her gently, as if waiting for her to speak.","Ye Lan held her forehead and shook her head. She couldn’t help but laugh. She was already so old, yet she still had to worry about her grandson after worrying about her daughter.","But she only had one eldest grandson, and he was the son left behind by her daughter’s difficult labor. She couldn’t bear to leave him alone.","Therefore, Ye Lan pulled a long face and said shamelessly, “Did Wangchuan tell you that Chen Chen wants to stay with you?","“What I’m considering is that you’ve just entered university and Chen Chen is still young. I’m afraid that he’ll be insensible and disturb you...”","Ye Qichen was sitting obediently in his seat, eating the beef that Qiao Nian had cooked for him. He suddenly put down his chopsticks when he heard his grandmother’s words and said with a serious expression, “I won’t disturb Sister!”","Qiao Nian looked at him.","The little guy’s face turned red again. He explained to Ye Lan angrily and shyly, “I won’t trouble you. Uncle Gu San is also there. I’ll trouble Uncle Gu San, not you.”","Didn’t he have another uncle?","Ye Qichen thought of his uncle and secretly pursed his lips. He would rather mention Gu San than Ye Wangchuan. The word ‘jealousy’ was almost written on his face.","He looked away and said in a muffled voice, “... Anyway, I won’t trouble Sister Nian.”","The little guy pursed his lips. His expression looked stubborn and pitiful.","Ye Lan’s heart twisted. She immediately put down her chopsticks and comforted him. “Aiyo, Grandma didn’t mean that. I’m not saying that you’re troublesome. I’m just worried that Nian Nian is only a freshman and she’ll be busy with her studies... Grandma didn’t say anything about you.”","“...” Ye Qichen didn’t say anything. He tugged at the seam of his pants and lowered his head. His eyes were red.","What did she mean by that? She just didn’t want him to live with his sister.","However, when they brought him out for rehabilitation, they had agreed that he could live with his sister as long as he was obedient and recovered early.","Only then did he agree to leave the country.","Or he would not leave!","In the end, he kept the agreement, but the elders refused to!","They were all liars!"]},{"number":1215,"title":"Chapter 1215 - Final Results in Three Days","paragraphs":["Ye Qichen felt aggrieved. He wanted to cry, but he gritted his teeth and endured it. He stubbornly refused to cry in front of his sister.","Qiao Nian watched as the little guy lowered his head and stopped eating. He didn’t cry, but she could tell that he was depressed. She felt helpless and amused. She asked the little guy softly when Ye Lan couldn’t coax him, “Do you really want to live with me? I may not have time to play with you.”","Ye Qichen suddenly raised his head. His eyes were still red, but their shape was beautiful. He had perfectly inherited the deep contours of the Ye family. His skin was fair and tender, and he was extremely cute. “... I can take care of myself!”","“You’re only five. Are you sure you can take care of yourself?”","Qiao Nian didn’t treat him like a child. She said with a serious expression, “I might not be able to take care of you when I’m busy. It’s not like you think that I won’t have time to play with you. I might not even notice that you haven’t eaten. Can you take care of yourself?”","She was speaking the truth.","She often forgot to eat when she was busy.","She couldn’t even remember to eat. How could she remember taking care of other people’s meals?","Ye Qichen was still a child and was still growing. This was a very real problem.","“Uncle Gu San will be there.” Ye Qichen had already thought of a countermeasure. He answered Qiao Nian’s questions fluently. “There’s still Uncle if Uncle Gu San isn’t there.”","He mentioned his uncle with great reluctance.","He was especially reluctant.","He was just short of writing “disdain” in his face.","In the end, he said quietly, “If Uncle Gu San and Uncle are not around, I still have my phone. I’ll call Grandma. I can take care of myself.”","Ye Lan’s heart ached. Therefore, in his little ancestor’s heart, Gu San was greater than Ye Wangchuan... Ye Wangchuan was greater than her...","His biological grandmother was actually in last place!","Ye Lan put away her broken heart and looked up again. She sat upright and said to the girl sitting opposite her, “Nian Nian, forget it if you’re busy. I’ll tell Chen Chen that you don’t have to make do with him.”","Ye Qichen’s big eyes dimmed.","He was indignant, but he couldn’t bear to make things difficult for Qiao Nian. He held back his words.","Seeing his eyes darken, Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at Ye Lan. “It’s fine. I’m not particularly busy. He can follow me if he wants to. I’m just worried that I won’t be able to take care of him.”","Ye Lan didn’t expect her to agree. She was pleasantly surprised. “It’s alright! Chen Chen has the little genius phone?watch 1 . He’ll call me if he needs anything. Just help me keep an eye on him when you’re free.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian picked up her chopsticks and chose another potato slice. She placed it into the tomato pot and agreed.","“I’ll try.”","Seeing that she had placed potato chips in Chen Chen’s bowl, Ye Lan was initially a little worried that he would not be able to take good care of the two young people living with Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian. Now that she saw Qiao Nian’s smooth and natural actions, the last worry in her heart disappeared.","Then, she remembered that Qiao Nian was going to participate in the competition. “Nian Nian, when will the results of this software competition be out?”","“It seems to be in three days.”","Qiao Nian began to cook her tripe again. The red oil in the pot was boiling hot, and the spicy and fresh flavor stimulated her taste buds, greatly increasing her appetite.","Qiao Nian had always liked spicy food, and she ate it with Ye Lan and the little boy.","Therefore, she was exceptionally relaxed and her sitting posture was not so upright. Her arms were loosely draped over the chair and her long legs were crossed under the table. She looked quite casual."]},{"number":1216,"title":"Chapter 1216 - Wen Ziyu Was Beaten Up","paragraphs":["Ye Lan liked how relaxed she was in front of him. Smiling, she leaned back and relaxed. “Remember to inform me when the results are out.”","Qiao Nian had just finished cooking the piece of tripe. She picked it up, looking relaxed and confident. “Okay.”","...","Three days later, the results of the World Software Competition were out.","A shocking event happened.","!!","In the past, the students from the Computing faculty of Nanjing University would represent the country to participate in the competition, but not this year.","It was Qing University that would be representing the country!","One had to know that the Computing faculty of Qing University had always lost to Nanjing University’s Computing faculty. The two schools were not on the same level at all.","This time, the organizing committee did not want the students from Nanjing University. It was already surprising enough that they chose the students from Qing University to participate in the competition.","What was even more shocking was that the person chosen by the organizing committee was not a Computer Science student!","The other party was from the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","And a freshman at that!","The news quickly spread to all the universities as soon as the final results were out, especially Qing University and Nanjing University. Everyone competed for this spot every year. This year, Qing University made a huge comeback. The students of Nanjing University also wanted to find out who Qiao Nian was.","In Room 3306 for boys.","Zhou Yang was the first to hear the news. He immediately told the others, “Damn, the person chosen this time is Qiao Nian.”","“Qiao Nian?” Another person lying on the top bunk immediately glanced at Wen Ziyu. “Are you saying that Young Master Wen’s goddess has been chosen?”","The basketball in Wen Ziyu’s arms fell to the ground. He forgot to pick it up and stood rooted to the ground in a daze.","Zhou Yang patted his shoulder and congratulated him with a smile. “Young Master Wen, congratulations. Your goddess has been selected. I thought that someone from Nanjing University would be chosen again this year. I didn’t expect her to be chosen.”","Unfortunately, Qiao Nian wasn’t from the Computing faculty.","There was a lot of talk outside now, and quite a few conspiracy theories.","Zhou Yang did not think too much about it. He said simply, “I hope that we can enter the group stages this year and not stop at the top 16 of the preliminaries.”","Wen Ziyu’s mind was buzzing, and he didn’t even hear what he said clearly. He pushed away the hand on his shoulder in annoyance and said in a low voice, “I’m going out to make a call.”","He was going to call his aunt and ask what was going on.","It was fine that Qiao Nian was Zhui Guang.","But now she had been selected for the World Software Competition.","For a moment, he couldn’t accept the difference. It was like someone you thought was right next to you suddenly became someone you couldn’t climb over. The sense of loss was worse than death.","Wen Ziyu strode out of the dormitory.","Fu Ge came in with a dark expression and dropped the professional book he was carrying on the table. He pulled out a stool and sat in front of the laptop. He turned it on but didn’t move from his chair.","Zhou Yang had just gossiped to everyone about Qiao Nian winning the competition.","Everyone in the dormitory understood. No one went to provoke Fu Ge at this time. They tacitly found something to do and pretended to be busy.","Fu Ge sat in front of the computer in a daze for 10 minutes.","Finally, the phone he’d dropped on the table rang.","Fu Ge finally reacted. His eyelashes fluttered and he picked up his phone expressionlessly. It was a message from an unknown number.","The content of the message was very straightforward. It said bluntly that she suspected that there was something shady about the results of the selection and asked Fu Ge if he wanted to make a scene.","Fu Ge deleted the message before he finished reading it."]},{"number":1217,"title":"Chapter 1217 - Tired of Such Lowly Means","paragraphs":["He threw the phone on the desk, his handsome face showing disgust and contempt.","The new number used by the other party did not reveal its name.","But he knew who had sent him the message—Yin Wenzhi!","The girl from the Chinese Medicine Faculty who was nominated with him.","The other party thought that she was smart enough to buy a new phone number online and send a message to hide her identity. In fact, she was just ignorant.","!!","For people like them, they could find her as long as they paid someone to check the IP location of the message.","However, Fu Ge did not want to care this time.","He was getting tired of people like Yin Wenzhi.","It was as if he was playing with the people around him like they were fools. Actually, he did not know that he was the fool in the eyes of the people around him!","He switched on his computer.","He just wanted to look up information online.","Unexpectedly, the portal happened to give him a headline.","[A dark horse emerged from the World Software Competition. An 18-year-old girl created new scientific research results!]","Fu Ge frowned and clicked on the news item.","He entered the website and took a look. On it was a detailed introduction of what the World Software Competition was like. Immediately after, it was written that the organizing committee had released Qiao Nian’s software on a professional website half an hour ago. The downloader Qiao Nian made was faster and smaller than the ones on the market.","Fu Ge took a deep breath.","He opened the website and entered the website mentioned in the news. Then, he saw the software that Qiao Nian had created.","He downloaded it and tried it.","Three minutes later, Fu Ge took his hands off the keyboard and covered his eyes with one hand. He looked disheveled for the first time!","He was wrong.","Really wrong.","Why did he think that Qiao Nian was inferior to Qiao Chen back then?!","Before seeing the software that Qiao Nian had submitted, he could still lie to himself that the matter might really be as Yin Wenzhi had told him in the message. Qiao Nian had been able to win the competition purely because of Ye Wangchuan’s connections.","However, he realized that he was wrong after trying the software that Qiao Nian had created.","Qiao Nian had won generously!","She had crushed them with her strength and obtained the only spot!","Fu Ge uncovered his face and smiled again after a moment of bitterness.","Before he returned to the dormitory, he bumped into Wen Ziyu, who had rushed out downstairs. Wen Ziyu was on the phone with someone and seemed to be in a very bad mood.","At this moment, he deeply understood why Wen Ziyu was in a bad mood.","Like him, he probably realized that he would never be able to catch up to Qiao Nian in this lifetime!","However, Fu Ge smiled and clenched his fists again. He suddenly couldn’t laugh anymore.","Wen Ziyu had never managed to woo Qiao Nian. He had picked up the seed and lost the watermelon.","The self-deprecating smile on Fu Ge’s face disappeared completely in an instant. He sat back in his chair and returned to his expressionless state.","Zhou Yang looked at him and couldn’t help but whisper to the others, “Crazy, crazy. Young Master Wen has just gone crazy, and another one has gone crazy here.”","But Fu Ge wasn’t listening to a word.","Yes, he was crazy. So what if he was? There was no medicine for regret in this world. He wouldn’t have a chance to regret it.","Meanwhile, at Lan Pavilion.","Jiang Xianrou’s expression darkened when she saw the news online that Qiao Nian had been chosen to participate in the World Software Competition.","“What are you looking at?” Jiang Yao noticed that she didn’t look well, as if she had encountered something difficult."]},{"number":1218,"title":"Chapter 1218 - Exposed on the Spot","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou hid her phone without a trace and forced a smile. She said absent-mindedly, “Nothing. It’s a message from the school.”","She changed the topic perfunctorily. “By the way, why isn’t Brother Xu with you today?”","Jiang Yao saw that her face was pale and her eyes were wandering, but he didn’t think too much about it. He just thought that something bad had happened to her school. He leaned back in his chair and replied casually, “Did you say Xu Jishen? He went to pick up his grandfather.”","“Old Master Su?” Jiang Xianrou asked with concern.","Jiang Yao didn’t hide it from her and nodded. “He said that his grandfather has an important friend in Beijing, so he especially took the time to come and see him.”","!!","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t help but recall what happened at Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet.","She remembered very clearly that Zhang Yang had mentioned in the group chat that Old Master Su had also attended Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet!","Could the important friend that Old Master Su wanted to meet in Beijing be... Qiao Nian?","She felt short of breath just thinking about it.","Jiang Yao saw that her expression was getting uglier and uglier. He frowned and asked with concern, “Xianrou, are you really alright? You look pale. Do you want to go to the hospital?”","“No need.” Jiang Xianrou pressed her hand on the chair and took a deep breath. She explained reluctantly, “I’ve been busy with changing majors recently. I might be too tired.”","Jiang Yao had heard her mention how Qiao Nian had offended the Wei family and Wei Ying, causing Liang Lu to be suspended. His frown deepened, but he didn’t say anything.","He wanted to make Jiang Xianrou happy and change the topic to talk about the World Software Competition that was going to be held in China.","Suddenly, his phone lit up.","Jiang Yao was interrupted. He picked up his phone impatiently and saw that it was actually a WeChat message from Xu Jishen.","[How many people in Qing University are called Qiao Nian?]","??","Jiang Yao was dumbfounded.","His long fingers tapped the editor as he returned the question. [Why are you asking?]","Xu Jishen quickly sent another message.","[You don’t know?]","Jiang Yao frowned. He didn’t know what to reply, and the other party was already typing another message.","Soon another message came in.","[You don’t know that the name of the person representing our country in participating in the World Software Competition is exactly the same as your cousin’s. Her name is also Qiao Nian. Coincidentally, they’re both Qing University students. I thought they were the same person, so I’m asking you.]","—You don’t know that the girl representing our country in the World Software Competition has the same name as your cousin. Her name is Qiao Nian, and they are both Qing University students.","Jiang Yao couldn’t believe what he was reading. He confirmed it several times to make sure that he was not mistaken.","Xu Jishen was talking about Qiao Nian.","He recalled that Jiang Xianrou had been playing with her phone and her expression had suddenly changed. He didn’t reply to Xu Jishen’s WeChat message. Instead, he raised his head and stared at the girl opposite him with a complicated gaze.","After a long while hesitating, he finally asked, “Xianrou, do you know about the World Software Competition?”","There was some silence.","Jiang Xianrou had finally calmed down, but now she was provoked again. She was agitated and her expression was ugly.","Jiang Yao didn’t know how tense Qiao Nian was with her family. He asked her again, “Xu Jishen just sent me a message saying that Qiao Nian has won this year’s spot.”","Jiang Xianrou’s body stiffened as she took a deep breath. “I also saw the message the school sent me just now.”","Jiang Yao frowned. He was about to ask her why she hid it from him when he asked her just now."]},{"number":1219,"title":"Chapter 1219 - You Said She Got Someone to Develop This Software?","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou pursed her lips in disdain and said with a cold gaze, “What kind of software does she know? She definitely asked Qin Si and the others for help and found someone to develop it for her.”","Jiang Yao was a little surprised. “You said that she got someone to help her with the competition software?”","“Where else would a high school student from Rao City go to learn software development?” Jiang Xianrou was in a bad mood. She fiddled with the coffee cup on the table, knocking it loudly. She didn’t want to hide her disgust for Qiao Nian at all. “Brother, just watch. She just wants to show off.”","She was waiting for the day when Qiao Nian would fall from her high pedestal!","Jiang Yao’s impression of his cousin was formed because Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou would mention Qiao Nian’s actions to him from time to time.","!!","He had no ill intentions towards her. In fact, he had always treated Qiao Nian as family. It was just that he could not stand her actions.","At this moment, he felt a strong disgust for his cousin whom he had yet to officially meet upon hearing Jiang Xianrou’s words.","The World Software Competition was such an important competition!","This not only concerned her personal honor, but also the country’s honor. How could Qiao Nian do such a thing?","Jiang Yao frowned and stopped talking. He did not reply to Jiang Li’s message about having dinner with Qiao Nian another day.","...","At night.","Qiao Nian had dinner with Su Huaiyuan and called Jiang Li along.","The dinner venue was a restaurant in the hotel where Su Huaiyuan was staying. The guests were all happy with the meal.","After all, Su Huaiyuan was old and had taken a few hours to fly over. During dinner, he forced himself to chat with Qiao Nian.","After dinner, he quickly became dispirited. Qiao Nian asked him to return to his room to rest. They would meet again another day.","She was in no hurry to leave after Su Huaiyuan left. After asking the waiter for another cup of tea, she rested her fingers on the teacup and looked up at the person who had been distracted all night. “Where are you going next?”","“Ah?”","Jiang Li spent all night on his cell phone.","Hearing the girl talk to him, he looked up from the phone and met the girl’s clear black eyes. He looked away in a sorry state. “Me? I’ll go back to my apartment.”","Jiang Li took a deep breath and mustered his courage. He looked at the girl in front of him and asked with concern, “What about you, Nian Nian? Are you going back to stay with Master Wang?”","“Mm.” The tea leaves in Qiao Nian’s teacup floated up and down. She calmly picked up her teacup and took a sip, then said, “Gu San will pick me up later. Do you want me to send you back?”","Jiang Li’s celebrity status meant that it would be inconvenient for him to take a taxi. It would be very troublesome if he was recognized. He was afraid that he would drink tonight and so did not drive here.","Qiao Nian glanced at her cell phone. It was already 9:30 PM.","It was too late for Jiang Li to call his manager to pick him up.","She looked up and said warmly, “I’ll ask Gu San if you want.”","Jiang Li listened to her natural voice and looked at the girl’s cold expression. In fact, she was hiding her concern for him. He felt uncomfortable.","Jiang Li pursed his lips and touched the lighter in his pocket. He wanted to smoke. Then, he looked at the girl sitting opposite him. She looked listless. He silently took his hand off the lighter. “Nian Nian, I’m sorry.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows.","What was wrong with him?","Jiang Li was someone who couldn’t hide anything. He told her everything."]},{"number":1220,"title":"Chapter 1220 - Weakness and Armor","paragraphs":["For example, the eldest brother of the Jiang family had returned from the illegal district.","Also, before he asked Qiao Nian out for dinner today, he had contacted Jiang Yao and asked him to come out with him. In the end, Jiang Yao didn’t answer his calls or reply to his messages the entire night.","Besides that, he was distracted the entire night and kept contacting Jiang Yao. In the end, he still couldn’t contact Jiang Yao even after Old Master Su went upstairs to rest.","Jiang Li lowered his head. He couldn’t raise his head in front of Qiao Nian. He covered his head with his hand and said with disgust, “I don’t know what’s wrong with Big Brother. He wasn’t like this in the past! Jiang Xianrou might have said something to him. He...”","Jiang Li was so annoyed that he couldn’t continue.","!!","What the f*ck was going on!","Were he and Dad the only normal people in the family?","It was one thing for Jiang Xianrou to be muddle-headed, but her mother also caused a ruckus at home.","It was not easy for his big brother to come back. Big Brother also followed Jiang Xianrou and the others to ostracize Nian Nian. Their brains were caught in the crack of the door!","The family just had to fight like enemies.","Would they only stop when everyone had turned against each other?","Jiang Li felt wronged and depressed, but he couldn’t find an outlet.","What could he say?","Tang Wanru was his biological mother.","Jiang Xianrou was his biological sister!","Jiang Yao was his biological brother!","He couldn’t possibly scold them, right?","Forget about Jiang Xianrou. She was younger than him. It was fine if he scolded her.","But his own mother and his elder brother were treating Qiao Nian the same way. He was sandwiched in the middle.","“He’s different from Jiang Xianrou.”","Jiang Li racked his brains for a long time before finding such an adjective. “He must have been deceived by her. When he understands you, he will know that you’re not the kind of person they say you are...”","Qiao Nian quietly listened to him explain the entire situation with an understanding expression.","She knew it. Jiang Li had called her excitedly and said that he would bring a friend over tonight. In the end, he came alone and then buried his head in his phone unhappily. So that was what happened.","Qiao Nian was already used to such things. She placed her hand on the chair and said calmly, “It’s fine if they don’t understand. Let’s leave it at that.”","Jiang Li suddenly looked up. He wanted to say something but hesitated. He didn’t know if Qiao Nian understood the hidden meaning in his words.","He pursed his lips and thought of the terrible things at home. He only said, “Nian Nian, no matter what happens, I’ll always be on your side! You just have to remember that no matter what, Grandpa, Uncle, and I are on your side!”","Jiang Li took another deep breath and his eyes gradually became firm. “Don’t worry too much about Jiang Yao. I’ll talk to him when we get back. Forget it if he doesn’t want to listen. It’s his loss that he doesn’t want to know you, not yours!","“As for Jiang Xianrou...”","Mentioning his sister, a thousand words surged into his heart and disappeared, and he said in disgust, “Don’t bother with her in the future.”","Initially, Qiao Nian had not taken Jiang Yao’s arrival to heart. To put it bluntly, putting aside their blood ties, he was just a stranger to her.","Jiang Yao chose to stand on Jiang Xianrou’s side and rejected her. Logically speaking, it made sense.","She did not care what he thought.","However, Qiao Nian’s heart still skipped a beat when she heard what Jiang Li said. Her chest seemed to be filled with warmth.","It wasn’t so uncaring and cold anymore.","This feeling was the same as what she got from the little bun and Ye Wangchuan. It always made her feel that in the future, she had one more weakness and one more armor!"]},{"number":1221,"title":"Chapter 1221 - I Have a Competition Three Days","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian was not good at expressing her feelings.","Her eyes darkened for a moment. It looked like she was just changing positions. She raised her wrist, picked up the cup, and put it down again. Her expression was still the same, but her voice was clearly a little huskier than before. “Yes, I know.”","Jiang Li was slightly relieved. “It’s good that you know. Don’t think too much. No matter what, there are people in the family who support you. You’re not alone.”","“...Mm.” Qiao Nian looked at Jiang Li and said in a casual but serious tone, “Brother, I have a competition in three days. Remember to watch it when you have time.”","“Nian Nian, what did you call me...” Jiang Li did not wait for the girl to answer him. He smiled, revealing a row of white teeth, and waved his hand. “Forget it, forget it. Don’t answer. I’m a little happy.”","Tsk!","Qiao Nian just called him Brother!","Nian Nian had always been on good terms with him, but to be honest, the number of times she called him Brother could be counted on one hand.","Not many times in all.","Moreover, when they first met, Qiao Nian restrained herself and forced herself to call him that once or twice.","Jiang Li was in a good mood and did not want to think about Jiang Yao and Jiang Xianrou anymore. He looked at the girl with sparkling eyes and asked, “In three days, right?”","A little embarrassed, Qiao Nian picked up her teacup and covered her mouth uncomfortably. “Yes, there’s a software competition in three days. I’ve signed up for it.”","“I have a job that day. I’ll be shooting the cover for a magazine.” Jiang Li didn’t even ask Qiao Nian about the level of the competition. Whether it was important or not, he immediately reached for his cell phone. While talking to Qiao Nian, he had already sent a message to his manager to ask him to free up that day.","Second Young Master Jiang was the young master of the entertainment industry.","He had just accidentally become a top celebrity.","He sent a message to his company and willfully tossed his cell phone on the table. “Okay, I told them I’m not going.”","He was so fast that Qiao Nian didn’t even have time to stop him. Seeing his ferocious movements, the corners of her mouth twitched. “Three in the afternoon.”","“Where is it?”","“It’s an online competition, you can watch it on your computer. I’ll install an app for you then,” Qiao Nian said calmly.","There was no venue for the World Software Competition’s qualifying rounds.","Only after passing the qualifiers and obtaining the qualifications for the group stages would they go offline to compete.","The qualifying round was held online.","The organizers would prepare a special room with a prepared professional computer and nothing else except programming software.","In addition, special staff would monitor you to prevent you from carrying external software.","Security cameras would be installed in the room, too!","Anyone who tried to cheat would immediately be caught.","In short, the World Software Competition was a world-class competition. The offline competition was strict even if it was just a qualifying round.","“You’re talking about live-streaming the competition on the computer?”","Jiang Li was in the entertainment industry, not the technology industry. He did not understand what Qiao Nian was saying at all. He was dumbfounded.","Why didn’t they book a venue for the competition? Did they not set up a venue for spectators to buy tickets to watch it?","Qiao Nian guessed that he did not know the specifications of the software competition. She nodded and did not elaborate. “Sort of. 16 people will compete together and one will get through to the next round.”","Jiang Li looked like he had seen a ghost. “Choose one out of 16 people? Damn, they’re so ruthless.”"]},{"number":1222,"title":"Chapter 1222 - The Day of the Competition","paragraphs":["“This competition has always been a big one.”","Qiao Nian’s cell phone lit up after she finished speaking. Gu San was calling. He and Ye Wangchuan were probably already waiting for her outside. Qiao Nian picked up her cell phone, pulled out her chair, and said to Jiang Li, “Let’s go. I’ll go to your place and install the software for you.”","“Okay.”","Jiang Li picked up his jacket and got up to follow her.","...","Qiao Nian wanted to participate in the competition.","Rhine Apartments had been much quieter these days.","Whether it was Qin Si or Jiang Li, everyone knew that Qiao Nian was participating in the competition. Basically, no one would come to the apartment to disturb her.","Qiao Nian also focused on preparing for the competition.","For the next three days, she basically watched the videos of the previous competitions in her room.","The qualifying round was not a group competition.","Hence, the theme of the qualifying round was different every year. They would first give contestants a theme and then let them develop softwares according to it.","The theme was different every year.","No one knew what theme would be chosen this year.","Ever since Qiao Nian made it clear that she was going to be participating, the domestic software organization had sent her many possible themes on WeChat.","For example, recently popular live-stream softwares.","Accelerators.","Communication systems.","Qiao Nian took a look at them one by one. She also marked down the questions based on the theme of the previous competitions. She chose two popular topics and made preparations in advance.","September 8th.","The weather in Beijing was clear and cloudless.","Qing University was the same as usual. Students were in class or having their allocated recess breaks.","However, the teachers of the various departments were in a completely different state from the students. All of them were tense.","Cars had been driving into the campus since nine in the morning. People in formal business attire entered an arts building next door to the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","Someone else saw the staff carry computers in.","Yin Wenzhi studied advanced mathematics in her first year of high school. She woke up early and went to the school canteen to eat. She passed the school building with her books and bumped into a few students walking toward her. They were discussing happily.","“I just saw that the school’s security guards have sealed off the arts building beside the Chinese Medicine Faculty. They won’t let anyone inside in the morning.”","“I know about that. A freshman was selected for the World Software Competition. I heard that the qualifiers are held online. In order to prevent the contestants from cheating, they sealed off the arts building to prevent anyone from entering.”","“This competition seems to be held in China this year. Our school will be proud if that freshman can enter the group stage!”","“That’s right. Nanjing University next door is compared to our Computer Science Department every year. If our school gets results in this competition...”","Yin Wenzhi subconsciously tightened her grip on the book in her hands when she heard someone mention Qiao Nian and the Chinese Medicine Faculty, almost wrinkling it.","Her face was sallow, and there were heavy dark circles under her eyes. It was obvious that she had not rested well in the past few days.","Her face was so dark that it looked like she could squeeze water out of it. She looked coldly at the sealed arts building not far away and bit her lip.","She was also shortlisted for the competition, but in the end, the organizing committee chose Qiao Nian but not her. Now, the school was discussing this matter everywhere. No one remembered her name when the competition was mentioned.","No one remembered that she was also from the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","She was also a freshman!","One of the three people selected by the school was her!","Yin Wenzhi gritted her teeth so hard that they almost shattered. She stood in place and took out an old-fashioned cell phone with worn edges.","She wanted to check for notifications.","But, there were none.","Not a single one!"]},{"number":1223,"title":"Chapter 1223 - She Felt Aggrieved and Found It Unfair","paragraphs":["The message she sent to Fu Ge was like a stone sinking into the sea. From the day she sent it, she had not received any reply.","She did not hear that he had caused trouble in school.","Yin Wenzhi’s expression was ruthless, and her eyes gradually turned cold. The corners of her mouth twitched, and she sneered before hiding her cell phone again.","She knew why Fu Ge was afraid to make a scene.","The last time she saw Qiao Nian’s “boyfriend” picking her up, she did not recognize the car logo. However, she had checked the price online.","!!","It was just over eight million yuan.","Eight million. She had never seen so much money in her life. In her town, anyone with eight million in savings was definitely one of the richest people in town.","Qiao Nian’s boyfriend’s car cost eight million yuan. She had read online that one might not be able to buy this car even with the money.","Because that car was a limited edition. Anyway, ordinary people could not drive it casually.","Those who could afford that kind of car were not ordinary people.","Fu Ge had made it clear that he did not dare to provoke Qiao Nian’s ‘boyfriend’. That was why he had admitted defeat and cowered like a turtle, not daring to say a word.","While feeling uncomfortable, Yin Wenzhi bit her lip and felt quite sad and pathetic.","It was because she was like Fu Ge. Wasn’t it also because she was afraid to cause trouble that she was so aggrieved and let others snatch the opportunity that belonged to her?","She was a poor child from a small town. She had no money or background. What else could she do other than endure such a thing?","A look of sorrow appeared in Yin Wenzhi’s eyes, but she also felt that she was a rare talent. Like Qiao Nian, she came from a small county.","She was a rare species.","Qiao Nian had only done a little better than her and was a little prettier than her. She wasn’t bad-looking, and her results were not bad either. In fact, she was even more hardworking. Why was there such a huge difference in fate between people?!","“Why are you here?” Yin Wenzhi stood in front of the school building in a daze, holding her books. The more she thought about it, the sadder she became and the more tears welled up in her eyes.","Just then, someone called out to her from behind.","She turned around and saw a familiar face. It was Zhou Moyan and her friend.","“Moyan, who is this?” A sloppy boy had one hand on Zhou Moyan’s shoulder as he sized her up with a teasing and slightly stunned gaze.","He looked like he was up to no good.","Zhou Moyan pushed the other party’s hand away in annoyance and said, “My classmate. We’re from the same faculty.”","Then, she turned and asked Yin Wenzhi, “Why are you here?”","She frowned and pursed her lips upon seeing that the corners of her eyes were red and she was still wearing the cotton dress. Her voice softened as she asked, “Are you okay?”","Yin Wenzhi shook her head. She was in a bad mood and did not want to talk much with them, so she just said, “I’m fine.”","“Moyan, we’ve already bumped into each other. Introduce us.” As soon as she finished speaking, the boy spoke casually again. His tone was frivolous and glib.","Yin Wenzhi frowned unhappily, and her expression darkened. On Zhou Moyan’s account, she did not immediately leave.","The other party kept pestering her with questions, so Zhou Moyan could not ignore him completely. She casually introduced, “Yin Wenzhi.”","She then said to the girl, “This is Zhu Yuanhao, my friend.”","Yin Wenzhi only wanted to leave quickly, so she just greeted the other party perfunctorily. Since the other party insisted on adding her on WeChat, she added him out of courtesy.","After she parted ways with the two of them.","Yin Wenzhi wanted to delete the new person on WeChat, but she stopped when she saw the other party’s profile picture."]},{"number":1224,"title":"Chapter 1224 - Master Wang Booked a Private Room","paragraphs":["Zhou Moyan’s friend’s profile picture was very exaggerated. It was as greasy and frivolous as the person himself.","But a car was parked behind the man.","She immediately recognized the car as the same model as the one Qiao Nian’s ‘boyfriend’ was driving. She recalled the price of the car and remembered that Song Tian had told her about Zhou Moyan’s family background. This Zhu Yuanhao seemed to be in the same circle as Qiao Nian and her group...","Yin Wenzhi’s gaze darkened and she bit her lip.","She wanted to delete the other party’s WeChat, but after hesitating, she pressed the cancel button.","!!","...","At this moment, at Lan Pavilion.","Ye Wangchuan had booked a private room. The people from the same circle as him had all come.","Qin Si got a LED liquid crystal screen computer and placed it on the table.","A group of people from the top circle of Beijing sat around the LED display screen.","The waiter was careful not to disturb them when he brought in the tea. After all, he couldn’t afford to offend anyone in this private room.","Zhang Yang had become familiar with Qin Si recently. He was not as nervous as Tang Ning and the others. His shoulders relaxed as he carried a plate of fruits over and placed it in front of Ye Wangchuan and Qin Si.","Then, he asked Qin Si softly, “Young Master Qin, Miss Qiao’s competition hasn’t started yet?”","Qin Si had recently gotten a tinfoil perm. His hair was messy and fluffy, making him look like a rich second-generation heir.","Today, he was wearing suit pants and a checkered shirt. The shirt was half pressed into his suit pants. He leaned back on the couch, his gaze never leaving the computer screen. “Soon, I think. Master Wang said it starts at three.”","“Oh, that’s soon.” Zhang Yang raised his forearm and pulled his sleeve to look at the time on his wristwatch. “10 minutes to three o’clock.”","“Mm.” Qin Si finally moved his gaze away from the LED screen. He bent down and picked up an orange, peeled it, and asked the man beside him, “Master Wang, do you want an orange?”","Ye Wangchuan placed his long legs on the coffee table. Not interested in the orange the other party handed him, he replied with a low and hoarse voice, “No.”","“You really don’t want it? Before Sister Qiao’s competition begins, it’s good that we eat an orange to calm our nerves. You actually don’t want it?” Qin Si took it away in disinterest. “Forget it, I’ll eat it myself!”","He threw a piece of orange into his mouth. A sour smell rose and Qin Si hurriedly spat the orange out.","He cursed, “Damn, are the fruits in Lan Pavilion so bad today? Who bought the orange? It’s so f*cking sour!”","Zhang Yang immediately handed him a bottle of mineral water. “Do you want me to call the manager over to ask?”","Qin Si quickly snatched the glass of water from him and gulped it down. Only then did he suppress the sour taste in his mouth. He looked at the time on the blue light display and shook his head. “Forget it. The competition is about to begin. It’s not a big deal. I can’t be bothered.”","Ye Wangchuan wasn’t the only one present today. Bo Jingxing, who rarely appeared in Beijing, was also present.","Tang Ning and the other new thugs did not dare to speak at all. All of them were tense.","No one dared to ask why Master Wang did not call Jiang Xianrou over today.","Although no one knew the relationship between Jiang Xianrou and Qiao Nian, they could roughly tell that Master Wang’s girlfriend was not close to her.","No one dared to court death at a time like this.","Tang Ning was the smartest. She took the initiative to mention Qiao Nian. “Speaking of which, I heard that Miss Qiao was good with computers when I was in Rao City. I didn’t expect her to represent our country in the competition this time.”"]},{"number":1225,"title":"Chapter 1225 - If You Want to Wear a Crown, You Must Bear Its Heaviness!","paragraphs":["“Heh.” Qin Si glanced at her, making Tang Ning nervous. Afraid that she would say something wrong, she pursed her red lips and carefully observed his expression.","Qin Si only laughed and casually threw the orange on the table. He crossed his legs and said in an unfathomable tone, “There are many things you didn’t expect!”","At first, Tang Ning thought that Qin Si was dissatisfied with her words and was so nervous that she did not reply.","She observed the other party’s demeanor and saw that he seemed to have no deeper meaning. Then, she smiled in relief and said, “That’s true. Miss Qiao always surprises people.”","For example, she had never thought that Qiao Nian would be able to reach her current state after parting with the Qiao family. She was now being praised by this group of people in the top circle in Beijing.","!!","She was doing better than Jiang Xianrou.","Back then, Qiao Nian was just an inconspicuous high school student in Rao City. Her grandmother never took her seriously then.","It had only been a year.","Over a year their positions were reversed.","Qiao Nian was already beyond their reach.","Even she could only look up to her.","Tang Ning thought about it. Putting aside the fact that the Tang family had offended Qiao Nian and was almost dealt with, she personally liked Qiao Nian.","Live real.","Even with Ye Wangchuan’s backing, she had never seen Qiao Nian bully anyone. She was many times better than Jiang Xianrou.","Tang Ning narrowed her eyes and took out a lady’s cigarette. Searching for a lighter but not finding it, she gave up smoking and put the cigarette back. Then, she turned to look at the huge LED screen and secretly felt worried for Qiao Nian.","She had privately learned about the World Software Competition.","A world-class competition.","So far, no one in the country had qualified for the group stages!","Qiao Nian would have to bear the pressure of public opinion if she wanted to represent the country in this competition.","If one wanted to put on a crown, they would have to bear its weight. This was a competition that had to be won!","Tang Ning hoped that Qiao Nian could qualify.","Even if she lost the competition, she should try not to lose too badly like in previous years.","Qin Si was also worried about this. He fidgeted on the sofa and drank half a bottle of water in frustration.","He looked around and asked in a low voice, “Where’s Jiang Li? Why isn’t he here? Isn’t he watching Sister Qiao’s competition?”","He had heard about the Jiang family splitting up.","During this period of time, Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou had been hinting to the Jiang family that Qiao Nian would no longer have anything to do with them.","Qin Si’s lips twitched and his expression turned mocking at this thought.","Idiot!","Qiao Nian had connections in the illegal district. He couldn’t understand why Tang Wanru and her daughter felt that such a hidden big shot had to rely on their connections to survive in Beijing.","Poor Jiang Li was sandwiched between such people.","“He’s not coming?”","Qin Si had a good relationship with Jiang Li. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have helped Jiang Li take care of Jiang Xianrou. At the mention of Jiang Li not coming to watch Qiao Nian’s competition, he tried his best to control his emotions but still sounded a little dissatisfied.","He was afraid that Jiang Li would be influenced by Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou and would also ostracize Sister Qiao.","Gu San answered the question as he poured a cup of tea, “Young Master Jiang is watching the live broadcast at home. Miss Qiao especially helped him install the software to watch the live broadcast.”","Miss Qiao had especially helped Young Master Jiang install the software on his computer.","Qin Si originally wanted to grab a plate of food, but he instantly did not want to eat anymore when he heard Gu San’s stern answer.","The food suddenly appeared dull and unappealing to him."]},{"number":1226,"title":"Chapter 1226 - Tang Wanru Is Also at Lan Pavilion","paragraphs":["He tried his best to tell himself that he was not jealous. Jiang Li and Sister Qiao were cousins and she had lived with Jiang Li for some time in Rao City. Sister Qiao’s relationship with Jiang Li was better than with him. It was normal.","But he felt sour. So sour that it hurt.","Qin Si was originally already upset, and now, upon hearing what Gu San said, he stopped talking and could not continue. In the end, he looked left and right and saw the man sitting beside him waiting for the live broadcast. He seemed to have thought of something and asked seriously, “Master Wang, didn’t Sister Qiao install a live broadcast software for you??”","His question froze the air in the private room for a few seconds.","Until Ye Wangchuan moved.","!!","He raised the corners of his eyes; deep and reserved. He looked at him coldly and replied slowly, “No.”","Qin Si shrunk and touched the back of his neck. He felt better.","Even Master Wang, the real boyfriend, could not get the treatment of Sister Qiao personally installing the software for him. Now it seemed alright that he, the supporting cast, did not get the special treatment too!","...","The live broadcast would begin in three minutes.","The atmosphere in the private room was tense.","In the beginning, Qin Si would joke around and talk about other things. But just before the competition started, even he stopped talking.","The room fell silent for a moment.","Tang Ning, Zhang Yang, and the others were all staring at the computer, waiting for the live broadcast to start.","Ye Wangchuan went out to answer a call. It was from Old Master Ye. He asked him if Qiao Nian was prepared for the competition.","He comforted the person on the other end of the line, who was even more nervous than him, and returned to the private room. He sat back in his original seat and quietly waited for the competition to begin.","At the same time, Tang Wanru was also at Lan Pavilion.","However, unlike Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and the others, she did not manage to book a private room. She just sat with a group of wealthy ladies outside in the main area and had some drinks.","Tang Wanru was dressed in a dark green silk cheongsam with exquisite workmanship. The embroidery on the cheongsam was exquisite.","She also wore a necklace of emeralds.","She could be said to be eye-catching among the noblewomen.","At this moment, Tang Wanru was holding a cup of coffee and stirring it gently with a spoon. She was listening to the ladies sitting at her table chatting.","She wasn’t much interested in the topic and had been showing a lack of interest.","Until a noblewoman brought the conversation to her attention.","“Mrs. Jiang, I heard that your family has split up. What’s going on?","“Didn’t your family always get along very well? You didn’t mention any conflicts at home.”","Tang Wanru’s sharp gaze saw that the other party was waiting to watch a dramatic show unfold from the corner of her eyes. She put down her coffee cup with a cold face and replied impolitely, “Do I have to tell you about my family’s conflict?”","The other party’s face turned pale and she immediately felt embarrassed.","“I’m just asking. There’s no need for you to overreact, right? Oh, right, I also heard that the niece your family found was chosen to represent the country in this year’s World Software Competition. Have you heard? My son said that this competition is impressive. Every year, only one person will be chosen to represent the country. I didn’t expect it to involve your family this year.”","Tang Wanru’s expression became even more solemn. However, she knew how to keep her composure. She didn’t show it on her face and silently put the coffee stirrer to the side, making a crisp sound. “If Madam Song is envious, you can also bring your illegitimate daughter back. I heard that President Song has a daughter who is already in high school. Her results have always been good. Your family might also have a top scorer in the college entrance examination if you are willing to let her come back.”"]},{"number":1227,"title":"Chapter 1227 - Elite Son in Tian Chen","paragraphs":["Her words were too rude and merciless. Madam Song gritted her teeth and her expression changed. She pointed at her face and stood up. “You! What do you mean?”","Tang Wanru did not take her seriously. She sneered and looked into her eyes, not backing down at all. “What do I mean? Madam Song can’t understand?”","Everyone in the circle of noblewomen in Beijing knew that the Song family had an illegitimate daughter.","Tang Wanru knew it, too.","She knew that this matter had always been a sore spot for the other party, but the other party had ignored her feelings first and mentioned Qiao Nian in public to disgust her.","Why should she care how she felt now?","There was another important reason why Tang Wanru dared to retaliate. The Song family was only third-tier in Beijing. However, Madam Song was arrogant and high-profile. She had always thought that her family was powerful and had a powerful background.","Therefore, she often said things without boundaries.","Usually, Tang Wanru and the others would not invite Madam Song to their gatherings. They were afraid that she would say something stupid and offend others.","The reason why Madam Song was able to attend this tea session at Lan Pavilion today was that another lady had brought her over.","At this moment, the two of them were about to quarrel.","The others present quickly pulled them apart and tried to persuade them to stop.","Madam Song was furious. She still looked like she wanted to fight with Tang Wanru even though someone tried to calm her down.","Tang Wanru, on the other hand, was magnanimous. She completely ignored the other party and looked generous. The more she acted like this, the more it made the other party seem unsociable and insensible.","Someone was watching the show. When Tang Wanru was arguing with her just now, that person did not say anything. Now, she covered her smile and said to Tang Wanru, “Didn’t Young Master Jiang return to Beijing yesterday?”","Tang Wanru was very confident in this circle. Other than the Jiang family backing her, she also gave birth to a pair of good children.","It needed no explanation for Jiang Xianrou.","Everyone in Beijing knew that she was the only girl who could enter Qin Si’s top circle.","In addition, Tang Wanru also gave birth to a good son.","Not Jiang Li.","Their circle was unwilling to let their children enter the entertainment industry. Even if Jiang Li was doing well in the entertainment industry, no matter how many fans he had outside or how famous he was...","In their circle, celebrities did not have a halo above them. Despite Jiang Li’s popularity, they felt that he was not doing well.","She was talking about Jiang Yao.","At the mention of Jiang Yao, Tang Wanru’s aura instantly became less sharp. There was a hint of arrogance in her eyes as she smiled. “How did you know?”","Then, as if the others did not exist, she continued, “He came back yesterday morning. The child didn’t tell me in advance that he was coming back and gave me a shock.”","After the Jiang family split up, the second branch and the eldest branch became two separate families.","Almost everyone in the circle knew that Old Master Jiang had left the old residence to the eldest son, but he had left the company and his connections to the second son’s family.","Therefore, it looked like the elder branch was the heir chosen by Old Master Jiang.","However, the people in the circle were more optimistic about the second son’s family.","After all, compared to the second branch which had connections and a company, Jiang Zongjin was just a university professor. Qiao Nian had just been brought back from Rao City by Old Master Jiang this year. It could be said that she had no foundation.","It was incomparable to the second branch!","Tang Wanru could still be confident in this circle even after the family split up.","Moreover, she had an elite son in Tian Chen!"]},{"number":1228,"title":"Chapter 1228 - Jiang Yao Isn’t Worthy Enough to","paragraphs":["As expected.","The others immediately praised Jiang Yao. “Young Master Jiang has entered Tian Chen. Tian Chen is not an ordinary place. He probably took the time to come straight home once he could.”","“Maybe.” Tang Wanru picked up her coffee cup to hide her smile and said casually, “That child is like this. He’s good at everything, but he takes care of the family too much. I told him not to care about the family after entering Tian Chen and to just learn from others. He just doesn’t listen and always likes to come back.”","Who couldn’t tell that Tang Wanru was showing off that Jiang Yao had entered Tian Chen and was an elite among elites?","The ladies’ expressions became interesting. No one wanted to answer, lest others thought that they wanted to flatter Tang Wanru.","The person who mentioned Jiang Yao continued reluctantly, “That’s why I often ask you how you teach your children. How are they all so obedient? They’re nothing like our mischievous kids. I’ll say one thing and they’ll talk back with another. They won’t come back if they can, and sometimes they still don’t return even after I call them.”","Then, she smiled and immediately changed the topic. “By the way, have you heard? Tian Chen’s boss attended Old Master Wei’s funeral and personally went to the Wei family to pay his respects.”","“You said that Tian Chen’s boss went to the Wei family a few days ago? Doesn’t that mean that he’s still in Beijing?” A socialite who had not spoken the entire time couldn’t help but ask.","Madam Zhou smiled and picked up her teacup. “I don’t know about that.”","She turned to look at Tang Wanru and said casually, “Young Master Jiang is also from Tian Chen. He should know if Tian Chen’s boss is still in Beijing.”","The others also looked at Tang Wanru.","Tang Wanru suddenly frowned and tightened her grip on the cup handle. Pretending to be magnanimous, she replied, “Jiang Yao didn’t tell me. I’ll ask him when I get back.”","Tian Chen had a very strong background in the illegal district.","Jiang Yao was already considered a very outstanding person among the younger generation. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to enter Tian Chen. However, these socialites knew very well that Jiang Yao had only entered the group. He couldn’t even be considered a higher-up in Tian Chen. He was just an ordinary member.","How could Jiang Yao have a relationship with the big boss!","Tang Wanru said she was going to ask Jiang Yao? Wasn’t she too arrogant?","On the other hand, Madam Zhou gave Tang Wanru enough face when everyone was silent. She calmly helped her find a way out. “Alright, then I’ll have to trouble Madam Jiang to help me ask Young Master Jiang. I heard from my husband that he didn’t leave Beijing. I’m wondering if he has anything else to do other than coming to Beijing to pay respects to Old Master Wei. After all, Young Master Jiang came to Beijing at about the same time as the boss behind Tian Chen. Young Master Jiang might know.”","Tang Wanru nodded and was also thinking about this.","Did the boss behind Tian Chen come to the capital for something other than paying respects to Old Master Wei?","What was it?","A little distracted, Tang Wanru sent a message to Jiang Yao under the table and asked him about the boss behind Tian Chen.","...","A long strip of cordon was set up outside the Qing University Arts Building. Ordinary students were no longer allowed to approach within 300 meters of the building.","Qiao Nian arrived at school at two-thirty.","She had to go through a security check before entering to participate in the competition. The security check did not allow her to bring her cell phone in.","Qiao Nian took it out and took a look.","Other than the message from Ye Wangchuan, there was also a WeChat message without a number.","[You want to compete? Why? Haven’t you always disliked these things?]"]},{"number":1229,"title":"Chapter 1229 - Embarrassing Someone from Their Department in Front of Him","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and stared at the WeChat message for a while. Without replying, she tossed her cell phone into the security box.","She then unzipped her shoulder bag and poured out everything inside for the security guards to check.","Shen Yugui and Du Mingwei from the Computing faculty of Qing University accompanied her. They watched as the security guards checked Qiao Nian’s belongings.","Shen Yugui took a deep breath and calmed himself down. He then said, “Qiao Nian, don’t feel pressured later. Just perform normally.”","“Yes. I know.” The girl’s eyelashes were slightly lowered. She looked quite obedient, with the kind of personality that was very easy to talk to.","Du Mingwei was also worried that she would be under too much pressure and said from the side, “That’s right. Listen to Professor Shen. Don’t feel too pressured. It’s best if we can achieve good results, but don’t be too bothered if we don’t. You should know about our precious results. We haven’t been able to qualify. It’s fine even if you don’t qualify in the end. Just do your best.”","Shen Yugui did not expect him to say that and looked at him in surprise. He thought that Du Mingwei would definitely want Qiao Nian to produce results. This way, their Computing Faculty could hold their heads high for once.","Unexpectedly, Du Mingwei did not say that at all. He even comforted Qiao Nian, afraid that the pressure on her would be too great.","The Computing Faculty and the Chinese Medicine Faculty had never interacted much.","Shen Yugui and Du Mingwei were in the same school, but they were not very familiar with each other.","Shen Yugui had just developed a good impression of Du Mingwei, but in the next second, he overturned it.","“Qiao Nian, have you considered transferring to another faculty?” Du Mingwei asked directly, as if he had forgotten that Shen Yugui was beside him. He said bluntly, “Since you’ve signed up for this competition, you must be interested in computing. School has just started. Why don’t you consider transferring to our Computing Faculty?”","Shen Yugui’s expression darkened. He grabbed his shoulder and pulled him away before Qiao Nian could reply. He then said with a fake smile, “Professor Du, isn’t it a little too much to poach someone from our Chinese Medicine Faculty in front of me?”","“I just feel that Qiao Nian is talented in computing. Learning Chinese Medicine is a waste of her talent.”","“Hehe, she’s also talented in Chinese Medicine! Professor Du, don’t forget that even my teacher has already come out of retirement to take her as his student. It’s not good to let Qiao Nian transfer to another faculty just like that.”","Du Mingwei had almost forgotten that Qiao Nian was learning Chinese Medicine from Mr. Huang. He touched the bridge of his nose, feeling a little speechless and indignant.","He looked at Qiao Nian, wanting to say something.","Shen Yugui did not give him a chance to speak. “Professor Du, let’s talk about the transfer later. Let Qiao Nian compete first. We’ll talk about the results later.”","They had finally found a good seedling!","Du Mingwei wanted to poach their people for nothing. Dream on!","It wasn’t that Du Mingwei did not care about this competition. On the contrary, he really wanted Qiao Nian to qualify for the group stage.","It was just that a local student had never made it.","He didn’t dare to have too much hope for Qiao Nian, afraid that he would be disappointed.","Since Shen Yugui said so, he had no objections. He shut his mouth, looked at Qiao Nian, and said calmly, “Qiao Nian, don’t feel too pressured. Just try your best to display your strength. I believe in you.”","Qiao Nian retracted her beautiful black eyes and nodded. Her eyes darkened, but she did not respond to him."]},{"number":1230,"title":"Chapter 1230 - Sister Nian: I Dont Dare to Display My Best Strength","paragraphs":["Try to display her best strength?","Well, that might be difficult.","She was afraid they wouldn’t be able to take it if she overdid it.","...","Qiao Nian entered the room reserved for the competition after passing the security check. The staff gave her a bottle of mineral water.","!!","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and adjusted her cap when she saw the surveillance cameras installed everywhere in the room. Then, she strode over to the gamer chair and pulled it out to sit down.","After turning on the computer and checking its configuration, she sat there and waited for the time to arrive. The organizing committee released the theme of the competition.","She had checked on the contestants from the few countries who had participated in the qualifiers with her yesterday. They were all on the Hacker’s Heaven Leaderboard.","Qiao Nian flexed her wrists.","It had been a long time since she had participated in a similar competition.","They were on the leaderboard.","But too bad, she was too.","Ranking: No. 1, Sun.","She narrowed her eyes and curled her lips. Her gaze was arrogant, but her cap was lowered to hide the strong confidence in her eyes. Shen Yugui and Du Mingwei did not see it.","The theme of the qualifying competition appeared on Qiao Nian’s screen once the clock struck three.","Virus.","The subject matter was unexpected.","Previously, Du Mingwei and a few other software teachers in the country had helped Qiao Nian predict possible topics. They all agreed that the theme this time would be a popular section on communication and information technology. Who knew that the theme this time would be so unfamiliar?","Moreover, the rules were also ruthless.","The contestants from the 16 countries would start developing virus software at the same time and attack each other’s computers. Whoever had the last laugh would be the winner.","The last one standing would take the only spot to enter the group stage.","...","Du Mingwei, Shen Yugui, and the others were the first to know the theme and rules of the competition. Du Mingwei’s face immediately turned pale. He clenched his fists and revealed a shocked expression. “It’s over. Why is it this theme?”","Shen Yugui specialized in Chinese Medicine, not computers. He immediately frowned and asked him, “What’s wrong with this topic?”","Du Mingwei looked at him with a pale face and said quietly, “We’ve never mentioned this topic to Qiao Nian before. I don’t know if she knows this.”","Every expert in computers must know how to make virus software, because only by understanding the principles of virus software attacks could they break it.","But this was considered relatively high-end technology.","According to the learning progression, ordinary students had to learn C language, programming, and software courses before the teacher would start talking about software viruses.","The theme of this competition was actually the development of virus software!","Shen Yugui frowned when he heard this, and he looked at the competition venue worriedly.","If Qiao Nian lost...","Shen Yugui immediately felt immense pressure.","...","In the Lan Pavilion private room.","Tang Ning and the others were all watching the live broadcast. Seeing that Qiao Nian had gotten the theme of the competition, Tang Ning pursed her lips and said, “Virus?”","Why was the theme so tricky?","“Is Miss Qiao going to be alright?” Tang Ning was quite worried about Qiao Nian.","Qin Si didn’t know if there was anything wrong with Qiao Nian. He only knew that she knew Slim Waist Control from the Red Alliance and was friends with him.","However, he was not sure how competent Qiao Nian was. “It shouldn’t be a problem.”","Bo Jingxing raised his eyebrows calmly upon seeing that he was drinking water nervously. He smiled and comforted him. “Don’t worry. Qiao Nian will definitely be fine!”"]},{"number":1231,"title":"Chapter 1231 - In the Middle","paragraphs":["“How do you know that Sister Qiao will definitely be able to do it?”","Bo Jingxing glanced at him without saying anything. Of course, he knew.","Virus?","He still remembered clearly how Qiao Nian had countered the Lizard Tail virus in the Ninth Branch. He did not answer Qin Si’s question directly. Instead, he said irresponsibly, “Ask Master Wang, don’t ask me.”","“F*ck! You said so yourself.” He was the one who’d said that Sister Qiao would definitely be able to do it. “I never asked you in the first place.”","!!","Bo Jingxing stopped talking. He pushed his glasses up his nose bridge, exuding the aura of a refined hoodlum.","Qin Si looked at his pretentious appearance and wisely did not continue asking. He knew that Bo Jingxing had always been tight-lipped, so he couldn’t get anything out of him.","He turned to look at Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan also raised his eyebrows and spun the glass in his hand when he saw the theme of the competition. The tequila in the glass swayed and he looked straight ahead. He did not look at Qin Si at all.","Virus?","Interesting.","...","The atmosphere in the private room was quite tense.","Zhang Yang, Tang Ning, and the others did not know how good Qiao Nian’s computer skills were. They were all afraid that she would be eliminated from the beginning.","The contestants from the 16 countries had already started programming.","Qiao Nian was not particularly fast.","She seemed to be taking her time.","There was no hurry at all.","Tang Ning was nervous as she watched. She even bit off a little of the lipstick on her lips. “Miss Qiao seems to be average in speed. She’s not fast or slow. She’s in the middle, about seventh or eighth.”","The rules of this competition were to attack each other’s computers with their own virus software. Whoever could disable all their opponents’ computers would win.","Under such rules, developing the virus first was also important.","For example, if you created it first, you would get to attack the other party’s computer first.","As the other party had yet to produce the same virus software, it was very likely that they would be eliminated by you.","The top contestants would advance.","Which meant only one person would have the last laugh.","If Qiao Nian was not at the top, it would be meaningless even if she was in second place, let alone in the middle.","It was neither the best nor the worst.","It would just be ordinary!","Frustrated, Qin Si frowned. He wanted to ask Bo Jingxing and Ye Wangchuan, but he forcefully restrained himself.","Holding his breath, he locked his gaze firmly on the LED blue light screen.","An hour later.","Someone had already created the virus software.","The first person to create the virus software immediately started attacking. Tang Ning, Zhang Yang, and the others became even more nervous.","They could barely breathe, afraid that Qiao Nian’s computer would black out first.","Those who had been selected had to be top talents in this area. As soon as the first virus came out, three computer screens went black in less than a minute.","“So soon?” Qin Si did not expect this competition to be so intense.","Three people were eliminated in a minute.","In other words, apart from the first person to create the software, 12 people were left, including Qiao Nian.","The atmosphere in the private room gradually became tense.","Zhang Yang whispered at the side, “Miss Qiao’s computer is still lit. The other party’s virus doesn’t seem to have affected her.”","This kind of live broadcast showed the operation of every computer. Qiao Nian’s computer screen showed that she was still using the encoder to input C programming.","The second virus software was quickly completed."]},{"number":1232,"title":"Chapter 1232 - All Black Screen in a Second","paragraphs":["Four more computers went black in just a few minutes.","Including the three people who were eliminated in the beginning, seven people had been eliminated in the blink of an eye.","Qin Si felt that this software competition was too bloody.","It was simply a competition that no one could watch.","It was too exciting!","His heart was almost numb.","He couldn’t understand who made the most impressive virus, but he could tell something was wrong. “The second person to complete it seems to be very powerful.”","He watched as the icons on the screen kept attacking other people’s computers. He couldn’t help but sweat for Qiao Nian. He muttered to himself, “Master Wang, when is Sister Qiao’s software going to be done? Is she too slow?”","Tang Ning had just said that Qiao Nian wasn’t fast. She could only be considered in the middle.","Seven out of 16 people were eliminated.","They were already in the middle of the competition!","Ye Wangchuan stared at the screen with his deep eyes. He crossed his arms and replied calmly, “Soon.”","Qin Si hurriedly took the time to look at him. Then, he turned around and stared nervously at Qiao Nian’s computer. He said anxiously, “How long will it take?”","“30 seconds.”","“?????”","Qin Si was nervously focused on the screen. Hearing Ye Wangchuan describe the time Qiao Nian was going to finish the software so accurately, he was stunned.","While he was in a daze, Tang Ning whispered, “Miss Qiao’s software is done!”","Qin Si immediately focused on the screen again.","Qiao Nian’s computer had already stopped programming and had pressed the Enter key.","Before he could see what was going on, he saw the remaining eight computers on the screen turn black.","All the screens went black in a second!","A precise instant kill!","Qin Si’s heart almost jumped out of his chest. His eyes widened as he suspected everything he was seeing.","He took a deep breath and instinctively exploded. “F*ck, that awesome?!”","He was stunned.","Tang Ning, Zhang Yang, and the others were all stunned!","Their reactions were similar to his.","However, Qin Si stood up but they did not. Zhang Yang didn’t stand up, but he accidentally spilled the water in his glass.","Tang Ning was also stunned.","Damn, that was awesome!","Really awesome!","Ye Wangchuan stood up and picked up his jacket from the sofa. Then, he said to them, “The results are out. I’ll pick her up. You guys play.”","In the past, anyone in the private room would be 120% focused on answering him.","However, this time, neither an old man like Zhang Yang nor a smart person like Tang Ning reacted.","All of them were blinded by Qiao Nian’s instant kill.","...","Outside the Qing University Art Building.","Qiao Nian had just come out of the competition venue.","Du Mingwei already knew the outcome. He went forward excitedly. “Qiao Nian, you’re amazing.”","The girl pulled her cap down and said slowly, “So-so.”","Du Mingwei had watched the live broadcast like Ye Wangchuan and the others. He had seen how Qiao Nian’s software made the eight computers turn black.","He looked at the girl’s expression that said “I’m just playing normally” and was a little speechless.","However, as a teacher, he had to be responsible for this competition. He still had to tell Qiao Nian about the rest.","“After the qualifiers are the group stages. This is the first time we’ve entered the group stages. There are 12 representatives in the group stages. They’re divided into four groups, ABCD. Three people in a group, and then three to one. Only one person in each group will qualify.”"]},{"number":1233,"title":"Chapter 1233 - Master Wang Is Here to Pick Her Up","paragraphs":["“The group stage is the same as the online competition. The person who advances in each group can go to the city to participate in the final competition. I just saw your group. You’re assigned to Group C. Group C is the second group among the four groups...”","Du Mingwei suppressed his excitement. “The opponent is very strong. The previous world champion is in this group.","“Do you know the Heaven Leaderboard?","“The other two opponents are on the Heaven Leaderboard.” Du Mingwei didn’t elaborate. There was no need to. In this qualifying competition, Qiao Nian also had a few opponents on the Heaven Leaderboard. Then? Weren’t they still insta-killed by her?","Therefore, Du Mingwei only said, “I’ll send you the other contestants’ information in your group later.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian grabbed her bag from the security check when she came out. Her phone was inside. Turning it on, she saw a message from Ye Wangchuan, telling her to wait for him at the school gate.","The corners of her mouth turned up.","She looked at the message she had not replied to again. She tapped her phone screen and hesitated for a moment before replying to the other party back.","[No reason. I went because I wanted to.]","Then, she put away her phone and said to Du Mingwei and the others, “Teacher Shen, Teacher Du, my friend is waiting for me outside. I’ll leave first.”","Shen Yugui and the others did not expect Qiao Nian to qualify so easily. They still had many follow-up things to do, so they did not ask the girl to stay. “Okay. We’ll contact you.”","Qiao Nian nodded, took her things, and walked out of the school.","...","At the school gate.","A red flag car was parked quietly under a camphor tree by the road.","Qiao Nian saw the familiar car and walked over. She opened the door and got into the passenger seat with ease, then fastened her seatbelt and turned to ask, “Where are you going?”","Ye Wangchuan turned to the side and helped her adjust her seatbelt. He pulled it open and helped her fasten it again. Then, he sat up straight and said, “Let’s go eat first.”","“Are you sure you want to eat now?” Qiao Nian glanced at him and let him adjust her seatbelt. Then, she pulled away from him and sat back, looking a little surprised. “It’s only 4:30 in the afternoon.”","“What did you eat for lunch?”","Ye Wangchuan was surprised to see her eye-catching face. His thin lips curled up as he placed his hand on the steering wheel and started the car. His voice was noble.","“With your personality, you should have just eaten casually. It’s just right to eat now. You can even have supper tonight.”","Qiao Nian fell silent.","She sat obediently in the passenger seat.","She did eat very casually at noon. There was a competition in the afternoon, and in order to maintain a clear head, she had always disliked eating too much at such moments.","Honestly, she was a little hungry. She stopped babbling and said simply, “I want lamb stew.”","Beijing was most famous for its lamb.","The lamb stew was also a kind of hot pot, but it was all clear soup. They also liked to use sesame sauce or peanut butter as ingredients.","Qiao Nian was not interested in such light-flavored food, but the restaurant Ye Wangchuan had brought her to before was good.","The fresh lamb was well-defined and did not have the smell of lamb. She suddenly wanted to eat it.","Ye Wangchuan had always been the one to go wherever she wanted to go. He turned the car around and said in a slightly hoarse voice, “Then, let’s go eat it.”","The car drove out slowly towards a private restaurant..."]},{"number":1234,"title":"Chapter 1234 - Whats Wrong With Him? 100,000 Whys?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian’s phone kept ringing along the way. The boss brought out the freshly cut lamb when they arrived at the dining area. The hot bone soup in the pot was boiling.","Qiao Nian crossed her legs and replied to the messages on her phone.","Ye Wangchuan poured her a cup of strong tea; the tea leaves floated in the ginger water. He placed the teacup in front of the girl, restrained his noble aura, and said gently, “Drink some water before eating. It’s good for your stomach.”","Qiao Nian had just replied to Jiang Li’s message when she reached out to pick up the teacup. She took a sip and put the cup down.","She looked up and asked him in surprise, “What tea is this?”","!!","“Jun Shan Silver Needle Tea.” Ye Wangchuan smiled and ironed her chopsticks in hot water before handing them over. “Does it not taste as bitter as other tea leaves?”","Qiao Nian took another sip and slowly placed the teacup on the table. She hummed and said lazily and arrogantly, “Ah. I knew it was different from the tea I drank before.”","“Yes, this is produced by the tea tree in the boss’s hometown. He goes back every year during the tea gathering season. He handled everything from picking tea leaves to roasting them.”","Qiao Nian picked up the teacup and sniffed it again. As expected, the fragrance of tea greeted her.","Her eyes darkened.","No wonder , she thought. It’s new tea.","Many people liked to look at the variety of tea leaves, but it had to be new no matter how expensive the tea was.","When she heard Ye Wangchuan say that this was new tea, she took another casual sip like a cat before putting the cup down again.","Ye Wangchuan smiled upon seeing that she liked the tea. Her sitting posture was similar to Qiao Nian’s but slightly more upright. “The tea here is one of the boss’s specialties. It hadn’t been produced yet the last time I brought you here.”","As he spoke, the girl’s phone lit up again.","Qiao Nian’s shoulders relaxed as she leaned against the stool. Her gaze returned to her phone. She picked it up and opened the message.","This time, it was still the person who had sent her a WeChat message.","There was no name.","Not even a Chinese character.","The ID was all blank.","It was just a punctuation mark.",".: [You’re not someone who will suddenly change your habits. I heard that you’ve meddled in many things this year. Previously, I could figure out that it was related to the Qiao family when you took the College Entrance Examination. Why did you participate in this World Software Competition this time?]","Qiao Nian frowned after reading the other party’s message, feeling quite annoyed.","She turned back and said there was no reason, she just suddenly wanted to do it.","However, Lu Zhi liked to get to the bottom of things!","What was wrong with him?","He had a hundred thousand whys?",".: [I believe that there’s a reason for everything. No one will do something aimlessly. So, Qiao, why are you participating?]","Qiao Nian frowned as she stared at the new message. Her fingers curled around the screen as she thought about how to reply to him.","She pursed her moist lips for a full minute before replying.","[QN: I want to be number one in the world.]","[QN: Is that a good enough reason?]","The other party did not respond after the message was returned. There was no new message, and she did not know if he had seen her reply.","Qiao Nian stopped looking at her phone after replying. She picked up her chopsticks and focused on eating the lamb that Ye Wangchuan had cooked for her."]},{"number":1235,"title":"Chapter 1235 - Face Slap, Who Is Jiang Yao?","paragraphs":["At this moment.","The entire top floor of the Four Seasons Hotel in Beijing had been booked. Even the hotel manager did not know the name of this mysterious guest who had booked the entire floor of their hotel.","In a room on the 48th floor.","The man in the wheelchair sat quietly in front of the French windows in the living room.","Below him was the entire city view.","!!","Countless vehicles were woven on the city’s viaduct, like tiny ants running at high speed below.","“Mr. Lu, a person called Jiang Yao wants to see you. He said he’s from Tian Chen Corporation. Do you want to see him?”","The man in the wheelchair had a thin blanket draped over his legs. His shoulders and chest were perfectly straight. The light shone on him, but there was nothing wrong with him—except that he was a cripple!","“Jiang Yao?”","Lu Zhi’s fair hand was still holding his phone. The phone screen stopped at a chat box, and his fingers tapped on the phone case.","“Who is he?”","When combined, it was a frivolous sentence: Who is Jiang Yao?","His tone was not disdainful. It was just calm and straightforward, but it was like the sharpest slap in the face. Jiang Yao would definitely be so ashamed that he could not raise his head if he was standing in front of him at this moment.","The bodyguard did not dare to look up and whispered, “He said he’s from Tian Chen Corporation.”","“Heh.” A disdainful laugh came from the man’s throat. He seemed to be amused. His deep black eyes were like a bottomless lake. “So? Must I see him if he’s from Tian Chen Corporation?”","His tone was filled with teasing as if he was just joking. “Do you know how many people there are in the entire Tian Chen Corporation? Will I be able to rest if everyone wants to see me?”","The bodyguard, who was nearly 1.9 meters tall and looked like a moving iron tower, turned pale. His back was immediately drenched in a cold sweat.","He was so frightened that he did not dare to look up. He immediately said nervously, “Yes, Mr. Lu. I’ll reject him immediately.”","Lu Zhi did not even look up, as if he could not be bothered with him.","The bodyguard went out quietly and closed the door.","The suite fell silent again. Lu Zhi raised his wrist and picked up the glass beside him. The glass was filled with vodka.","He brought the rim of the glass to his lips and took a sip, draining half the glass in one gulp, then put it back.","He seemed to be casually talking to the person in the living room. “Nian Nian replied to me.”","“What did she say?”","There was someone else in the living room. It was a woman. She was young, very young. Her facial features were not outstanding. She was the kind of person who would be inconspicuous in a crowd.","She was wearing a small black tank top that revealed her trained and strong shoulders. Below was a pair of camouflage pants that were tucked into long leather boots.","She did not look outstanding, but her figure was extremely outstanding.","She exuded maturity and valiance that young girls did not possess.","Lu Zhi smiled. He had not seen the sun for a long time, and his skin was very fair. The light shone down from above his head, and it was as if he could see the purple veins under his cold white skin. The thousands of stars in front of the French window fell into his eyes, but he covered his thin lips as if he was joking. “Guess.”","“...”","Lu Zhi smiled and adjusted the blanket on his lap indifferently. His voice was soft and cold. “She said that the reason she participated in the competition was that she wanted to be number one in the world.”","He clicked his tongue again when he finished.","“She wants to be number one in the world, so ran to participate in this boring competition. That’s the funniest joke I’ve heard recently!”"]},{"number":1236,"title":"Chapter 1236 - She Participated Because She Wanted to Honor Her Country","paragraphs":["Jian Jin was speechless. She changed her stance. “What if that’s what she thinks? Qiao doesn’t like to lie. Since she told you she wants to be number one in the world, she probably just wants to play.”","The boss of the Red Alliance, Sun, was the number one hacker on the Heaven Leaderboard. Other than Qiao Nian’s own reasons, Jian Jin could not find a reason for her to participate in the World Software Competition.","“That’s because you don’t understand her,” Lu Zhi suddenly interrupted her. His voice was calm, but it was extremely powerful. “She’s not someone who likes to play. She’s lazy. Very few people and things can make her take them to heart.”","Jian Jin thought about the girls she’d known for so many years and agreed. “That’s true.”","They had been kidnapped together back then and sent to train.","!!","They walked out together at the end.","Lu Zhi had lost his leg bone. From then on, he could only sit in a wheelchair and could no longer walk like an ordinary person.","Jian Jin’s dark eyes turned to the man in the wheelchair again with a puzzled expression. “Then, why do you think Qiao wants to participate in this competition?”","Why?","Lu Zhi had been in Beijing for a few days and had checked on Qiao Nian.","It was not easy. Even he could only find out a few words. However, based on his understanding of Qiao Nian, he could confidently tell why she was participating in the competition.","“In the past, very few people and things bothered her. Now it’s different.”","In just a year, Qiao Nian had let go of too many people and things.","Lu Zhi narrowed his eyes. His eyes were like a cold and lonely night. There was a star hidden in the cold and lonely night, making Jian Jin stunned.","The man in the wheelchair said calmly, “She participated in the competition to bring honor to her country.”","“?????”","Jian Jin looked as if she’d seen a ghost. For a moment, she couldn’t digest the information he’d revealed. “You’re joking, right?”","Qiao Nian was participating in the software competition because she wanted to bring glory to her country?","This...","It was too unlike Qiao Nian.","It was not something she could do in the past!","They were a group of undisciplined, disorganized, and faithless people in the illegal district.","“Bring glory to the country” was simply unbelievable to people like them who did not even have a nationality.","She knew that Qiao Nian had a nationality and a household register.","This was because after they escaped back then, they did not choose to return to their families. Only Qiao Nian chose to return to her original family.","It was just that sometimes people could go back, but some things could never be the same.","Later on, the Qiao family courted death.","“Didn’t she say before that she stayed only to return to her roots and find out who her biological parents were?”","Some time ago, she had contacted Qiao Nian to ask if she had found out the reason for Ji Qing’s death.","However, Qiao Nian said that she had not investigated thoroughly.","Jian Jin was also helping to investigate in private. Usually, if she found any clues, she would send Qiao Nian a message. She waved her hand and frowned. “Is she too deeply involved in this lousy matter in Beijing? She’ll easily suffer if she continues like this.”","Lu Zhi’s fair fingers tapped on the armrest of his wheelchair. The armrest was inlaid with round and smooth decorations. It was impossible to tell from the material what it was made from.","His voice was extremely calm, revealing a disdain and arrogance that did not match his appearance. “It doesn’t matter if she wants to play. We’re here, anyway.”","Jian Jin thought about it and agreed.","Anyway, they were still around.","Lu Zhi said, “By the way, help me buy a house in Beijing.","“I don’t like staying in hotels. I’m a clean freak.”"]},{"number":1237,"title":"Chapter 1237 - You Havent Officially Met Your Little Cousin?","paragraphs":["Jian Jin looked at him. His eyes were very good-looking under their ordinary appearance. Siling, she crossed her arms and stood up from the arm of the sofa she was leaning against. “OK, I’ll get right on it.”","“Also, send a gift.","“Deliver it in your name.”","Who was she? Without asking, Jian Jin knew that Lu Zhi was definitely talking about Qiao Nian. She raised her eyebrows and said sharply, “You’re giving a gift in my name. Tsk, what’s the difference between giving it or not? Qiao doesn’t know that it’s from you.”","Lu Zhi was wearing a black shirt. The tailored fabric outlined the perfect outline of his chest and shoulders. His eyes were indifferent, making it impossible to tell what he was thinking. “Just give it to her. Anyway, it’s only a gift if the person who receives it likes it. Otherwise, it will lose the meaning of giving it.”","!!","Jian Jin was stunned, not understanding what he was thinking. Wasn’t it only meaningful if the gift was from her? What did he mean by saying that it was only a gift if someone else accepted it?","She straightened her legs and did not probe further. She looked at the man in the wheelchair and said, “In any case, I only care about helping you deliver the gift. It’s fine as long as you don’t care that Qiao doesn’t know it’s from you!”","Lu Zhi moved his fingers as if telling her to get lost.","Jian Jin got lost coolly and went out without looking back.","...","Downstairs in the hotel.","Jiang Yao waited in the lobby on the first floor for a long time, but no one came down.","Finally, a bodyguard as tall as an iron tower emerged from the elevator and walked in his direction.","“Coming.”","He perked up and whispered to Xu Jishen.","Xu Jishen had come with him. When he heard this, he followed Jiang Yao’s gaze and saw the person walking towards them. “Do you think Boss has time to see us?”","Jiang Yao’s face was stiff and serious. He was not like Jiang Zongnan, but more like Jiang Zongjin and Old Master Jiang. At this moment, he shook his head with uncertainty and replied, “I don’t know. But we’re members of Tian Chen Corporation, after all. Since we know that Boss is here, we definitely have to come and greet him. Whether Mr. Lu sees us or not is another matter. Let’s do what we have to do politely. It’s up to him to see us or not.”","“That’s true.” Xu Jishen nodded and felt that he made sense. “Anyway, we came over to greet him. It’s fine if he doesn’t want to see us.”","As he busied himself, he thought of someone. “By the way, I’ve been spending the past few days with my grandfather and didn’t ask you. Have you met your cousin?”","“No.”","At the mention of Qiao Nian, Jiang Yao remembered what Jiang Xianrou had told him about Qiao Nian entering the World Software Competition through the back door to show off. His tone was not good.","“I haven’t had time these past few days.”","Xu Jishen frowned and was about to ask him, “Didn’t you say that you wanted to take some time to have a meal with your family when you just came back?”","Why was there no time again?","However, seeing that Lu Zhi’s bodyguard was about to walk over, he did not go deeper and only said curiously, “Oh. I thought your cousin had entered the group stage. Your family will celebrate and have a meal together.”","After saying that, Xu Jishen looked away and did not care about it anymore.","Because he thought Jiang Yao definitely knew.","Unexpectedly, Jiang Yao was in a daze and was completely stunned. In his extreme surprise, he even forgot to ask Xu Jishen.","Qiao Nian had entered the group stage?","Didn’t Xianrou tell him that Qiao Nian’s software was made by another person?","The country participated in this competition every year. They would fall in the preliminaries every year. They had never entered the group stages. Qiao Nian had actually entered the group stages this year?"]},{"number":1238,"title":"Chapter 1238 - The Big Bosses Are All Gathering in Beijing. Gather at a Table of Mahjong?","paragraphs":["He remembered that it was very difficult for them to enter the group stage in this world-class competition. The top players of the 16 countries had to fight for the only spot.","So Qiao Nian was the first place in the final?","Jiang Yao’s mind buzzed, and a string in his mind was tense.","He was so shocked that he was not in the mood to talk to Lu Zhi’s bodyguard.","The bodyguard only came down from the elevator to tell them that Lu Zhi would not see them. He left coldly after saying that.","!!","Xu Jishen had long guessed that the big boss would not see them. After the bodyguard left, he raised his eyebrows and said, “As expected, he doesn’t have time to care about us.”","This was an ending that he had long known!","Who was Lu Zhi?","He was in charge of Tian Chen Corporation. He was already the first in the illegal district at a young age.","A person like Lu Zhi did not lack money, power, or influence.","There was really no need to see small fries like him and Jiang Yao.","Xu Jishen had never thought that Lu Zhi would meet them. Thus, he was not disappointed. He retracted his gaze and pressed a hand on Jiang Yao’s shoulder. He asked casually, “Jiang Yao, shall we go for a drink later?”","Since he was already out, Xu Jishen felt that it was quite boring to go back without doing anything. He decided to ask Jiang Yao out for a cup of tea.","Unexpectedly, Jiang Yao frowned and pushed his hand away. He rejected him in frustration. “I’m not going. Go ahead.”","Xu Jishen: “?”","When Jiang Yao saw him looking at him in confusion, he felt even more frustrated. He didn’t know how to tell him about his sister’s coquettish actions. He pursed his lips and adjusted his mood before reluctantly saying, “I have something to do at home. I don’t have time today. Another day.”","“Isn’t your family fine?” Xu Jishen had just heard from him that his family didn’t even have time to eat with Qiao Nian.","Jiang Yao was too embarrassed to mention it. He glanced to the side. “...I have something on at the last minute.”","Xu Jishen wasn’t a fool. He could tell that Jiang Yao was feeling uneasy and his mind was clearly not here. He did not force him anymore. He waved his hand and said casually, “Forget it. You can go back first. I won’t drink water. I’ll go back and accompany my grandfather.”","Jiang Yao felt guilty and patted his shoulder. “I’ll treat you another day.”","“Okay.” Xu Jishen waved at him, indicating that he should leave first. “Let’s talk about it another day.”","Jiang Yao felt even more guilty. “I’ll call you in advance another day.”","Without waiting for Xu Jishen to reply, he had something on his mind and could not wait to ask someone. He frowned and retracted his hand. He hurriedly said to Xu Jishen, “I won’t talk to you anymore. I’ll leave first.”","“Bye.”","Xu Jishen waved at him and watched as Jiang Yao’s back disappeared from view. Only then did he retract his gaze and prepare to go back.","However, from the corner of his eye, he saw the elevator door open and a valiant figure walk out.","He looked surprised. Xu Jishen watched as a woman came out of the elevator and strode out of the hotel.","After she left, he whispered, “What’s going on? Why are the big shots of the illegal district all in Beijing? Are they playing mahjong together?”","Xu Jishen watched Jian Jin leave quickly. After some thought, he decided to go back and discuss it with his grandfather.","Tian Chen’s big boss appeared in the country this time. On the surface, he was here to send Old Master Wei off.","However, the other party had no intention of leaving after going to the Wei family to pay his respects. The reason behind this was thought-provoking.","He was different from Jiang Yao.","After all, his grandfather still had real power in the Xu family. He was much more sensitive in certain aspects than Jiang Yao.","Xu Jishen did not delay any longer and left hurriedly with his phone."]},{"number":1239,"title":"Chapter 1239 - Its Not That Uncle Is Excluding Their Family","paragraphs":["Jiang Yao immediately called Tang Wanru after he left the hotel. Finding out that she was at home, he drove back to the old residence.","He even called Jiang Li on the way back.","Jiang Yao asked about Qiao Nian.","His handsome face darkened slightly as Jiang Li talked about Qiao Nian and Jiang Xianrou.","When the car arrived at the entrance of the old residence, Jiang Yao said to the person on the other end of the line in a low voice, “I’m home. I’ll talk to you later.”","!!","With that, Jiang Yao hung up.","He unbuckled his seat belt, opened the car door, and walked into the house with a dark expression.","“Young Master, you’re back.” The servants hurriedly handed Jiang Yao slippers when they saw him.","Jiang Yao strode in and saw Tang Wanru applying a facial mask in the living room.","Tang Wanru was wearing silk pajamas. Her hair was tied up, and her face was smeared with green seaweed mud. Seeing Jiang Yao, she elegantly put down the half-dried face cream and said with a smile, “Yao’er, you’re back? What do you want to eat tonight? I’ll get Auntie to buy it.”","Jiang Yao did not speak. He frowned and watched as his mother waved for the servant to come over and skillfully instructed her to buy his favorite dishes.","Jiang Yao’s expression darkened. He pursed his thin lips and walked to the side expressionlessly. “Mom, I have something to say.”","Tang Wanru instructed the servant, “Buy these first. Bring your phone with you. I’ll call you if I remember anything else.”","“Of course, Madam.” The servant could tell that the atmosphere in the house was off. She immediately left after going to the kitchen to bring her things.","Tang Wanru leisurely picked up the wet tissue on the coffee table as soon as the servant left. As she wiped her face, she asked Jiang Yao, “What do you want to tell me?”","She threw the wet tissue stained with seaweed mud into the trash can and said suspiciously, “I wanted to ask you what happened on the phone previously. What happened for you to call in a panic?”","When Jiang Yao saw Tang Wanru’s well-maintained and deeply concerned face, it was as if an invisible hand was stuck in his throat. He found it difficult to speak.","“What’s wrong? You’re not even talking.” Tang Wanru walked over with greater concern and patted his shoulder, saying worriedly, “Yao’er, didn’t you say you have something to tell me?”","Jiang Yao’s expression was complicated. He took a deep breath and asked in a deep voice, “Mom, do you know that Qiao Nian signed up for the World Software Competition?”","At the mention of this, Tang Wanru’s concern quickly turned cold. Because Jiang Yao was her proudest son, she still had a little patience and barely did not fall out with him. “Why are you asking this? This is not something you should care about. She has nothing to do with us!”","Jiang Yao’s heart turned cold when he heard his mother’s cold and heartless words, as if someone had poured a bucket of cold water on his head.","It was cold.","Jiang Li did not lie to him. It wasn’t that Qiao Nian was ostracizing their family, but their family was ostracizing their uncle’s family.","“Xianrou told me that Qiao Nian doesn’t know how to program and that she got a spot in the competition through the back door to show off...” As Jiang Yao spoke, he stopped and observed the change in his mother’s expression. “I just found out that Qiao Nian passed the qualifier and became the only person in history to represent the country in the group stage.”","Tang Wanru immediately looked up in shock. “What did you say?”","Jiang Yao’s deep voice gave her a heavy blow. “Qiao Nian was first place in the first round. She’s the only one from the 16 countries who advanced.”"]},{"number":1240,"title":"Chapter 1240 - Slapped in the Face by Her Own Son","paragraphs":["Jiang Yao walked around her to the coffee table and bent down to pick up a bottle of water. He unscrewed the cap and took a sip, then put it down and looked at his stunned mother. “I plan to treat Nian Nian to a meal.”","“You invited her to dinner?” Tang Wanru’s eyebrows twitched. Her heart was floating in the air and she couldn’t find a foothold. “There’s no need, right?”","Jiang Yao looked at her in confusion.","He wanted to treat Qiao Nian to a meal. What did she mean by no need?","Tang Wanru was preoccupied and said to herself, “So what if she enters the next round? It’s just a competition. Not to mention that she enters the next round, it has nothing to do with us even if she gets a ranking in the competition. We don’t have to curry favor with her just because she participated in a competition...”","!!","“Mom!”","Jiang Yao frowned and interrupted her forcefully, telling her to stop talking.","Then, he said, “Do you know what you’re talking about? The World Software Competition is not just some lousy competition. This competition is not only valuable domestically but also internationally. Everyone who studies computer science wants to win such an award. Let me give you an example. Do you know the Nobel Prize?”","Tang Wanru just did not care about the academic world. She wasn’t ignorant. Back then, she had also graduated from Cambridge. However, she did not choose to go out to work. Not long after graduation, she married Jiang Zongnan and had children. She focused on her family.","She had studied abroad herself, so she knew about this.","The Nobel Prize was one of the most valuable awards in the world. All the scientists in the world wanted to receive this award.","Everyone was proud to have won the Nobel Prize!","It was the same in the country.","It was just that for so many years, no one from Continent Y had received the honor of winning the Nobel Prize.","This was because Continent Y did not have this award. They were always at a loss once it came to high-end international technology talks.","Jiang Yao saw that her expression was changing and did not look good. He knew that his mother understood what he meant.","He said unhurriedly, “This software competition is as important as the Nobel Prize in the IT world. It’s also an award recognized by everyone. Over the years, no one in the country has won this award. They can’t even enter the group stage. This year, the competition is holding the finals in Rao City. Qiao Nian has also entered the group stage. Do you understand what I’m trying to say?”","There was only one reaction in Tang Wanru’s mind: Won’t Qiao Nian be in the limelight again?!","Jiang Yao pulled off his tie and hung it loosely around his neck. His handsome face revealed a tired expression. He put down the water bottle and turned to his mother. “So, the competition Qiao Nian is participating in is not the wild chicken competition you think it is. If she can win an award, not to mention becoming famous in Qing University, she will become a god in the domestic computer field!”","“That has nothing to do with our family. either.”","Jiang Yao thought that she was speaking out of anger. Afraid that she wouldn’t understand, he added, “Mom, do you know that there has always been a list in the IT world?”","Tang Wanru couldn’t find her voice and tried her best to control her emotions so as not to reveal too much. “...I don’t know.”","Jiang Yao did not see the frustration and uneasiness she had shown ever since she heard that Qiao Nian had won the award. He continued, “Someone has made a list based on the strength of hackers in the world. It’s called the Heaven Leaderboard. Currently, the hacker ranked first place is someone called Sun. This person’s power in the illegal district cannot be underestimated.”"]},{"number":1241,"title":"Chapter 1241 - The Number One Hacker in the","paragraphs":["“Zhou Hengfeng, who was popular in the country previously, is also on this list, but he’s ranked outside the top 500.","“Mom, do you know what Qiao Nian’s ranking will be if she can enter the finals of this competition?”","Tang Wanru took a deep breath and looked at him with a wavering gaze. “What’s the ranking?”","“Within the top 50.”","After giving her a heavy blow, Jiang Yao continued elegantly, “She can enter the top 50 of the rankings as long as she can pass the group stages and enter the last round. She can enter the top 20 if she gets another ranking. Even Tian Chen wants to poach the people in the top 20.”","“You’re saying that even Tian Chen wants to poach Qiao Nian?!”","“Yes. If Qiao Nian can get a ranking in this competition, Tian Chen will definitely come into contact with her. She’s only a freshman. As for whether she’ll give up her studies and enter Tian Chen, that depends on the outcome of her conversation with Uncle.”","Tang Wanru’s neck stiffened and she could not say a word. Her eyes shook violently, clearly unable to digest what Jiang Yao had told her.","The thing she should be most proud of in the first half of her life was that Jiang Yao had worked hard and entered Tian Chen.","On the day Jiang Yao successfully entered Tian Chen, not only was she happy, but everyone in the Jiang family was also happy. The year before last, they even held a banquet to celebrate.","Jiang Yao thought for a moment, then looked up and said, “Mom, even if Qiao Nian loses the group stage, she will have done her country proud this time. Do you understand?","“Before her, no one in the country could enter the group stage! She’s only a freshman, but she defeated the contestants from the 16 countries as a representative of the country and obtained the only spot to advance to the finals. To be honest, she worked hard this time.”","Tang Wanru didn’t want to talk to him at all, mainly because she didn’t know what to say. She couldn’t possibly praise Qiao Nian for being capable like Jiang Yao did.","She was about to die of anger now, okay?","It was already good of her not to blow her top.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t be standing here listening to Jiang Yao praise Qiao Nian. She couldn’t stand it anymore.","“I’ll go up and tell Dad the good news first.”","Jiang Yao did not notice her abnormality. He picked up his phone and walked upstairs to the bedroom as he said, “I’ll book a private room in the Imperial Mansion later. Let’s have a meal as a family.”","Tang Wanru had no time to stop him. Jiang Yao had already gone upstairs and closed the door. He called Jiang Zongnan to tell him the ‘good news’.","She was so angry that she picked up the mask on the table and threw it on the ground. Her chest heaved as she breathed heavily. Tang Wanru tried her best to endure it after smashing something. However, her face muscles twitched, betraying the anger and grievance in her heart.","Ha, she had thought that the family would stop after they separated.","It didn’t matter if the old man handed the old residence to the eldest branch. Anyway, they had already taken control of the old man’s connections and were in charge of the family’s business.","So what if Qiao Nian was given the old residence?","No one in Beijing would treat her as the future heir of the Jiang family.","However, who would have thought that Qiao Nian would be able to turn the tables? In the blink of an eye, a lousy card had been thrown at her, disrupting her entire plan.","Tang Wanru’s eyes were sinister as she stood looking at the mess on the ground. She instructed the servants to clean it before turning around and returning to her room arrogantly.","After finding the phone in the drawer that she had not used for a long time, she sat in front of the dressing table and hesitated again and again. In the end, she couldn’t resist the torture of her jealousy. She found the only phone number in the communication record and dialed it. “...Hello?”"]},{"number":1242,"title":"Chapter 1242 - Qin Si: My Legs Are Cramping","paragraphs":["Rhine Apartments.","The light and luxurious renovation of the apartment was low-key and reserved. A painting hanging on the wall was a masterpiece by a famous artist.","However, there was not a single piece of furniture in the entire apartment with a brand logo. The bright green plants were only an ordinary variety. The buds were blooming just right. The beautiful butterfly orchid stretched its slender stamens at the living room bar and the smell of artwork was drawn by the shadow of the lamp.","Qiao Nian went upstairs to take a shower and changed her clothes.","Bo Jingxing and Qin Si were both downstairs.","Her phone hung as she went downstairs. Qiao Nian paused and took it out from her pocket, looking at it leisurely.","It was Jiang Li.","She picked it up without hesitation, her voice filled with the mist from the shower. “Hello, Second Brother. What’s the matter?”","Qin Si was originally talking to Bo Jingxing. He immediately looked at Qiao Nian as if he had seen a ghost as she naturally spoke “brother”.","“Damn, I just heard Sister Qiao shout something. Am I deaf?”","Gu San brought him a bottle of Evian water from the fridge and placed it in front of him. He said expressionlessly, “Young Master Qin, there’s nothing wrong with your ears. I also heard Miss Qiao call him brother. It should be Young Master Jiang calling.”","Qin Si moved his lips and was about to say, “Of course I know it’s Jiang Li.”","He looked at Qiao Nian again with a probing and incredulous expression. He mainly wanted to know when Sister Qiao had become so close to Jiang Li. What method had Jiang Li used to make Qiao Nian call him Brother willingly?","One had to know that Qiao Nian had also treated Jiang Li very well and respectfully in the past. However, that was all. She didn’t sound so intimate as she did now.","Qin Si glanced at him.","Gu San immediately shrugged with an innocent expression. “Young Master Qin, don’t look at me. I don’t know anything. You can ask Master Wang if you want to know.”","When the man sitting beside him on the sofa heard this, his elegant and handsome face turned to them. His deep eyes seemed to hide a bottomless pool. His voice was low and seductive. “Don’t ask me. I don’t know, either. Ask Qiao Nian directly if you want to know.”","Qin Si immediately refused. “I’m not going to ask Sister Qiao. I’ll only ask if I have a problem. I’m not a gossipy woman.”","The corners of Gu San’s mouth twitched. Seeing that his expression immediately changed into a complicated one, he wanted to add, “Young Master Qin, actually, you can look in the mirror!”","Fortunately, Qin Si couldn’t hear his thoughts and did not notice his immediately rich expression.","Qin Si’s attention was all on the girl.","He saw the girl walk over from the stairs to where they were sitting. She picked up a bottle of Evian water and unscrewed the lid to drink.","After taking a sip, she placed the bottle down again. She was even more carefree than the few of them. She seemed to glance at them from the corner of her eye. Qin Si immediately sat up straight with a posture like a student who had been caught by his teacher doing something wrong.","Bo Jingxing frowned. He raised his hand and pushed the glasses on his nose bridge. “Qin Si, what are you doing? Why are you so shocked?”","There was some silence.","Only then did Qin Si realize that he had overreacted. A little embarrassed and guilty, he touched his earring and said perfunctorily, “My leg is cramping.”","Bo Jingxing said, “You’re fine sitting here, but your legs are cramping??”"]},{"number":1243,"title":"Chapter 1243 - Sister Nian: Sorry, I Don’t Have","paragraphs":["Qin Si knew how dry his lie was, but he had already said it. He couldn’t possibly tell everyone the truth at the last minute.","He sat up straight reflexively because the way Qiao Nian looked at him was too similar to the one his elementary school form teacher used to give him.","He was already an adult in his 20s, but he couldn’t say such words!","Qin Si could only brace himself. Under Bo Jingxing’s gentlemanly gaze, he forced himself to say, “Ah, I’ve been sitting for too long. My legs are cramping.”","Bo Jingxing looked at him meaningfully and did not expose his lame lie.","His thighs cramped and his back hurt?","Only an insensitive person like Qin Si would tell such a lie. No one with a brain could think of such a ridiculous reason!","Qiao Nian didn’t notice their antics.","She was mainly focused on the phone. She found a seat at the bar with her phone in one hand and listened to Jiang Li talk to her.","With one hand on the doorknob, he tapped his fingers on the table. “Well, tonight?”","“Yes, at the Imperial Mansion tonight. Nian Nian, do you have time to come out for a meal? Big Brother will also be there. He’s treating tonight.”","Qiao Nian had no feelings for Jiang Yao. After some thought, she rejected him. “I don’t have time tonight. You guys eat. Don’t worry about me.”","“You don’t have time to come over?”","Qiao Nian could hear the disappointment in Jiang Li’s voice. She pursed her lips. Actually, she didn’t want to refuse, but she didn’t want to have anything to do with the rest of the Jiang family. “Next time.”","Next time would be no next time.","Jiang Li wasn’t a fool. He could tell that Qiao Nian did not want to see Jiang Yao, nor did she want to sit at the same table as Jiang Xianrou and the others.","He recalled everything Jiang Xianrou had done and did not persuade her anymore. He changed the topic and spoke some more before hanging up.","Qiao Nian put the phone down after hanging up.","He happened to meet Ye Wangchuan’s gaze.","“Jiang Li?”","“Yes.” She put down the phone and said generously, “He asked me to have dinner with him tonight and made a reservation at the Imperial Mansion.”","“Other than him, did he call someone else?” Ye Wangchuan knew her too well. Qiao Nian might have gone if it was only Jiang Li.","As expected.","The girl’s exquisite eyebrows were eye-catching as she supported her chin with her hand and paused for a second. “Yes, the others from the Jiang family are also going. I’ll let them catch up. Don’t worry about me.”","Qin Si also guessed it. The corners of his lips curled up in disdain. “Sister Qiao, is the other member of the Jiang family Jiang Yao?”","He heard that Jiang Yao had been back for four to five days. He had not been ‘free’ to eat with Sister Qiao for the past four to five days. Now, he had the time to ‘summon’ her.","Hehe, get lost!","He had time, but Sister Qiao didn’t. Jiang Yao didn’t really think that the big shot was free. Anyone could ask him out for a meal.","He had been asking Qiao Nian out for half a month, but she had not eaten with him.","Qiao Nian didn’t admit or deny it. It was equivalent to tacitly agreeing that Jiang Yao was among the people having dinner tonight. However, her expression was cold. Clearly, she wasn’t interested in him. “I have a song to write. I haven’t finished it yet. I don’t have time to go.”","Qin Si restrained himself and did not ask if she did not have the time or did not want to go. In any case, only Jiang Li and Uncle Jiang were normal in the Jiang family. The others seemed to have something wrong with their heads, especially Jiang Xianrou, who would run out to disgust people from time to time.","He didn’t even bother to say it."]},{"number":1244,"title":"Chapter 1244 - Sister Nian: Do I Need Confidence to Enter the Group Stage??","paragraphs":["At this moment, Bo Jingxing changed the topic and asked about Qiao Nian’s competition, “Miss Qiao, are you confident in performing well in the group stage?”","The girl raised an eyebrow at him, her eyes arrogant and impatient.","Bo Jingxing heard the girl’s slightly hoarse voice. “It’s just a software competition. Do I need confidence?”","Bo Jingxing was stunned. A world-class competition didn’t require confidence?","He looked at the girl’s fair and cold face, as well as the arrogance she exuded.","Bo Jingxing’s furrowed brows relaxed again. He smiled and said gently, “That’s true. It’s enough for Miss Qiao to perform at a normal level.”","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze, seemingly a little more serious. She glanced at him and said slowly, “Don’t worry, I know how to read.”","With that, she looked past Bo Jingxing to Qin Si, who was listening to the two of them chatting and listening to the wise words. She was much more familiar with him. “Young Master Qin, when are you leaving?”","Qin Si was still immersed in his thoughts about what Bo Jingxing was saying. When did this guy get so close to Sister Qiao behind his back?","He was suddenly called out by her.","He snapped out of his shock and raised his hand to touch his high nose bridge. He felt that he was not confident enough in front of Qiao Nian. “Ah. I’ll leave immediately.”","Qin Si felt quite aggrieved after saying that.","He had followed Bo Jingxing and the others over and was about to be chased away.","He felt aggrieved.","Qiao Nian glanced at him with her clear eyes, seemingly inadvertently. “I’ll find time to help you upgrade your game account. You want an AK sniper rifle, right?”","The AK sniper rifle was a rare weapon in a game they had recently played. Not many people on the Internet had it.","Qiao Nian had one.","Qin Si wanted it.","He had been telling her about this a few days ago, but Qiao Nian had been busy and had no time to play with him.","He hurriedly said, “Yes, it’s the one in your backpack. I saved up some mission points and didn’t draw them. I’m afraid that the back of my hand will get lonely. Sister Qiao, help me draw it when you have time. I mainly want to get some of your luck.”","Qin Si thought of how difficult it was to draw that gun, so second-hand scalpers were selling it online. The price on the market had already reached six figures.","A few hundred thousand yuan.","For a virtual item in a game, this transaction price was already very high.","But it was very easy to sell.","It could be said that there was no shortage of buyers, only things!","Basically, as soon as a second-hand game trading platform was put up, it would be snatched away in a few minutes.","The arrogant Young Master Qin naturally did not lack hundreds of thousands of yuan. Qin Si was mainly indignant and did not want to spend money to buy it.","It was just a game. It was not fun to spend money on it.","He insisted on drawing it himself!","However, Qin Si was not only bad at games, but his luck at drawing items was also f*cking bad.","Zhang Yang, who played with him, had drawn a lot of precious items. Only he drew a consolation prize every time.","He couldn’t even compare to Zhang Yang, let alone a lucky person like Qiao Nian.","Only then did Qin Si think of asking Qiao Nian to help him draw it.","The dragon sniper rifle in the game was quite difficult to draw. Qiao Nian only had one. Qin Si was afraid that Qiao Nian would be under too much pressure, so he thought for a moment and said, “But it’s fine if you can’t draw it. It’s just a game. If I can’t draw it, I can go to the game and farm a few mission points.”"]},{"number":1245,"title":"Chapter 1245 - Master Wang: I Almost Laughed","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian knew that Qin Si had been eyeing the sniper rifle for a long time. She didn’t know whether to laugh or cry upon hearing what he said. She twisted her white wrist and said casually, “Okay. I’ll help you draw it. I’ll tell you when I get it.”","Qin Si achieved his goal today. He felt better and no longer felt aggrieved. He quickly got up and said, “Sister Qiao, I’ll treat you to a meal if you draw it.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes, feeling as if she had already drawn it. “I want to eat hotpot at the old place.”","Qin Si smiled, returning to his usual carefree manner. “Alright, I’ll go wherever you say.”","He turned his head and said to Ye Wangchuan seriously, “Master Wang, Sister Qiao likes that hotpot restaurant so much. Have you considered investing in a hotpot restaurant or something?”","!!","He knew that Ye Wangchuan had many businesses all over the country. For example, many hotels in Rao City were under him.","However, most of Ye Wangchuan’s investment business was just for fun.","Qin Si had never seen him care about them.","He had a feeling that other than these businesses, Master Wang had other businesses that he did not know about.","However, no matter how close they were as friends, he would not be insensible and insist on getting to the bottom of it if the other party did not want to say it.","Who didn’t have a secret or two these days?","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him coldly.","Qin Si immediately shut his mouth.","Bo Jingxing stood up and said to them, “I should leave soon. Miss Qiao, I won’t disturb you anymore. Good night.”","“Good night.” Qiao Nian looked up, still holding her phone in one hand. However, she put down her phone politely and looked up at him when he spoke to her.","Bo Jingxing nodded.","Qin Si leaned forward shamelessly. “Good night, Sister Qiao~ Remember to wash your hands before drawing for me! All the best!”","The corners of Qiao Nian’s mouth twitched. She was speechless. She almost wanted to say, “I take back what I said just now. You should draw it yourself!”","Fortunately, she held back.","Qin Si was just joking with her.","Then, he revealed a satisfied expression and followed Bo Jingxing out with a smile.","Seeing that they were about to leave, Gu San followed. “Young Master Qin, let me send you out.”","The apartment returned to its former peace after they left.","At this moment, Qiao Nian stood up and whispered to the man on the sofa, “You play first. I’ll go upstairs to settle something.”","“Do you want milk?” Ye Wangchuan knew that she had come out to be polite to the guests.","Since the “guests” had left, Qiao Nian must have something to do.","After all, she was quite busy.","“No, I drank too much tea in the afternoon. My stomach feels a little uncomfortable. I’ll just drink plain water.” Qiao Nian picked up the half-drunk Evian water and leisurely walked up. She said loudly, “I’m going up.”","Ye Wangchuan stared at the girl’s figure as she was about to go upstairs. He did not force her to stay. He only raised the corners of his eyes and said seductively, “Nian Nian, there are still 10 days.”","Qiao Nian was holding a bottle of mineral water and had one foot on the stairs. Hearing his words, she stopped and turned around, her eyes filled with confusion. “What 10 days?”","Seeing her confused expression, Ye Wangchuan gritted his teeth in anger and almost laughed."]},{"number":1246,"title":"Chapter 1246 - Don’t Tell Me You Want to Cheat?","paragraphs":["However, he still looked like a noble son on the surface. His Adam’s apple bobbed when he spoke. “I said that the end of my probation period is 10 days away. You’re not planning to deny it, are you?”","There was some silence.","Qiao Nian would have forgotten about it if he hadn’t mentioned it. She pursed her moist lips and her eyelashes fluttered.","The girl didn’t even look in his direction. Pretending to be calm, she reached out to pull the collar of her pajamas, lowered her hand, and let it hang by her side. “Oh, I didn’t forget.”","Ye Wangchuan saw that she looked away unnaturally. His thin lips curled up slightly, and the resentment she had neglected during this period of time instantly dissipated.","“You said yourself that there are only three months of probation. Once that’s over, I’m officially your boyfriend.”","He deliberately teased her, his voice so low that it was like a feather brushing gently against her heart. “Sister Qiao, I hope you’ll be as straightforward as you promised to help me play games with my account when you give me your last answer. Don’t give me another promotion period.”","He continued shamelessly, “After all, I’m old. The doctor said I have to suffer less and live a few more years.”","Ha!","Qiao Nian glanced at the man in his prime and recalled what he had said confidently. The corners of her eyes twitched. She raised the water bottle and said, “Well, let’s talk later. I’ll go up first.”","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl disappeared around the corner on the second floor. He took out his phone from his pocket and casually made a call.","The call was answered almost instantly.","“Luo Qing, go and find out why Lu Zhi hasn’t left.”","With that, he recalled the way the man in the wheelchair looked at Qiao Nian at the funeral.","He frowned and added, “Also, check what cooperation Tian Chen has had with the Red Alliance in the illegal district over the years.”","Ye Wangchuan put down his phone and sat in deep thought after hanging up.","His eyes narrowed slightly as if there was a cold pool inside. The light shone down from above, accentuating his perfect facial features.","Ye Wangchuan pursed his thin lips for a long time before moving. He picked up the bottle on the table and poured himself a glass of water.","He did not drink it immediately. Instead, he swirled it, his eyes filled with killing intent!","The country was not an illegal district. Lu Zhi would undoubtedly be courting death if he wanted to do whatever he wanted in Beijing!","Lu Zhi had better not be impudent. Otherwise... This was his territory. He had a thousand ways to let him know the rules.","...","Qiao Nian did not know that Ye Wangchuan had already begun to investigate Tian Chen’s background. After going up to the second floor, she returned to her room.","Wen Ruxia’s QQ video popped up.","Qiao Nian placed the mineral water bottle on the side of the computer table. Pulling out a stool and sitting cross-legged on it, she operated the mouse and opened the video. After clicking twice, she accepted Wen Ruxia’s video call.","Wen Ruxia’s well-maintained face immediately appeared on the video as soon as the video call went through. She was wearing a mint-green shirt today with a tied bow at the collar. The silky fabric and gentle color greatly reduced her strong aura, making her look elegant and proper, with a little more femininity.","Wen Ruxia also saw the girl on the other end of the video. The girl seemed to have just taken a shower and was wearing pajamas. Compared to the clothes she had carefully chosen, the girl was much more relaxed in terms of dressing and demeanor."]},{"number":1247,"title":"Chapter 1247 - So There’s Something That Big","paragraphs":["Wen Ruxia was no longer nervous upon seeing how natural Qiao Nian was. She smiled and greeted her. “Hello, Miss Qiao.”","“Hello.”","Wen Ruxia was someone Nie Mi had introduced to her and was also older than her. Qiao Nian was quite polite to her.","Her tone was not very intimate, but at least she respected her.","Qiao Nian didn’t stand on ceremony. After a simple greeting, she immediately got to the point. “I’ve almost changed the score for Spark. I’ll send it to you tonight.”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyelashes and calculated the time. Then, she gave a specific time. “It’ll take about an hour. I’m still a little short of finishing up.”","“Okay. I’m not in a hurry. Finish it and send it to me,” Wen Ruxia said immediately.","Qiao Nian nodded. “Okay, I’ll send it to your email after I’m done.”","“Okay.”","Seeing the girl’s overly eye-catching face, Wen Ruxia remembered what they had talked about during the meeting. She suddenly thought of something and asked Qiao Nian a second before she was about to hang up, “By the way, Miss Qiao, are you interested in doing an MV?”","Qiao Nian had almost hung up. She frowned slightly at this question. “MV?”","Wen Ruxia immediately said, “Isn’t our theme song for sports this time?","“We’re going to film a music video for a unit project to promote the Winter Games, but we haven’t found the female lead. Miss Qiao, why don’t you try it if you have time?”","The more Wen Ruxia thought about it, the more she felt that this was a good idea. She immediately talked about it. “You don’t have to worry about the time. We’re filming the music video to promote it. You just have to take half a day out. I’ll get the photographer to follow you and film some materials. You’re the creator of the theme song. If you can appear in the music video, I believe the final publicity effect will definitely explode...”","Qiao Nian listened to her talk excitedly about the MV. She didn’t want to interrupt her, but she had to. “I’m sorry, I don’t know how to skate.”","Wen Ruxia was a little stunned and almost stuttered. “Uh, you, you said you wouldn’t...”","“I don’t know how to ski.” Qiao Nian looked at her calmly and repeated what she had just said. “I also don’t know how to skate.”","The weather was warm around the city. It was spring all year round, and it rarely snowed in winter.","She had never had a chance to touch snow before.","Qiao Chen knew how to ski very well because Qiao Weimin and Shen Qiongzhi always brought her to places like the ice world.","But she’d never been there, so she couldn’t skate.","Wen Ruxia had never thought that there was anything that the ‘omnipotent’ big shot did not know how to do.","“...I don’t know how to ski.” She rubbed her temples and leaned back in her office chair as if thinking about the possibility that Qiao Nian didn’t know how to ski and skate. After thinking for a long time, she couldn’t think of a solution. She could only say, “Let me think about it again. I’ll tell you when I think of a way.”","Qiao Nian wanted to say that it was unnecessary because she didn’t want to film any MV at all.","However, Wen Ruxia was still thinking about this matter. She said anxiously, “Miss Qiao, I won’t talk to you for now. I’ll ask the production team. They should have professional equipment to solve this problem.”","With that, while thinking of looking for a professional to discuss a solution, she hung up the video call without giving Qiao Nian a chance to say anything."]},{"number":1248,"title":"Chapter 1248 - Do They Really Want to Hold a","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian was stunned for a moment. The video on her laptop had already turned black.","She propped her arm and closed the QQ chat box. As soon as she closed it, Wen Ruxia’s profile picture jumped into the message column again.","Qiao Nian had already taken out the score from the drawer, and she was holding a pencil in her left hand. She saw the QQ profile picture flashing in the corner of her notebook.","Qiao Nian propped her arm up again and clicked it with a frown.","[Wen: Right, Nian Nian, I forgot to tell you. The MV director we’re looking for this time is George Lucas.]","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and stared at the name. She was finally a little interested.","...","On the other side, at the Imperial Mansion.","The black Bentley stopped at the door. The waiter in charge of parking immediately went up to help them open the door.","“Madam Jiang, Miss Jiang.”","In the backseat, Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru sat side by side, each dressed up.","Tang Wanru was wearing a cheongsam.","Jiang Xianrou, on the other hand, was wearing a light yellow dress with a long beige windbreaker, looking like a socialite.","The two of them got out of the car one after another. They should have been a very eye-catching mother-daughter pair, but neither Tang Wanru nor Jiang Xianrou looked good.","It couldn’t be considered a scowl, right? At least, they were not in a good mood!","Especially Jiang Xianrou. After getting out of the car, she looked up and saw the words “Congratulations on Qiao Nian’s good results in the software competition” playing continuously in bright red on the mobile broadcast at the entrance of the Imperial Mansion. So ugly!","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bit.ly/3NSnQtR \" to support us","They almost squeezed their bags and went back.","“Xianrou, what did I tell you before I came?” Tang Wanru saw through her thoughts. Her eyes were cold as she took a deep breath. “...You have to keep calm no matter what.”","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t help but show her emotions on her face. She immediately widened her almond-shaped eyes slightly, feeling a little angry and embarrassed. She lowered her voice and said, “What are my father and brother trying to do? Do they really want to hold a celebration party for Qiao Nian?”","Tang Wanru was calmer than her. She tidied the hair on her shoulder and said unhurriedly, “What else?”","Crazy!","Jiang Xianrou suppressed her temper and did not curse.","Their families had already split up. Qiao Nian had just entered a competition’s group stage. It wasn’t like she had gotten first place. Did her father and the others have to go so far?","Tang Wanru could tell that she was suppressing her anger and warned her in advance, “Let me remind you first. You have to calm down and finish this meal today no matter what. You’re not allowed to let your father see your dissatisfaction at the dining table. Do you understand?”","Jiang Xianrou pursed her red lips tightly. She took a deep breath, then another. After repeating this a few times, she finally calmed down a little. She tightened her grip on her bag and said, “I understand.”","“Mm.”","How could Tang Wanru not be angry? How could she not feel that Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao were up to something? It was just that Jiang Yao had told her at home about the importance of Qiao Nian’s nomination competition.","He had already said that Qiao Nian had entered the group stage and brought honor to her country.","They wanted to give Qiao Nian a celebration party. Could she say no?","However, she was somewhat indignant!","Tang Wanru’s expression darkened slightly as she looked at the congratulatory words at the entrance. The jealousy and hatred she had painstakingly suppressed almost erupted again.","She forced herself to look away and pretend she didn’t see it. As she walked in, she asked her daughter, “Did you go to the television station today?”"]},{"number":1249,"title":"Chapter 1249 - Jiang Xianrou Also Likes the","paragraphs":["“How did you know?” Jiang Xianrou was shocked.","Tang Wanru ignored her shocked gaze and continued, “Why did you go to the television station?”","Jiang Xianrou was silent for a moment before telling her, “It’s nothing. I heard that a promotional video for the sports competition is going to be filmed in China. The Wen family found the world-renowned director, George Lucas. I just want to try. It will be a bonus for me if I can get the female lead role.”","Their circle looked down on people who entered the entertainment industry. It was fine to play, but it would be embarrassing if they played like Jiang Li.","Jiang Xianrou had long planned her future.","She had never thought of entering the entertainment industry, nor did she care about it.","However, she had a brother who was a top celebrity. There was no reason not to use this connection!","Therefore, she went to the television station to see Wen Ruxia and suggested to her that she could film this MV with Jiang Li.","Tang Wanru’s brows relaxed slightly when she heard this. She guessed that Jiang Xianrou had an idea and tacitly agreed to her daughter tying up her son. She asked, “What did Wen Ruxia say?”","“I didn’t see her.” Jiang Xianrou swung her bag, feeling even more frustrated. “I went to the television station, but I was stopped by her assistant before I could see her. She said that she was in a meeting and couldn’t see me today. The assistant didn’t know when she would finish the meeting, so I came back.”","Tang Wanru was not surprised by this outcome. After a moment of silence, she said, “Don’t worry about this. I’ll probe her later.”","Jiang Xianrou nodded and was slightly less frustrated. However, her expression turned cold and stern when they were about to reach the private room. “Yes.”","In the blink of an eye, they had already stopped in front of the private room they booked for tonight.","Before entering, Tang Wanru said in a low voice, “Xianrou, the MV is just a bonus. You have to get this straight. Your current focus is to pass Master Cheng’s laboratory assessment as soon as possible! As long as you enter Master Cheng’s team, your father and brother will naturally focus on you. When the time comes, you and your cousin will be strangers! Do you understand what I mean?”","“I understand.”","How could Jiang Xianrou not understand what she meant? Qiao Nian had only been able to make a name for herself in the Jiang family because she had entered the group competition and brought honor to her family and country.","She would naturally be the most dazzling person if she could fight for greater glory for her family.","The future of the Jiang family would return to her shoulders.","This included the grandfather who gave the old residence to her uncle’s family. He would also reconsider the heir.","Jiang Xianrou held her breath and smirked to prepare herself. She said with a fake smile, “Let’s go, Mom. Let’s go in.”","In the private room, Jiang Yao and Jiang Zongnan were both present.","Other than them, her aunt’s family was also present, together with a few relatives of the family.","“Xianrou, you’re here.”","When the Jiang family’s aunt saw Tang Wanru and her daughter enter, she immediately waved enthusiastically at her with an obsequious expression.","“Come and sit here. I reserved a seat for you.”","Her maternal grandmother was middle-aged and senior among her relatives. Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao left her the main seat out of respect for their elders.","However, Yuan Qing seemed to not know who the main character of today’s meal was. She pulled Jiang Xianrou over affectionately and said with a smile, “I haven’t seen you for a long time. I miss you. How about Xianrou sit beside me today"]},{"number":1250,"title":"Chapter 1250 - Dad Said He Wasn’t Coming","paragraphs":["Jiang Yao had arranged the main seat for her. The seat beside her was also one of the main seats. He had originally planned to leave it for Qiao Nian.","However, Yuan Qing pulled Jiang Xianrou to the seat that originally belonged to Qiao Nian like an old fool.","Jiang Yao’s eyebrows immediately twitched. He couldn’t help but shout, “Grandma, that seat...”","Yuan Qing pretended to be stupid and looked at him in confusion. She even asked him shamelessly, “Seat? What seat? Am I sitting wrongly? Aiya, let me give up my seat.”","She looked as if she wanted to give up the main seat.","How could Jiang Yao let an elder sit at the side? He endured it and his face twitched. “No, Aunt, sit.”","Yuan Qing continued the game. “Ah, I didn’t make a mistake. Then, I’ll sit down?”","She sat down and immediately grabbed Jiang Xianrou’s hand. She did not give Jiang Yao a chance to ask to say anything and started nagging.","Jiang Xianrou also knew whose seat this was from Jiang Yao’s reaction, but she had no intention of giving it up. She pretended not to know and chatted with Yuan Qing casually, not looking at him.","Tang Wanru also found a seat and sat beside Jiang Zongnan. Seeing this scene, a mocking sneer flashed across her eyes. She did not remind Jiang Xianrou to give up the main seat and instead turned to the middle-aged man. “Zongnan, why isn’t Dad here yet? Do you want me to get the driver to pick him up?”","Due to Yuan Qing’s seniority, Jiang Zongnan was as embarrassed as Jiang Yao to make things too clear. However, seeing that Qiao Nian’s seat had been taken by Jiang Xianrou, he felt a slight headache coming on. He replied absent-mindedly, “Dad said that his health wasn’t good, so he didn’t come.”","A trace of coldness flashed across Tang Wanru’s eyes. Heh, what did he mean by not feeling well? The old fox was clearly angry with them and was unwilling to come.","She didn’t mind. Anyway, Old Master Jiang was already old. The Jiang family’s connections were basically in their hands, and the family had split up.","Since everyone was unwilling to do their job well, she also couldn’t be bothered to do her job!","She smiled and did what a daughter-in-law should do in front of Jiang Zongnan; she pretended to be concerned. “What’s wrong with Dad again?”","She paused for a second and asked worriedly, “The climate has changed a lot these past few days. Did Dad catch a cold? Should we get a doctor to take a look at him?”","Look how concerned he was.","No one could find any fault with her.","Jiang Zongnan’s tense nerves also relaxed because of her concern. He looked at her with a gentle expression. “It’s fine. Dad’s been much stronger than before ever since he started taking the health supplements Nian Nian bought for him. He probably didn’t rest well tonight.”","He knew very well why Old Master Jiang did not come. However, his head hurt as if an electric drill had drilled through it when he thought about it.","“Forget it, don’t worry about Dad. He’s old, and it’s good for his body to do less. It takes a lot of time to come and go. It’s nighttime, too. If he doesn’t come, so be it. We’ll just eat. It’s just that Big Brother and Nian Nian haven’t arrived yet. We don’t know when they’ll come. We can only wait for them and start the banquet when everyone is here.”","Of course, Tang Wanru saw that Qiao Nian was not here yet.","She had already mentally prepared herself. Her reaction was indifferent when Qiao Nian was mentioned. She did not comment. “It’s okay. Let’s wait.”","“Yeah.”","The door of the private room was pushed open from the outside as soon as Jiang Zongnan finished speaking."]},{"number":1251,"title":"Chapter 1251 - Face Slap! Sorry, None of You Them Coming!","paragraphs":["Jiang Li, who had dyed his hair, came in from outside. Compared to the Jiang family’s formal clothes, he was dressed very casually, as if he had just rushed over from the work site after filming an advertisement. His motorcycle jacket was especially eye-catching.","As soon as Jiang Li entered, he saw that the main seat had been occupied. There were only three empty seats in the huge private room, and none of them were good.","He restrained the mockery in his eyes and smirked. He retracted his gaze and casually greeted the elders of the Jiang family. Then, he walked straight to one of the three empty seats and pulled out a chair to sit down.","Seeing that he was here, Jiang Yao looked up and finally couldn’t help but ask him, suppressing his dissatisfaction, “Where’s Qiao Nian? She’s not here yet? Where is she?”","“You mean Nian Nian.” Jiang Li glanced at the main guest seat they had not left for Qiao Nian at all and smiled perfunctorily. “Oh, she’s not coming.”","Jiang Yao was stunned and couldn’t react for a long time. “What did you say? Qiao Nian is...” Not coming?","They had gathered so many people tonight to hold a celebration party for Qiao Nian. In the end, Jiang Li had belatedly told them that the main character of the night was not coming?","Jiang Yao couldn’t accept this outcome at all. “You didn’t tell her that we prepared a celebration party for her tonight?”","“I did. She’s not free.” Jiang Li asked casually, “Brother came back for more than a week and didn’t have time to eat with Nian Nian?”","Jiang Yao retorted in frustration. “I...!”","“What’s that?” Jiang Li glanced at him leisurely, snatched his words, and looked in Jiang Xianrou’s direction.","Jiang Yao endured it. He couldn’t say it in front of so many relatives.","That was because Jiang Xianrou had told him that Qiao Nian was only participating in the competition to show off. He didn’t have a good impression of his younger cousin, whom he had never met.","He had just returned and was so busy. Since he didn’t have a good impression of his cousin, Jiang Yao definitely did not have time to meet her.","Who knew that Qiao Nian would enter the group stage?","Jiang Li asked him disapprovingly, “What is it?”","Jiang Yao was speechless for a moment.","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","Xianrou was his biological sister. They had grown up together. He couldn’t possibly say in front of his relatives that he had misunderstood Qiao Nian because of Jiang Xianrou.","Jiang Li knew what he was thinking when he saw his reaction. He sneered and continued coldly, “Alright, when you’re busy, Nian Nian is also busy. I called Nian Nian, and she said that she has to prepare for the competition and doesn’t have time to come over. She told us to eat by ourselves.”","Jiang Li had been worried that Qiao Nian would offend them too much if she didn’t come. Now, it seemed that she was lucky not to have come!","The main seat had already been occupied. What kind of celebration banquet was Jiang Yao calling it? A celebration party for who?","If he didn’t know who was celebrating today, he would have thought that it was Jiang Xianrou’s celebration party.","Jiang Yao was speechless. His face was a little hot, but he couldn’t deny that Jiang Li’s words were right.","However, if Qiao Nian didn’t come, wouldn’t tonight’s celebration be a joke?","Jiang Yao was annoyed when his phone rang. It was a message.","He read the message quickly and looked even more embarrassed. He looked up and said to the entire Jiang family, “Uncle just sent me a message saying that he’s holding a seminar and won’t be coming.”","Old Master Jiang wasn’t coming.","Qiao Nian wasn’t coming.","Even Jiang Zongjin wasn’t coming.","The Jiang family ate as much as they could during this celebration banquet. After the meal, everyone was distracted and had no appetite. It ended hastily."]},{"number":1252,"title":"Chapter 1252 - Who Is the One Who Has Not Seen the World?!","paragraphs":["Jiang Yao found an excuse to leave the private room first.","As soon as he left, Jiang Zongnan’s company called. He temporarily went out to answer the call.","After the two of them left, the oppressive atmosphere in the private room instantly relaxed. Aunt and her family were the first to relax.","First, Aunt enjoyed the dishes cooked by the Imperial Mansion’s chef. Then, she suddenly said with a snort, “That Qiao Nian is really something. Jiang Yao specially booked a private room in the Imperial Mansion to celebrate, but she actually didn’t come. I wouldn’t have come if I knew. She didn’t even tell me earlier, causing the entire family to wait for her. She’s indeed a country bumpkin from Rao City. She’s so petty and has no upbringing.”","Although her words were unpleasant, she was not polite at all when she ate the dishes at the banquet. Although she was old, Yuan Qing was definitely one of the people who ate the most tonight.","She didn’t care who she benefited from to have a chance to eat at a place like the Imperial Mansion.","The others all belittled Qiao Nian.","“She only entered the group competition, it’s not like she got first place. Is it worth being so arrogant?”","After saying that, Aunt took another sip of the celebratory wine that Jiang Yao had prepared for Qiao Nian. She swirled the wine glass and put it down, unable to hide her mocking smile. “But it’s not her fault. Think about her experience. Before she turned 18, she stayed in a third-tier city like Rao City. She only came to Beijing in September. I don’t think she even knows what kind of place the Imperial Mansion is...”","Yuan Qing’s tone was extremely arrogant and disdainful.","It was not that she looked down on Qiao Nian.","The reason she said that was because that was what she thought.","The Jiang family had split up.","The connections and assets went to Jiang Zongnan’s family.","Her little nephew only received a small portion of the real estate and an old residence. So what if the old residence was valuable? It was impossible for Jiang Zongjin to sell the house.","Jiang Zongjin would forever be a poor teacher if he didn’t sell the house.","Although the position of a professor at Qing University was glamorous, he was still very poor. He had no money or status. How could he compare to Jiang Zongnan, who had inherited the family’s business?","By the same logic, how could Qiao Nian compare to Jiang Xianrou?","The circle that Jiang Xianrou was in was of a level that an ordinary family like hers had never heard of. Her son had relied on Jiang Xianrou to get a job previously, so Jiang Xianrou called someone called Zhang Yang and arranged it.","Yuan Qing had heard from Tang Wanru that Zhang Yang was not the most powerful person Jiang Xianrou knew. He was just a small fry.","Jiang Xianrou also knew the people and circles above.","Therefore, in her eyes, it was normal for them to come to the Imperial Mansion. Jiang Xianrou often came here.","However, Qiao Nian was similar to her, but her conditions were even worse. Her friends envied her when she bragged to them that she was coming to the Imperial Mansion for dinner tonight.","Qiao Nian had the chance to come and still put on airs. She just didn’t know the level of the Imperial Mansion!","Yuan Qing looked at the table full of good dishes again and remembered what her son had told her previously. The Imperial Mansion chefs were all Cantonese chefs. They could make state banquets. Her expression became even more disdainful. She despised Qiao Nian’s behavior.","Ignorant!","She was the only one talking in the private room. Her son and grandson were fine. Their personalities were not as unscrupulous as hers. It was mainly because they were still young and could not bring themselves to say bad things behind others’ backs. They couldn’t say anything about their family, so they buried their heads in their food and pretended not to hear."]},{"number":1253,"title":"Chapter 1253 - Sister Nian Didnt Answer His Call","paragraphs":["Yuan Qing glared at them. Thinking that her family would have to curry favor with Jiang Zongnan’s family in the future, she rolled his eyes and planned to continue speaking ill of Qiao Nian.","“She...”","Before she could finish, Jiang Li, who was sitting opposite her, threw his chopsticks on the table and interrupted her. “I’m done. I have a new song to record tonight, so I won’t accompany you.”","He pulled out a chair and stood up. Without even looking at his aunt, he said to the other relatives, “Uncles, please enjoy. I’ll leave first.”","“Jiang Li, are you full?”","!!","“Yes, you didn’t eat much. Why don’t you eat some more? It’s just a meal. It won’t delay your work.”","The other relatives tried to persuade him.","Jiang Li smiled casually and then said firmly, “No, I’m really busy. I’ll leave first. Uncles, please enjoy.”","He turned and walked away.","He did not speak to Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou and left without looking back.","In the blink of an eye, the door of the private room closed.","Aunt’s expression was awkward. Her neck was stiff, and her face turned green, white, and a little hot.","She wanted to scold Jiang Li for not giving her face as an elder.","She was clearly the most senior person at this table. Jiang Li had greeted everyone before he left, but he had missed her twice in a row. Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that he was targeting her and making her, an elder, embarrassed.","However, Jiang Li was from the second branch of the family. She was still hoping that Jiang Zongnan would arrange a job for her grandson after he graduated.","She wanted to flare up a few times, but she forcefully endured it. Jiang Li had been gone for a long time before she squeezed out a strange expression. “Hehe, Jiang Li is quite close to his cousin. No wonder. I only said a few words and didn’t mean to scold her. He didn’t even eat and left just like that.”","What she meant was self-evident.","Didn’t she mean that Jiang Li was in cahoots with Qiao Nian!","Tang Wanru was so angry that she lost her grip on her chopsticks. She had no appetite to eat, to begin with, and now, she had lost her appetite because of Yuan Qing’s words. Her face was ashen as she silently wiped her mouth and said coldly, “I’m full.”","Outside.","Jiang Yao did not go far after he came out. He left the private room and walked through the corridor. He found a quiet corner and frowned slightly. After some thought, he took out his phone and called Qiao Nian.","The first call went unanswered.","He didn’t give up and called her a second time.","The second call kept ringing, but no one answered.","Jiang Yao’s handsome face was a little embarrassed, but when he thought of Jiang Li’s words, the dissatisfaction that had just gathered in his chest instantly dissipated.","He held back and called a third time.","This time, it rang only once before a female voice was heard.","“Hello, Qiao...” Jiang Yao said impatiently. He had yet to finish calling her name when the rest of his words became stuck in his throat.","“I’m sorry, the number you’ve dialed is switched off.” The cold, mechanical female voice came from the other end of the phone as if a slap had been delivered to his face.","Jiang Yao had been the most outstanding person in the Jiang family since he was young.","After becoming an adult, he successfully entered Tian Chen Company to work in the world’s most cutting-edge technology research and development. This job sounded like he was working for someone, but the place he entered was Tian Chen!"]},{"number":1254,"title":"Chapter 1254 - 99,999 Yuan, and Don’t Feel the Feel Pressure","paragraphs":["Tian Chen’s people could come into contact with the world’s most advanced technology, the best scientific research laboratories, and obtain first-hand information.","The environment he came into contact with was different from Jiang Xianrou’s. It was not only Beijing and China. The people he came into contact with were all elites among elites in the world.","As the pride of the Jiang family, this was the first time Jiang Yao had suffered such a loss. However, the person who embarrassed him was none other than his own cousin.","Jiang Yao rubbed his throbbing forehead and sighed.","Since Qiao Nian was not answering his calls, he could only use other methods to contact her.","!!","Fortunately, he had added the girl on WeChat through Jiang Li’s QR code. Jiang Yao scrolled through Qiao Nian’s profile picture on WeChat.","The girl’s posts over the last three days showed up.","It was empty.","It was obvious that she was not someone who liked to post about her private life.","Jiang Yao looked at the girl’s profile picture next. It was white and as clean as her feed. If not for the nickname on WeChat, he would have thought that it was an unused account.","[QN].","Jiang Yao stared at the WeChat account and thought for a moment. He really didn’t know what he could say.","He transferred some money via WeChat.","The transfer could be accompanied by a message, so he left a message.","...","By the time Qiao Nian was done editing the remaining scores, it was already 10 PM.","She tested the tone of the revised score and sent it to Wen Ruxia’s email after making sure it was okay. She tossed her pen and went to the bathroom to take a cold shower. Then, she came out in a bathrobe and poured herself a glass of hot water.","Qiao Nian held the glass in one hand and picked up her cell phone, which she had switched off and was charging, with the other. She stood casually.","Her cell phone lit up.","Several notifications came in.","Du Mingwei sent her the time of the group competition, the questions they were predicting this time, and some information.","Shen Yugui did not say anything. He only said that she had been given half a month of leave to prepare for the competition.","The other messages were from Liang Bowen and the others.","Liang Bowen asked if she was going to release a new song.","Without another word, Qiao Nian sent the newly written song to him. She scrolled through the other messages.","The penultimate message was from Jian Jin. “Qiao, when are you free? I’m in Beijing. Shall we meet? I have something for you.”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and rested her elbow on the desk. She called her back and arranged a time to meet. Then, she took a sip of hot water and clicked on the last notification.","It was from Jiang Yao.","She clicked on it casually and saw a transfer record.","99,999.","There was also a message: [Nian Nian, why aren’t you here for dinner? Congratulations on entering the group stage. This is a token of my appreciation. Don’t feel pressured and take it.]","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. After looking at them for a long time, she felt that the amount was a little funny.","How much did Jiang Xianrou’s family look down on her that they felt that she would feel pressured if they sent her just 100,000 yuan?","Qiao Nian did not accept it or reply.","She quickly deleted the message.","Initially, she wanted to drag Jiang Yao into the blacklist. However, she thought better of it.","She didn’t like Jiang Xianrou and the others, nor did she care to be associated with them. However, no matter what, Jiang Li and Jiang Zongjin had an inseparable blood relationship with the Jiang family, including her grandfather.","She couldn’t go too far even if it just meant giving these people face."]},{"number":1255,"title":"Chapter 1255 - Sister Nian: Sorry, I Have More Than Enough","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian pretended not to see it. She didn’t delete Jiang Yao’s WeChat, but she had set up a message block.","Even though she did not delete Jiang Yao’s WeChat this time, she couldn’t be bothered to deal with these people!","However, Qiao Nian remembered something when she saw Jiang Yao’s message—Old Master Jiang was almost done with his pills.","She frowned slightly and realized that not only was Old Master Jiang’s medicine almost finished, but the little bun, Old Master Su... and the others were also running out of medicine.","Annoyed, Qiao Nian looked at the date. There were still a few days before the competition would resume.","!!","She set the glass on the table and calculated the time.","There was enough time...","...","Qiao Nian was very busy for the next few days.","Sometimes, Gu San couldn’t even find her.","She left Rhine Apartments early in the morning and returned at night. Often when she returned, she would plunge into her room to continue her work.","She worked like this for a few days. On the day of the group competition, the tired girl came down from the second floor and casually threw him a bottle.","Her voice was hoarse and low. “Help me pass it to Master Cheng. Tell him that this is half a year’s worth. He can take less of it now.”","“Miss Qiao, this is...” Gu San looked at the bottle of white pills in shock.","Miss Qiao came up with another bottle!","He estimated the number of small pills in the bottle. There were about 10 of them. The black market would definitely explode if this number of pills was placed on it.","One had to know that the pills had been out of stock on the black market for a long time.","In the past, First Miss could still buy one pill for a seven-figure sum. Now, she might not even be able to buy a small pill made by Miss Qiao.","Buying this medicine on the black market was no longer a matter of money!","Nobody could buy it even with money.","He had been worried since Master Cheng’s medicine was almost finished, but he was too embarrassed to tell Qiao Nian about it. After all, Miss Qiao had been so busy recently. How could he have the cheek to get her to take time out of her competition to do all this?","He had asked Master Wang before, and Master Wang meant to buy it on the black market.","He was already prepared to search for the remaining pills on the market through various channels. He did not expect Miss Qiao to give him another bottle when he was already prepared to spend money to find them.","“Miss Qiao, is it okay to give all these to Master Cheng?” Gu San was still worried and turned to follow the girl.","“What’s the problem?”","Qiao Nian did not sleep the entire night. She walked to the fridge, opened it, took out a carton of milk, and poured herself a glass.","Yawning, she belatedly realized what Gu San meant and replied casually, “Oh. Yes, sure. Give it to him. I have some more.”","Gu San saw that the girl couldn’t even be bothered to look up. His lips twitched. He would have thought the pills were worthless if he had not known their value, that was why Qiao Nian said it so casually.","But the problem was that Miss Qiao knew how much this thing was worth.","Miss Qiao had even auctioned this thing on the black market before. It was obvious that she knew how much this bottle of medicine was worth.","She was not short of money!","Gu San was envious.","He held the eight-figure-worth pills that Qiao Nian had given him. Looking up, he wanted to say something but hesitated. There were a few times when he wanted to ask the girl, “Boss, are you still short of people? I think I can do it!”","But he held back silently.","Following Miss Qiao was really tempting, but Master Wang had helped him a lot. He couldn’t betray him for money.","Gu San entertained the thought but did not act on it. He watched as the girl finished the milk in her cup and prepared to leave.","He immediately followed her and said obsequiously, “Miss Qiao, are you going to Qing University? Let me drive you!”"]},{"number":1256,"title":"Chapter 1256 - Sister Nian: I Don’t Feel Anything","paragraphs":["Du Mingwei and the teachers from the Computing Faculty were already there when Qiao Nian arrived outside the arts building.","Du Mingwei heaved a sigh of relief upon seeing that the girl had arrived on time. He quickly walked up to Qiao Nian, his lips pursed tightly. He hid his nervousness and asked, “Qiao Nian, how are your preparations?”","The other three people from the group competition had already arrived. They were all sitting in front of their computers. The staff had already checked their belongings. All that was missing was Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian would definitely be entering the venue soon.","Du Mingwei would be lying if he said he wasn’t nervous.","After all, this was the first time that China had entered the group stage of the international software competition. Qiao Nian was under pressure, and so was he.","His cell phone was about to explode these days.","They were all people who had inquired about their group’s preparation progress.","Du Mingwei looked at the girl who had her hands in her pockets and couldn’t help but smile helplessly.","How could he know how prepared Qiao Nian was?","He had originally wanted to get the computer science teachers to team up and give Qiao Nian some knowledge about the competition. The principal had disagreed, saying that Qiao Nian did not need it.","Du Mingwei did not understand why Qiao Nian didn’t need it anymore. But since Principal Liang had personally spoken, he could only give up helplessly!","Qiao Nian walked over and handed her backpack to the security staff for inspection. The brim of her black duck tongue cap was lowered, covering her dark eyes that had not rested well. She looked quite wild.","“It’s alright.”","“It’s alright?” Du Mingwei was not sure how far she had gone in her preparations. He stood uneasily beside Qiao Nian and touched the bridge of his nose. He lowered his hand and asked, “Have you seen the competition videos I sent you?”","“I have.”","Du Mingwei saw that the girl’s expression was indifferent. He wasn’t sure if she had really watched them, but he instinctively believed that Qiao Nian would not lie. “What do you think after seeing them?”","Eh?","Qiao Nian did not quite understand what he meant. She didn’t answer him immediately. Restraining the anger in her dark eyes, she raised her wrist and pulled down the brim of her cap. Then, she said slowly, “I don’t feel anything.”","Du Mingwei was speechless.","Don’t feel anything????","He felt even more uncertain. He didn’t know what Qiao Nian meant by that.","Du Mingwei stood beside the girl. He wanted to ask her to explain what she meant, but he was afraid of giving the girl too much pressure, so he endured it.","At the same time, the security personnel was checking Qian Nian’s backpack. They emptied it and realized that there were not many things inside.","Other than a cell phone and a pair of earphones, Qiao Nian had a pen, a bottle of chewing gum, and a notebook in her bag.","The security man flipped through her notebook.","The notebook paper was white and clean. It was basically unused. Only a few scribbled notes were written in a watercolor pen in the middle.","It looked like the beginnings of a musical score.","The girl’s handwriting was messy and casual, perhaps a little arrogant.","The security officer was not sure what was written in her notebook after reading it a few times. Thus, he silently confiscated the notebook and the cell phone.","Then, he put the remaining items back and returned them to Qiao Nian. “Alright, you can go in.”","Qiao Nian took the remaining items and turned to Du Mingwei. “Teacher Du, I’ll go in first.”","She was going in now?","Du Mingwei had mixed feelings and was completely uncertain."]},{"number":1257,"title":"Chapter 1257 - Someone Was Extremely Shocked","paragraphs":["He faced the quiet oval face under the girl’s cap and silently suppressed his worries. Then, he reached out, patted the girl’s shoulder, and forced a smile. “Well, don’t feel too pressured!”","Qiao Nian looked up. Her eyes were dark, and there was a hint of light in them. She raised her hand and tugged at the brim of her cap again. Her voice was hoarse. “Yes.”","...","Qiao Nian entered the competition venue.","The teachers of the Computing Faculty gathered outside, almost like a hill.","They watched as Du Mingwei sent Qiao Nian in. After he returned, they immediately surrounded him.","“Professor Du, what did Qiao Nian say?”","“Did she look at the information we compiled for her? And did she watch all the videos of the past competitions?”","Du Mingwei fished a pack of cigarettes from his pocket, took one out, and lit it. A big man said against everyone’s pressure, “She said she saw them. Let’s just wait!”","He took a puff of his cigarette and looked at the screen that showed the results. He took a deep breath and continued in a deep voice, “We have no other choice other than waiting for the results. So, let’s wait together! We’ll wait for the results.”","The computing faculty teachers looked at each other and fell silent.","What he said was true.","This was the first time the country had been shortlisted for the group stage in this competition. They didn’t have any experience in this stage. Moreover, the student who advanced was not even from the Computing Faculty.","They could do nothing but wait for the results.","They would wait, then!","...","The group stage was online as well, like the qualifying round. There were four people in a group, and they were divided into four groups: A, B, C, and D. Only the first place in each group could enter the finals.","Dear readers!you are reading on our content stealing site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bom.so/sBJMIa \" to support us","The rules of this competition were almost the same as the preliminaries, but there were actually differences. For example, everyone could see the live broadcast of the preliminaries, but the group stage involved some core technology in the computer field. Therefore, unlike the preliminaries, the group stage would not be broadcast to the public.","Everyone could only wait for the final results.","In the arts building.","Other than the Qing University professors led by Du Mingwei, a few blond foreigners were also occupying one side of the building. They were also waiting for the results of the competition.","They all saw Qiao Nian, who had just entered.","Seeing the girl take her backpack in, they gathered together and muttered to each other.","“The person who went in just now is the representative of China this year? She looks very young.”","“And it’s a woman. What computing does a woman know!” someone said proudly, with the arrogance of a man who looked down on the local computing scene and women.","The others did not attack Qiao Nian’s gender, but they also disdained China’s computer technology. Hearing this, they sneered.","“They probably chose her at random.” The person who said this could not hide his arrogance. He spoke fluently in a foreign language. “I can only say that the quality of the people in this round’s qualifiers is too poor. They actually got into the group stage. But it’s nothing. The last person in Group C has been decided internally. It’s a good thing for us!”","They talked animatedly, but one person did not join in their discussion.","None of these people thought highly of China’s computer technology, nor did they think highly of Qiao Nian’s ability. With just a few words, they had already placed the last place on Qiao Nian’s head. It was as if they did not need to look at the final results. The top three might not be anyone, but the last place would definitely be someone from China!","Only one of them had a look of shock on his mature and handsome face. He looked in the direction the girl had gone in and opened his mouth several times. His lips trembled uncontrollably as if he was surprised, nervous, and afraid."]},{"number":1258,"title":"Chapter 1258 - Don’t Ask, Sister Nian Is Number One","paragraphs":["Someone noticed his unsociable reaction, clapped him on the shoulder, and shouted, “Professor Alexander, what’s wrong?”","The man, however, reacted as if he had been shocked. His face turned pale and he muttered, “It’s her? That can’t be.”","What?","The others looked at him, confused.","Alexander did not look at anyone. He just stared in the direction Qiao Nian had gone in, lost in thought for a long time.","He thought he saw Sun.","That couldn’t be possible, right?","Why would that big shot who was already a god in the hacker field participate in such a competition???","He must be seeing things!","...","The competition ended at 12 o’clock sharp. Qiao Nian was the first to come out. After she came out, she picked up her cell phone at the security check and saw the message from Jian Jin. She greeted Du Mingwei and the others before leaving.","She left, but Du Mingwei and the others did not dare to leave.","All of them were nervous and excited as they waited for the final results.","The area around Du Mingwei’s feet was littered with cigarette butts. He waited for five minutes, but the results were still not refreshed. He stubbed out his cigarette, his eyebrows twitching. He asked the teacher beside him in a low voice, “What’s going on? Why aren’t the results out yet?”","The teacher also shook his head in confusion. “I don’t know. The results should be out by now!”","Just as his voice fell.","Someone shouted nervously, “It’s refreshed!”","Du Mingwei was nervous and did not dare to look at it for some time. Then, he took a deep breath and mustered his courage to look at the screen.","No. 1, Qiao Nian, China, Qing University’s Chinese Medicine Faculty!","The red letters on the first row of letters marked Group C’s results. They even thoughtfully translated it again into a foreign language. It was written clearly.","NO. 1, QIAO NIAN, CHINA!","Qiao Nian, China, no.1!","Du Mingwei could hardly believe what he was seeing. His mind went blank for a long time, unable to think of anything.","Staring at the results on the screen in a daze, he asked the person beside him, “I think I saw Qiao Nian get first place in Group C.”","“Professor Du, be more confident. Cut it out!” The teacher’s voice was trembling with excitement. “Qiao Nian won first place in Group C. We entered the finals this year!”","First!","She was really first!","Du Mingwei gasped and rubbed his eyes to make sure.","The words on the screen were still rolling.","But no matter how they looked at it, the person in first place was a name they were familiar with.","No. 1, Qiao Nian, China!","Du Mingwei clenched his fists in excitement and his eyes turned red. He immediately said to the teachers who were shouting excitedly, “I’ll call Principal Liang and tell him the good news.”","He himself was so happy that he could barely find his bearings as he walked. It took him a while to get out of the arts building and find a quiet place to make the call.","...","At the Ye residence.","Liang Conglin was drinking tea with Old Master Ye. Seeing the energetic Old Master leisurely cutting the flower branches in front of him, he drank the entire pot of tea and finally could not help but ask Ye Maoshan, “Old Master Ye, why did you call me here today?”","Ye Maoshan glanced at him and slowly put down the scissors. He took off his gloves and placed them on the flower stand. He was especially calm. “I’m fine. I just asked you to come over and see how my pot of orchid is blooming.”","Liang Conglin was speechless.","Ye Maoshan walked back and picked up the cup of tea in front of him. He took a sip leisurely and put down the cup. Then, he glanced sideways at the anxious middle-aged man as if he did not see that Liang Conglin had something on his mind. He asked with a smile, “How is my pot of orchid?”"]},{"number":1259,"title":"Chapter 1259 - I Finally Know Who Master Wang Inherited It From","paragraphs":["Liang Conglin raised his head and looked at the pot of blooming orchids on the flower stand. The small white flowers were surrounded by fresh green leaves, looking unique.","Normally, he would also like to fiddle with flowers and plants, especially orchids.","Normally, he would definitely have to admire this orchid that was blooming just right. However, he had something on his mind and was not in the mood to admire the flower at all.","Liang Conglin retracted his gaze and said reluctantly, “Old Master Ye’s flowers are blooming quite beautifully.”","Ye Maoshan laughed when he heard that. “I’ll give you a pot if you want. How about you take it back?”","Liang Conglin looked conflicted. “Old Master Ye, I...” He did not want flowers. He wanted to leave!","Du Mingwei called at this moment.","When Liang Conglin saw that it was Du Mingwei’s call, he knew that the results of the group competition were out. His heart skipped a beat. Not caring that Ye Maoshan was present, he","immediately picked up the phone. He quickly asked, “Hello, how was the competition?”","Ye Maoshan drank his tea casually, but the butler who brought him the flower fertilizer could see it clearly. The old man kept glancing at Principal Liang with his ears pricked up.","He looked like he was holding his breath and was even more nervous than Principal Liang, but he had to pretend to be calm...","The corners of the butler’s mouth twitched. He silently placed the flower fertilizer under the flower stand and returned. He then silently poured a new pot of tea for Liang Conglin and stood at the side.","“First place?” Liang Conglin couldn’t suppress his excitement. He stood up abruptly and walked to the side with his phone. “You said that Qiao Nian entered the finals!","“Good! Good! This is good news!”","Liang Conglin had not expected Qiao Nian to produce such amazing results. She was first again and had directly entered the finals.","He was unable to hide his delight nor control the volume of his voice. “I’ll be right back.”","After Liang Conglin hung up the phone, he turned around and said to the old man who was drinking tea calmly, “Old Master Ye, I have something to do at school.”","Previously, he had also mentioned that he wanted to leave, but Ye Maoshan did not let him. He found an excuse to force him to stay.","This time, he was very straightforward. He put down his tea and waved at him without looking up. “Go on.”","Liang Conglin exchanged a few more pleasantries with him and then left in a hurry.","After Liang Conglin left, Ye Maoshan stood up with his hands behind his back. He coughed and said to the old butler, “I’m tired. Help me trim that pot of orchids. I’ll go back to my room to rest.”","“Alright.” The old butler did not even look up, but he knew very well in his heart. He watched him leave before slowly straightening his back and shaking his head helplessly with a smile.","How was Old Master Ye asking Principal Liang to come to his house to look at flowers?","He clearly knew that today was the day of Miss Qiao’s competition.","Principal Liang would have first-hand news of the competition, so he called him over to accompany him to look at the flowers!","His real goal was to find out the results of Miss Qiao’s competition.","Actually, he could have asked Principal Liang directly if he wanted to know the results of Miss Qiao’s competition. However, he refused to ask and insisted on eavesdropping. This made Principal Liang feel uneasy as he looked at the flowers for two hours.","No matter what, the old man’s actions were quite despicable.","In the direct line of descent of the Ye family, Young Master Ye’s personality was extremely similar to Old Master Ye’s. Sometimes, the two of them were simply the same.","...","On the left side of Qing University’s entrance, a red Lamborghini was parked smugly.","As soon as Qiao Nian walked out, she received a WeChat message from Jian Jin.","[The red car’s me.]","Qiao Nian looked up and saw the eye-catching red sports car parked by the road. Her eyes twitched as she walked over.","Well, it was very Jian Jin!"]},{"number":1260,"title":"Chapter 1260 - A Champagne Rose","paragraphs":["The car door opened from the side as Qiao Nian walked over. The woman in the driver’s seat did not get out. She reached out and took off her sunglasses, revealing an ordinary but well-defined oval face.","“Qiao.”","The woman curled her red lips and took out a large bouquet of fiery red roses. The red of the roses was dazzling and was almost as flashy as the car.","However, the woman did not think so at all. She smiled and handed the flowers over. “Long time no see~ This is a gift.”","Qiao Nian watched as a bouquet of roses was handed to her. Reluctantly, she reached out to take it and glanced at the card.","!!","The card read: Congratulations on entering the finals.","The handwriting was neat and the strokes were written especially carefully. The fountain pen left a mark on the hook. It was obvious that the person who wrote the card was serious at that time.","The card was unsigned.","The sender only congratulated her dryly, not even leaving their name.","She only took one look and knew who had sent her the roses and written the card.","Qiao Nian got into the car. She placed the roses in the back seat and raised her eyebrows. She narrowed her eyes and glanced at the woman in the driver’s seat. Her red lips twitched. “Lu Zhi asked you to send them?”","She leaned her arm against the window and spoke casually as if she was just asking.","Jian Jin was not surprised at all that Qiao Nian knew that the flowers weren’t from her. She rubbed her nose rather dryly and smiled with some surprise. “How do you know they’re not from me? What if they are? The law doesn’t say that only men can send roses.”","Qiao Nian held the card between her fingers and tossed it in front of her. The card slowly floated down. The message on the card was especially eye-catching.","Her eyes were a little dry. She raised her hand to push down the brim of her cap and buckled herself in. “The words are too ugly,” she said.","??","After putting on her seatbelt, Qiao Nian leaned back and turned to look at her. Her eyes under the brim of her cap were so eye-catching that Jian Jin almost fell into a daze.","“Your handwriting is a little better than his.”","Qiao Nian couldn’t understand how a man like Lu Zhi could write such ugly words. It was so ugly that it looked like it had been carved out with chicken feet. It was as ugly as a primary school student’s handwriting.","Thinking of this, she couldn’t help but say, “Go back and tell Lu Zhi to buy a penmanship copybook and practice it when he has nothing to do. It’s not his fault that his handwriting is ugly, but it’s too painful to the eyes. Next time, flowers will do, don’t write anything. It’ll make people not want to accept it.”","“Pfft, hahahaha!” Jian Jin burst out laughing. She laughed until she was on the verge of tears. Then, she put her hand to her mouth and coughed, barely holding back her laughter. “I told him not to write the card, but he insisted. I told him that whatever he wrote would not be as good as me getting the florist to write one for you. It’d be better than him writing it himself.”","The Boss had come up with so many tricks, but one card had exposed him.","Jian Jin wanted to laugh. She was mostly speechless at the thought of someone sitting behind a desk and seriously writing this.","Since he had taken the time and effort to write this, he should have just written something more, or maybe a confession.","The problem was that he had written for so long, and for what!","Congratulations on entering the finals???","Qiao Nian was ranked No. 1 on the Hacker’s Heaven Leaderboard and was Sun of the Red Alliance.","The World Software Competition was indeed rather important.","But they were talking about Qiao Nian, not anyone else.","Wasn’t it normal for Qiao Nian to enter the finals? It would be strange if she didn’t!"]},{"number":1261,"title":"Chapter 1261 - Coincidentally, Someone Saw","paragraphs":["Sometimes, Jian Jin did not understand what Lu Zhi was thinking. She had always been carefree and straightforward, so she did not dwell too much on this matter. She started the car with a smile and said, “Let’s not talk about him. We haven’t seen each other in a long time. Let’s go play.","“I know a club in Beijing that’s halfway up the mountain. The environment is very good. There are few people and it’s not that noisy. There’s also a golf course and an equestrian field. Are you going?","“We’ll play for a few hours. I’ll send you back later.”","Qiao Nian’s expression was casual. Her dark eyes were filled with an air of indifference as she replied, “I don’t mind. It’s up to you.”","Jian Jin was even more casual. “Then, let’s go.”","She stepped on the accelerator and started the car. In the blink of an eye, the red sports car disappeared on the road at the entrance of Qing University.","...","At the same time, not far across the road, Yin Wenzhi and her friend had just returned from buying books from a bookstore. On their way back, they saw Qiao Nian get into a red sports car. In the blink of an eye, the sports car disappeared.","Her friend pursed her lips and pointed curiously in the direction where the car had disappeared. “Zhi Zhi, the girl who got into the car just now was Qiao Nian, right?”","Yin Wenzhi hugged her book and replied expressionlessly, “I don’t know. I didn’t get a good look.”","She said she did not get a good look, but she hugged the book tighter.","Her friend did not see her abnormal expression and gossiped excitedly in her ear. “I saw her clearly. She seems to be your faculty’s renowned freshman. She’s super beautiful. Many boys in our class like her and often discuss her in private.”","There was some silence.","A trace of mockery flashed across Yin Wenzhi’s eyes. Her lips twitched, but she did not say anything. However, her eyes were filled with disdain.","Qiao Nian’s boyfriend’s car cost a few million yuan. In her eyes, ordinary boys were probably just paupers. She wouldn’t even bother to look at them. What was the point of them discussing her in private?","Her friend didn’t know what she was thinking as she clearly enjoyed talking about the coolest freshman on the faculty. “It’s not just the boys. Many girls like her, too. She’s quite cool. She played the electronic keyboard at the school’s anniversary celebration too well.”","The girl’s cheeks turned pink as she looked at Yin Wenzhi with sparkling eyes. She held her hands to her chest and sighed from the bottom of her heart. “Zhi Zhi, I’m so envious of you. You’re from the same faculty as Qiao Nian. It’s a pity that I’m a liberal arts student. Otherwise, I would have enrolled in the Chinese Medicine Faculty too!”","Annoyed, Yin Wenzhi frowned slightly and interrupted her. “You won’t be able to see her even if you apply to the Chinese Medicine Faculty. She doesn’t usually come to class. I’m not familiar with her.”","“I see. I thought you guys had a good relationship since you’re in the same faculty.” No matter how slow the girl’s reaction was, she could tell that Yin Wenzhi was not very friendly to Qiao Nian. She immediately shut her mouth and observed her friend’s reaction before cleverly changing the topic.","Her gaze landed on the bag she had brought over for revision. She asked curiously, “You bought a new bag?”","Yin Wenzhi’s mind was filled with thoughts of Qiao Nian. She was so upset that she kept thinking about the red sports car.","Although she did not recognize the logo, she could tell from the car’s design that it was not cheap.","Definitely a luxury car.","She felt tormented at this thought. She only reacted when her friend asked her a question. She subconsciously hid her bag and said vaguely, “Er... it’s a new bag.”","The girl was not as nervous as she was. She seemed to have a good personality. She leaned over and touched her bag, then immediately looked up and said, “Zhi Zhi, this bag of yours is a new model from Granny Xiang, right?”"]},{"number":1262,"title":"Chapter 1262 - Is This Bag So Valuable?","paragraphs":["Yin Wenzhi came from a small county. Her family’s conditions were ordinary. She did not know many brands before coming to Beijing.","She was even less familiar with the various luxury brands than many girls. Not only had she never seen a luxury brand, but she had never even heard of some of them.","Among the few brands she knew, Granny Xiang’s brand was one of the top brands.","“I saw their new model online previously. The bag you’re carrying sells for more than 70,000 yuan or 80,000 yuan. Anyway, it’s not cheap.”","Yin Wenzhi did not expect her bag to be so expensive. Her heart skipped a beat. 70,000 to 80,000 yuan. Her family did not even earn 70,000 to 80,000 yuan a year. The other party had just casually given her a bag, but it was actually so valuable. She bit her lip and her heart raced unconsciously. Facing her friend’s envious gaze, she lowered her eyelashes and pretended to say casually, “I didn’t know this bag was so valuable. It was given to me by a friend. He insisted on giving it to me, so I just accepted it.”","“Your friend is rich. He casually gave you a new bag from Granny Xiang.” The girl clicked her tongue and sighed. “This bag suits you very well. It looks good on you.”","Yin Wenzhi was tall and slender. She was not bad-looking, but she lacked nutrition and was exposed to the wind and sun. Her skin was not as fair as ordinary girls. In terms of facial features, she could definitely be considered a beauty, and it was the natural kind.","It was not an exaggeration to say that she looked good carrying a branded bag. At least, she looked better than most people.","Especially recently, Yin Wenzhi had quietly changed out of the cheap cotton dress she had been wearing since school started. She now wore a yellow dress with Granny Xiang’s new bag. She was quite beautiful, and her temperament had increased.","Her fair hand squeezed the strap of her bag. She smiled when she heard this, and her face seemed more confident. “Is that so?”","“Of course. Why would I lie to you? You look pretty good with this bag on.” Her friend quickly waved her hand and said, “No, no. You’re not bad-looking, to begin with. You’re not worse than Qiao Nian. You just don’t like to dress up.”","Yin Wenzhi’s eyes turned cold when she heard Qiao Nian’s name. She didn’t respond, but she agreed with her inside.","She was not bad-looking, to begin with. She just lacked an opportunity!","She and Qiao Nian came from small towns. If Qiao Nian could have a luxury car to pick her up at any time, why couldn’t she?","She could also join the upper-class circle as long as she let go of her restraints.","As Yin Wenzhi was thinking this, her phone suddenly beeped. She found the phone in the bag and opened it.","It was a message from Zhu Yuanhao.","The other party’s tone was very gentlemanly and amiable. “Baby, where are you? There’s a party later. My friends are gathering. Do you want to come with me?”","In the past, Yin Wenzhi would only feel greasy and disgusted when someone called her baby. Now that she heard how valuable the bag she was carrying was, the little disgust in her heart was replaced by vanity.","She saw Zhu Yuanhao ask her if she wanted to attend their friend’s party and thought of the red sports car Qiao Nian had just gotten into.","She silently deleted the words “I’m going to class” and edited the message again.","Then, she suddenly stopped and said to the girl beside her, “I have something on. You can leave first.”","“Huh? You’re not going back? Don’t you have class in the afternoon? It’s Professor Shen’s class. Aren’t you going?” The girl looked at her in surprise."]},{"number":1263,"title":"Chapter 1263 - Sister Nian, Hot Search Warning!","paragraphs":["Yin Wenzhi’s eyes were filled with the desire to compete with Qiao Nian. Her mind was already on integrating into high society. “I’m not going. My friend wants to eat with me.”","“But Professor Shen’s class is very difficult. Didn’t you go to the classroom in advance to reserve a seat in Professor Shen’s class in the past?”","Yin Wenzhi did not think much of it. She no longer had the arrogance of studying when school had just started. “It’s just a class. It’s fine if I don’t go.”","Seeing that she really did not plan to go to class, the other party said helplessly, “... Alright, then. Remember to get your classmate to apply for leave for you. Otherwise, your absenteeism score will be deducted in the final exam.”","“I know.”","Yin Wenzhi watched her leave.","Then, she slowly pulled out the contacts on her phone and looked around. After one round, she realized she didn’t have many close friends.","After hesitating, she found Song Tian’s WeChat and sent her a message. She lied and said that she was on her period and was not feeling well, so she asked Song Tian to help her apply for leave from Old Shen.","After the message was sent.","Yin Wenzhi returned to the school gate. She straightened the skirt of her dress and stood by the road, waiting for Zhu Yuanhao to pick her up.","...","On the other hand, after Jiang Xianrou sent the location of the meeting in the group chat room, she hesitated for a moment and found Zhang Yang’s WeChat.","After thinking for a moment, she sent him a message.","[Zhang Yang, I’ve passed Master Cheng’s laboratory’s first review. Everyone is organizing a celebration party for me. Do you want to come out and play?]","She saw that the message had been delivered.","The other party replied to her two minutes later.","To readers! our content is stolen.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t wait to open the chat box. Looking down, her expression instantly turned ugly.","Zhang Yang replied to her very politely, but he was just too polite. He was just short of clearly writing the word ‘distant’.","[Tonight? I’m sorry, Miss Jiang. I have an appointment tonight. Have fun!]","Jiang Xianrou held her phone tightly and bit her lip. Her eyes kept flickering. After a long time, she took a deep breath and opened the group chat room.","Zhu Yuanhao and the others were all cheering. Zhu Yuanhao even said that he wanted to bring his new girlfriend over to play.","She looked at the series of teasing messages below. Everyone was asking who Zhu Yuanhao’s new girlfriend was.","Only Jiang Xianrou couldn’t be bothered to reply. Suddenly, she became disinterested, especially when she saw that Zhang Yang was the leader of the group and had become very close to Qin Si and the others recently. For example, Tang Ning and the others had not appeared in the group for some time. She felt even more upset.","Tang Ning and the others all followed her lead in the past.","But this group of people had all sided with Qiao Nian ever since Qin Si had scolded her twice in the group.","They changed sides so fast!","Frustrated, Jiang Xianrou exited the chatroom. Then, she sent Jiang Yao a message to tell him the good news.","She waited for her message to be sent successfully.","The next second, a new headline was pushed to her on the phone’s portal — “First time the country enters the World Software Competition finals. A girl from Qing University is like a dark horse, appearing out of nowhere!”","Jiang Xianrou’s heart seemed to have frozen as soon as she saw the headlines. Her hand trembled a little. Her fingers quickly flipped out of Weibo and logged in.","Because of her accident last time, many people on Weibo sent her private messages to scold her.","Jiang Xianrou did not look at the 99+ private messages in her mailbox and went straight to the trending searches.","Qiao Nian was already at the top.","# Qiao Nian, World Software Competition","The two related words were close together, and there were also the words [Explode]!","Jiang Yao called her before Jiang Xianrou could take a look..."]},{"number":1264,"title":"Chapter 1264 - Inviting Jiang Yao for Support","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou did not answer immediately. Instead, she waited for a long time. When the call almost hung up, she picked up expressionlessly. “Hello, Brother.”","She thought that he had called to tell her about Qiao Nian. Unexpectedly, Jiang Yao’s tone was no different from usual, as if he didn’t know that Qiao Nian had entered the finals of the World Software Competition.","“Xianrou, I saw the message you sent me. You passed the initial review of Master Cheng’s laboratory?”","Jiang Xianrou’s ugly expression finally turned a little better at the mention of this good news. She forced a smile and softened her tone. “Yes.”","“Congratulations!”","!!","It was obvious that Jiang Yao was quite happy for her.","Jiang Xianrou’s terrible mood finally improved a little. She lifted the hair by her ear and put her hand down again. She said quite modestly, “I just passed the first trial.”","“Seven or eight others passed with me. Master Cheng will pick two of us. In the end, only two can enter the laboratory. I don’t know if I can be chosen by Master Cheng yet.”","Jiang Yao seemed to be very confident in her and smiled. “Don’t worry, you can definitely enter Master Cheng’s laboratory with your strength!”","Jiang Xianrou’s mood finally improved and she revealed a proud smile. She held her phone and thought of the dinner later, then said, “Brother, are you free later?”","“What’s the matter?”","Jiang Xianrou pursed her lips and her eyes darkened before she said, “I’m inviting a friend to play at the Half Mountain Clubhouse. If you’re free, do you want to come over and play with us? My friend hasn’t seen you yet. I can introduce you to them.”","Jiang Yao did not think too much about it and asked her strangely, “Don’t you usually play with Young Master Qin and the others? Young Master Qin isn’t going today?”","He was not familiar with Qin Si and the others.","Unlike Jiang Li, who was in the same circle as them.","Jiang Yao had a reserved personality. He was more like Jiang Zongnan and did not get along with Qin Si and the others.","However, he knew Qin Si and had seen him a few times in the past.","Therefore, subconsciously asked about him when he heard that she wanted to introduce him to her friends.","Jiang Xianrou’s face, which had finally softened, instantly turned pale. Her fingers tightened until her knuckles turned pale. She pursed her lips and whispered, “Him? He has something on today and can’t come over.”","“Haven’t you always been on good terms with them? How can they not come when you passed Master Cheng’s laboratory’s first trial?” Jiang Yao still didn’t realize that he had accidentally poked his sister’s sore spot. He was about to get to the bottom of it.","Jiang Xianrou was even more embarrassed by his question. Her throat dried as if someone was strangling her. She replied with difficulty, “Not all of them. Some friends will come! It’s fine if they can’t come, but I can’t skip the celebration.”","Jiang Yao belatedly heard the frustration in her tone and finally stopped asking. He immediately said, “Where did you say the dining place was?”","Jiang Xianrou said, “Half Mountain Clubhouse.”","Jiang Yao knew this clubhouse. It was one of the more famous wealthy clubs in Beijing. They had many facilities.","It also occupied a large area.","There were private golf courses and equestrian fields. Many second-generation heirs in Beijing liked to go there to play.","The Half Mountain Clubhouse was a private club like Lan Pavilion. Only VIP clients could enter. Not everyone could play there.","Jiang Xianrou had always played with the top circles in Beijing in the past. Of course, she was a VIP of the Half Mountain Clubhouse.","Jiang Yao nodded and did not say anything else. He asked for Jiang Xianrou’s location and said, “Wait for me there. I’ll drive over to pick you up.”"]},{"number":1265,"title":"Chapter 1265 - Sorry, Your Sister Nian Doesn’t Accept It","paragraphs":["“Okay.” Jiang Xianrou finally heaved a sigh of relief when Jiang Yao agreed to come.","She hung up and clicked on the group message again.","During the time she called, there were already 99+ messages in the group.","Most of them were discussing the gathering later. A small discordant voice also mentioned the news of the World Software Competition.","But not many people discussed it.","She casually flipped through it. Qin Si and the others did not appear. They all acted as if they did not see what was happening in the group.","Jiang Xianrou immediately lost face.","She opened Ye Wangchuan’s WeChat, intending to send him a message to ask if he had time to come.","However, her heart turned cold when she thought about how Zhang Yang did not give her any face and refused to come.","Jiang Xianrou hesitated again and again. For the sake of her face, she did not send the message in the end.","...","On the other side, after Jiang Xianrou hung up, Jiang Yao picked up his car keys and said to the man sitting opposite him, “Young Master Xu, what are your plans later?”","“Huh?” Xu Jishen was wearing a blue shirt today and had his legs crossed. He was drinking coffee and looked at him in surprise. “What plans?”","“I’m asking if you have any plans tonight. For example, to accompany Old Master Su for dinner?” Jiang Yao frowned slightly as if he had something on his mind.","“Oh.” Xu Jishen looked enlightened and said leisurely, “My grandfather has seen his important friend and returned to Lin City yesterday. Therefore, I don’t have any plans. I’ll return to the illegal district after I’m done with the matters in Beijing.”","Jiang Yao picked up the car keys with one hand, but he held his phone with the other as if he was reading a message.","Xu Jishen didn’t know what he was doing. He raised his eyebrows curiously and asked, “Why are you asking me about my plans for tonight? Is something the matter?”","Jiang Yao looked at his WeChat. The white profile picture friend list was quiet. So far, there was no reply.","The only thing they had interacted with was the transfer and refund message on WeChat.","The 99,999 yuan he had sent to Qiao Nian that day was automatically returned to him.","Jiang Yao had never thought that Qiao Nian would refuse his red packet. He had thought of asking Jiang Zongjin to mediate the tense relationship at home.","However, when he thought of what Jiang Li had said that day, he felt a little ashamed to face this uncle who had always treated him well.","“Jiang Yao?” Xu Jishen saw that he was staring at his phone without saying anything and called out to him.","Jiang Yao came back to his senses and looked at him in confusion. “Huh? What’s wrong?”","Xu Jishen wanted to laugh, but he held it in and replied angrily, “You’re still asking me what’s wrong? I should be the one asking you. You sat there in a daze halfway through your sentence. What are you thinking about? You’re so engrossed!”","There was some silence.","Dirty laundry should not be aired in public.","Jiang Yao put down his phone and rubbed his eyebrows that had been furrowed for the past few days. He said irritably, “Nothing. By the way, what did I ask you just now?”","“Please! I’m the one asking you.” Xu Jishen rolled his eyes and said helplessly, “You just asked m if I had any plans for tonight. You just sat there and kept looking at your phone like a demon. I don’t know what you were looking at.”","Jiang Yao’s temples throbbed, and he was even more annoyed. He finally remembered that he was the one asking Xu Jishen.","He barely regained his senses and raised his mature handsome face slightly. “Are you free tonight? Xianrou passed the initial trial to join Master Cheng’s laboratory. She asked her friends to celebrate at the Half Mountain Clubhouse. I’m going over. What about you? Are you free? Accompany me if you are.”"]},{"number":1266,"title":"Chapter 1266 - Bringing Xu Jishen Along","paragraphs":["“Your sister passed the initial review of Master Cheng’s laboratory?” Xu Jishen looked at him in surprise and smiled. “Impressive!”","“Are you free tonight?” Jiang Yao asked again.","Although Xu Jishen was not stingy when he praised Jiang Xianrou, his eyes immediately revealed hesitation when Jiang Yao mentioned inviting him to attend Jiang Xianrou’s friend’s gathering. He did not really want to attend.","“Tonight...” Xu Jishen leaned back casually with one hand on his lap, his fingers tapping casually. His rejection was already on the tip of his tongue. “I’m afraid tonight...”","He didn’t get to finish his sentence.","Jiang Yao interrupted him and looked at him shamelessly. He pleaded, “Come with me. We’ll play for a while before leaving.”","Xu Jishen’s words were stuck in his throat. He couldn’t refuse, but he was actually unwilling to go.","He had seen Jiang Yao’s biological sister last time. Jiang Xianrou was not bad-looking, and her temperament was not bad. However, there was an arrogant look in her eyes. She thought that she had hidden it well and was polite to others, but Xu Jishen had ordinary feelings for her and was unwilling to interact with Jiang Xianrou.","After all, the Xu family was not inferior to the Jiang family. He wouldn’t go so far as to curry favor with Jiang Xianrou.","Therefore, Xu Jishen was not interested in pleasing Jiang Xianrou even if she had entered Ye Wangchuan’s circle and knew Qin Si and Bo Jingxing.","He was not interested and was not willing to carry the sedan chair for the Eldest Miss even though she had passed the initial trial of Master Cheng’s laboratory.","However, he couldn’t resist Jiang Yao’s repeated invitations no matter how unwilling he was.","Jiang Yao had a good relationship with him and they were both in Tian Chen. Xu Jishen reluctantly relented and said, “Sigh, seriously, I didn’t say I wouldn’t go!","“I definitely have to congratulate your sister. Accompany me to the mall to buy a gift. I can’t go there empty-handed since I’m going.”","Jiang Yao relaxed at Xu Jishen’s reply. He nodded, knowing that Xu Jishen had changed his words because he was giving him face. He reluctantly said, “Young Master Xu, thank you.”","Xu Jishen smiled and exchanged a few more pleasantries with him.","Jiang Yao took the opportunity to get up and say, “I’m going to the washroom.”","“Go.” Xu Jishen shrugged without any objections, indicating that he could do as he pleased.","Jiang Yao got up and went to the washroom.","He did not go far after leaving the cafe. He took out his phone again, lowered his head, and clicked on the girl’s profile picture on WeChat.","He sent another message.","[Qiao Nian, I saw the trending searches. I heard that you entered the finals. Congratulations on your good results. Good luck in the finals.]","After sending the WeChat message, Jiang Yao thought for a moment and asked, [Xianrou passed the initial trial of Master Cheng’s laboratory today. She invited her friends to dinner. I’ll go over too. Do you want to go? I can pick you up, or you can come over yourself.]","He sent the location of the clubhouse to the girl.","The girl’s profile picture was still silent and there was no reaction. After his message was sent, it was like a stone sinking into the sea. There was no reaction.","Jiang Yao’s mood worsened.","He had been trying to contact Qiao Nian over the past few days. However, her attitude towards him was cold. She didn’t answer his calls or replied to his messages.","Deep down, Jiang Yao still wanted to repair his family’s relationship, but he did not know where to start.","After thinking about it, he thought of inviting Qiao Nian to attend Jiang Xianrou’s friend’s gathering."]},{"number":1267,"title":"Chapter 1267 - Large-Scale Face-Slapping","paragraphs":["1","After all, Xianrou’s friends were all second-generation heirs in Beijing. They were relatively young. If Xianrou was willing to bring Qiao Nian into her circle, it would be easy to explain to her uncle and grandfather.","Jiang Yao felt that his idea was very good. Firstly, it would ease their relationship, and secondly, it would help Qiao Nian.","After all, Qiao Nian was from Rao City.","The circle in Beijing had always been xenophobic. It was very difficult for someone like Qiao Nian to integrate into this circle. But the situation would be different if someone brought her in.","Jiang Xianrou had a good relationship with Ye Wangchuan and the others, and her status in the circle was very high. Qiao Nian could integrate into this circle as long as Xianrou was willing to help her.","!!","It would just be difficult to come into contact with those of higher status within the circle.","With that thought in mind, Jiang Yao sent Jiang Xianrou another message, saying that he might bring Qiao Nian along.","After sending the message, Jiang Yao did not look at Jiang Xianrou’s reply. He put his cell phone in his pocket and walked to the bathroom to wash his hands and calm down.","...","At this moment, Qiao Nian still did not know that someone was hoping she could get Jiang Xianrou to help her to integrate into Beijing’s circle.","Jian Jin’s sports car had just parked halfway up the mountain when the staff led them in. Jian Jin had always been generous. She went to the side to make a call, then turned around and said to her, “Let’s go in. I’ve booked the entire clubhouse. No one will disturb us today.”","Her cell phone buzzed as soon as the girl got out of the car. She took it out and saw a series of messages from Jiang Yao.","Her cold and distant eyes swept over the messages. Seeing him mention Master Cheng, the corners of Qiao Nian’s mouth curled up slightly, looking a little cold.","Jiang Xianrou wanted to enter Master Cheng’s laboratory?","Jiang Xianrou had evil intentions. Entering Master Cheng’s laboratory was just like gilded gold to her. She wouldn’t learn properly.","It was a waste of space!","Qiao Nian did not like to meddle in other people’s business, nor was she interested in the Jiang family.","Her cold and fair hand deleted Jiang Yao’s message. Then, she raised her head and followed Jian Jin into the clubhouse.","...","At the same time, Jiang Xianrou and the others arrived outside the clubhouse.","There were many people around her, but they were all small fry. None of the people in the group were like Zhang Yang. Even Tang Ning and the others were not here.","Not to mention Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and the others.","It was just a facade!","This time, it was Zhu Yuanhao who booked the place for them. When everyone arrived, they waited for Zhu Yuanhao to make the arrangements. Zhu Yuanhao rushed to look for the staff of the clubhouse. Unexpectedly, they heard an argument not long after.","“What do you mean? What do you mean we should come back another day? Do you know who we are?”","“I’m sorry, Young Master Zhu. Our clubhouse has been booked. A VIP has requested to clear the venue, so we can’t receive other guests today.”","Zhu Yuanhao was furious. His face, which had been hollowed out by alcohol and women, turned red. He did not listen to the staff’s explanation at all and shouted arrogantly.","“A servant is telling me about this nonsense. Where’s your manager? Tell him to come out and talk to me.”","Feeling that he was making a scene, Jiang Xianrou walked over unhappily and asked calmly, “What’s wrong?”","“This person told me that the clubhouse was booked today and asked us to go to another place.” Zhu Yuanhao was filled with anger. He sneered angrily and said, “I’ve never heard of anyone who can book the entire clubhouse! It’s not even Master Wang and the others. Who the f*ck is such a big shot!”","Thank you for reading on my.me"]},{"number":1268,"title":"Chapter 1268 - Hello, We’re Your VIP Guests","paragraphs":["Someone booked the whole place?","Jiang Xianrou subconsciously frowned. Her beautiful eyes were filled with displeasure, but she habitually disguised her emotions and talked to the staff without showing any emotions. “Hello, did you say that someone booked the entire place today?”","“Hello.” Although the staff member stopped them from entering, he did not dare to offend them. He knew that he couldn’t afford to offend anyone, so he could only focus and speak carefully. “Yes, Miss Jiang. I’m very sorry.”","Jiang Xianrou pursed her lips. Her expression was normal, but her demeanor was domineering. “We’re VIP guests of your clubhouse.”","The staff member looked helpless and could only explain to her humbly, “I know you’re VIPs. I’m really sorry, Miss Jiang. I’m also following the orders of the higher-ups. They informed us to clear the area, so we can only clear the area. Could you come back another day?”","Another day?","Jiang Xianrou’s smile disappeared, and a trace of gloominess flashed across her eyes. She pursed her lips tightly and did not say anything. Her expression had already turned cold.","She had specially invited her friends to come to the celebration party. Now he was asking them to change places?","Then, where would the Jiang family and Jiang Xianrou put their faces in the future?!","Jiang Xianrou was already extremely unhappy in her heart. She still maintained the demeanor that a socialite should have on her face and pretended to be generous. However, her gaze was aggressive as she looked at the staff member. She did not understand the other party’s position at all and said calmly, “Oh, you have to tell me who booked the venue. Otherwise, why would I come another day?”","“We’re all VIP guests. It doesn’t make sense that you’re asking us to leave when we’re all already here.” She straightened the bag with indifferent eyes. She looked easy to talk to, but she was actually very arrogant and tough. “Don’t you agree?”","As expected, the staff member looked troubled. “This... Miss Jiang, I can’t say that.”","Jiang Xianrou smiled and did not seem to mind. She put on an expression that said, “Then, get your manager to come over and explain to us.”","She had followed Qin Si here before and met the manager of the clubhouse.","Last time, the manager nodded and bowed to her respectfully.","Relying on her connections, Jiang Xianrou was even more fearless when she did things.","The group of Beijing second-generation heirs beside her straightened their backs and glared at the staff.","“Yes, call your manager out!” A blonde was the first to speak, his tone arrogant.","Someone immediately joined in the commotion.","“That’s right, who the f*ck booked the entire place? What do you mean! Miss Jiang is right! We’re all VIP guests. What right do you have to let others in and not us? You’re acting as if we’re not VIPs.”","Zhu Yuanhao was usually close to Jiang Xianrou. Seeing that the staff of the clubhouse had no intention of giving in, he walked up to her with a dark expression and said in a low voice, “Miss Jiang, why don’t you call Young Master Qin and the others? Matters like this can be resolved with a call from them. We can’t be bothered to argue with the staff here.”","Jiang Xianrou hesitated when Qin Si and Ye Wangchuan were mentioned.","She recalled Qin Si’s cold attitude towards her during this period of time. Then, she thought about how she had not seen Ye Wangchuan for a few months.","She felt uncertain."]},{"number":1269,"title":"Chapter 1269 - Jiang Yao: Why Aren’t You Inside Yet?","paragraphs":["However, facing Zhu Yuanhao’s expectant expression, Jiang Xianrou hesitated for a moment before taking out her cell phone and saying, “Forget it. I don’t know if they’re busy now. If they are, it won’t be good for me to call. Wait a moment, I’ll send a WeChat message to ask.”","Zhu Yuanhao thought that she was as close to Qin Si and the others as before. He shrugged without thinking and trusted her completely. “Sure, Miss Jiang. Ask Master Wang and the others.”","Jiang Xianrou walked to the side, lowered her head, and found Qin Si’s profile picture on WeChat. She hesitantly typed a message and sent it over.","[I passed the initial round of Master Cheng’s laboratory trials and asked Zhu Yuanhao and the others to come to the clubhouse to celebrate. In the end, the staff told us that the entire clubhouse has been booked. Since we’re here, can you help me talk to them?]","The WeChat message was sent instantly.","Jiang Xianrou’s heart raced. She stared at her cell phone anxiously, waiting for the other party to reply.","She got lucky.","As soon as she sent the WeChat message, she saw that the chat box displayed (The other party is typing...)","Jiang Xianrou heaved a sigh of relief and relaxed. She was no longer nervous.","She was mainly afraid that Qin Si would ignore her.","She was relieved since he was willing to reply to her message!","A smile appeared on her face. Qin Si’s message came back in the next second just as she was about to tell Zhu Yuanhao and the others that there was no problem. [Half Mountain Clubhouse has been booked. Can’t you get another place? Why do you have to celebrate there?]","The smile on Jiang Xianrou’s face froze instantly. Her eyelashes trembled slightly as she stared at the message.","She dug her fair hands into her phone and barely managed to type a few words. [I’m already here. Zhu Yuanhao and the others are all here. We can’t possibly leave now. It’s too...]","Qin Si sent another message.","[I’m busy and don’t have time to call you. You can either play somewhere else or go another day!]","Jiang Xianrou’s hand that was editing the message stopped. It was as if someone had poured a bucket of ice water over her head in the middle of winter. She could feel the coldness in her heart just by standing there.","She bit her lower lip and did not reply. Instead, she put away her cell phone and pretended that nothing had happened. She said to Zhu Yuanhao, “Young Master Qin didn’t reply to my message. He probably isn’t up yet.”","Zhu Yuanhao was stunned. Young Master Qin did not reply? He had clearly seen Miss Jiang chatting with someone on her phone.","“Still asleep at this hour?”","“Yeah.”","Jiang Xianrou was expressionless, but her hand hanging by her side was holding her cell phone tightly. She was so anxious and frustrated that she did not even want to speak.","“What about Master Wang? Why don’t we give Master Wang...” Zhu Yuanhao was not finished.","Jiang Xianrou interrupted him. “Master Wang must be busy. There’s no need to alarm him over such a small matter.”","Zhu Yuanhao was dumbfounded. He scratched the back of his head, not understanding what she meant. “Then...”","Young Master Qin couldn’t be contacted.","Master Wang’s contact was forbidden.","What Miss Jiang meant was...","At this moment, Jiang Yao and the others arrived.","His black SUV slowly stopped beside Jiang Xianrou and the others.","Jiang Yao opened the car door and got out. Xu Jishen followed suit. He looked at the group of brats and greeted Jiang Xianrou.","Jiang Yao also walked over and stood in front of her. His handsome face revealed a surprised expression upon seeing that they were standing outside. “Why aren’t you inside yet?”"]},{"number":1270,"title":"Chapter 1270 - Someone Saw Sister Nian","paragraphs":["“Brother.”","Jiang Xianrou greeted him with a forced expression. She pursed her lips and said, “It’s not that we don’t want to go in. The clubhouse has been booked.”","“You’re saying Half Mountain Clubhouse...?” Jiang Yao was dumbfounded. He looked very surprised and a little incredulous.","The Half Mountain Clubhouse was similar to Lan Pavilion. They were both high-class clubs. The people who came to such an occasion were either rich or noble. He had never heard of anyone who could book the entire place.","However, he knew that Jiang Xianrou was not lying to him when he saw her silent reaction. The clubhouse was indeed booked today!","Although Jiang Yao was shocked, he had no choice but to face the situation. He could only say, “Then, let’s go somewhere else. Anyway, it’s just a meal. There’s no need to insist on this place.”","Jiang Xianrou was unwilling, but since Qin Si was unwilling to help, she could only swallow her anger and reluctantly agree.","The group planned to change places.","At this moment, a girl who did not have much of a presence in the group suddenly exclaimed, “Qiao Nian?!”","Jiang Yao had already opened the door of the car. Hearing the girl’s name, he was stunned for a moment and subconsciously turned around to look.","He saw a familiar figure passing by in the clubhouse.","Her back view was cold!","She was wearing a black sweater, black pants, and a black cap.","Even though he couldn’t see her front, he recognized her at a glance.","Qiao Nian?","Why was she here!","Jiang Yao’s eyes were filled with shock. Before he could react, he heard Jiang Xianrou talking to the girl.","“Did you say Qiao Nian?”","Jiang Xianrou looked at the girl. The girl was tall and had a good appearance. There was a hint of arrogance in her eyes. It was obvious that she was a little prideful.","However, it was far from Qiao Nian’s stunning aura.","She looked ordinary!","She remembered that this girl was brought here by Zhu Yuanhao. He had even introduced her to them and said that she was his new girlfriend.","Zhu Yuanhao was famous in the circle for being playful, and he especially liked to change girlfriends. Basically, he changed girlfriends every month, and all of them were good-looking.","Every few days, he would bring a new girlfriend over and introduce her to them.","Everyone was already used to it and did not take Zhu Yuanhao’s so-called ‘new girlfriend’ seriously. After all, they were not in the same circle. Girls like Yin Wenzhi were just toys in their eyes. No one wanted to be friends with a toy.","“Who did you see?”","Yin Wenzhi felt her scalp tingle from her gaze. She tightened her grip on the bag Zhu Yuanhao had bought for her and pursed her lips. She said in a low voice, “A classmate of mine.”","She could tell that Jiang Xianrou was actually suppressing her unhappiness. She recalled that Zhu Yuanhao had said that his friend had a deep background and knew many impressive big shots.","She thought of the spot that had been snatched away from her previously. Making up her mind, she looked straight into Jiang Xianrou’s eyes and said, “Qiao Nian, the national top scorer of this year’s college entrance examination. She’s also studying at Qing University. She’s in the same faculty as me. She’s in her first year. I think I saw her inside just now.”","At first, Jiang Xianrou thought that she had only met someone with the same name. But the other party’s name was also Qiao Nian, and she also studied at Qing University and was in her first year.","More importantly, she was also the top scorer of this year’s national college entrance examination!","How many top scorers could there be in the national college entrance examination every year?","Every word that Yin Wenzhi said matched Qiao Nian. Her eyes suddenly turned cold."]},{"number":1271,"title":"Chapter 1271 - Your Sister Nian Shot a Hole","paragraphs":["Yin Wenzhi could tell that she had ill intentions towards Qiao Nian. Recalling the conflict between Jiang Xianrou and Qiao Nian at the school’s anniversary celebration, she mustered her courage and said in a low voice, “I saw a red sports car picking her up at the school gate today. The driver even sent her roses.”","Before Jiang Xianrou could speak, Jiang Yao frowned and said in a low voice, “You said you saw Qiao Nian get into a sports car?”","Xu Jishen had met the younger cousin of the Jiang family once with Jiang Yao. Although they were quite a distance away and did not speak, his intuition told him that the girl was not such a person. He spoke up for Qiao Nian. “Did you see wrongly?”","“I didn’t see wrong!” Yin Wenzhi’s pretty face was slightly pale, and her eyelashes were trembling, making her look especially charming. She bit her lip, and her expression was a little stubborn. She interrupted Xu Jishen and said firmly, “I saw clearly that the car wasn’t from Beijing. It had a foreign license plate. My friend and I saw her get into a red sports car. That car looked very expensive!”","To prove that she was not lying, she tried to recall the appearance of the car she had seen at the school gate at noon. She bit her lip and said, “I remember that the logo of the sports car had a bull on it.”","!!","Whether it was Jiang Yao, Xu Jishen, or even Zhu Yuanhao and the others, all of them were either rich or noble. As soon as Yin Wenzhi mentioned the bull sign...","Instantly, a luxury car brand appeared in everyone’s minds—a Lamborghini.","Jiang Yao’s handsome face darkened and his grip on the car door tightened.","Lamborghinis were not cheap. The cheapest cost two million yuan, and a better model cost more than ten million.","How did Qiao Nian know someone who drove a Lamborghini?","He recalled that Yin Wenzhi said she had seen the driver give Qiao Nian roses. Qiao Nian had even accepted them... Then, he thought about his cousin’s striking appearance. Her face was incredibly beautiful.","He frowned and closed the door. He said coldly to Xu Jishen, “I’ll go to the parking lot to take a look!”","“Jiang Yao, there’s no need...” Xu Jishen wanted to stop him, but he could not.","Jiang Yao strode towards the parking lot of the clubhouse.","He only needed to go to the parking lot to see if there was a red Lamborghini with a foreign license plate.","...","In the shooting range of the Half Mountain Clubhouse.","Having changed into her shooting clothes, the girl was casually playing with the Beretta 92F as she waited for Jian Jin to finish firing her 10 rounds.","She flexed her wrist, loaded the gun, raised her arm, and fired ten times.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","All that could be heard on the firing range was a volley of gunfire.","The round ended.","Jian Jin looked at the new hole in the target 500 meters away. Her lips twitched fiercely as she saw the girl’s wildly cool figure. She silently shook out all the bullet cases in her gun, dropped the pistol on the table, and spread her hands. “I’m out. How am I supposed to play this if you play like this?”","After ten shots, eight of Jian Jin’s shots hit the bull’s eye ring, and the remaining two shots were within the 9-point ring. Logically speaking, this result was impressive enough.","But the other big shot was not playing with these rules.","Qiao Nian had fired all ten shots along the 6-point ring just now. However, every shot hit the exact same spot, penetrating the hole where the first bullet had passed through. She did not hit the bull’s eye for all ten shots, but this was arguably even more impressive.","There was no need to play on.","Qiao Nian casually tossed the pistol on the table in her usual cool manner. With her hands in her pockets, her expression was a little unruly. She then said with a hoarse voice, “I was just playing around.”","She had shot a hole in the target with ten shots, and she still said that she was just playing around?","What was worse was that Jian Jin knew very well that Qiao Nian was not lying. She was really just playing around.","Jian Jin’s eyelids fluttered again, and she reluctantly took off her shooting suit, revealing a black tank top. She led the way to the lounge. “Come on, Qiao. Let’s take a break.”","Thank you for reading on .me"]},{"number":1272,"title":"Chapter 1272 - Sister Nian Is the Diamond Big Boss of the Illegal District","paragraphs":["Not far from the shooting range was a lounge in a glass building. The environment was quiet. There were a few tables and chairs by the window and green plants on one side of the tables and chairs.","Jian Jin found one of the tables, pulled out a chair, and sat down. She then asked the waiter to bring two glasses of juice.","When the waiter walked away, she raised her face and said to the girl who immediately walked over and dragged out a chair to sit down, “By the way, Qiao, your uncle came to work with JC Corporation.”","Jian Jin was wearing a black tank top that revealed a smooth, perfect shoulder and neckline.","Her figure was very eye-catching. It was the kind of figure that people would remember at a glance. However, her face was ordinary. Her facial features were not exquisite, and she did not belong to the aesthetics of the country.","Jian Jin leaned back and put her hand on the table. “They want our latest batch of raw materials,” she asked. “Should we give them?”","In recent years, JC Corporation, the fastest-rising diamond raw materials supplier in the world, was on the list.","As the largest supplier of raw stones, the JC Group had the purest diamonds and the richest supply. They were also much cheaper than the other raw materials merchants.","Furthermore, there had always been rumors in the industry that there was a diamond big shot in the illegal district behind JC Corporation.","This diamond big shot from the illegal district was very mysterious. He never appeared, but he had an entire diamond procurement line in Continent F.","He was also one of the top figures in the illegal district.","His strength could not be underestimated!","Therefore, be it domestically or abroad, countless jewelry companies wanted to cooperate with JC Corporation. For every batch of raw materials that came out, big jewelry companies both domestically and abroad waited in line for the JC Corporation to choose.","This time, the Jiang Corporation also submitted a cooperation plan.","In the past, Jian Jin wouldn’t even look at such a company. If she wanted to choose, she would choose the most famous jewelry companies in the world.","But it was different now.","The diamond big shot was a big shot. Qiao was in Beijing, and the Jiang family was related to Qiao by blood, so she asked her assistant to keep the Jiang Corporation’s cooperation plan for the time being.","Jian Jin raised the corners of her eyes and looked at the girl sitting opposite her. She was mainly looking at Qiao Nian. “If you say cooperate, I’ll give them this batch of raw materials. Qiao, what do you want to do?”","The waiter brought the juice at that moment.","Qiao Nian chose a cup of apple juice. Holding the cup in one hand, she stirred the juice in the cup with a straw.","The clear ice in the glass clinked against the ice.","There was little emotion on her delicate, attractive face as she said casually, “It’s up to you. You have shares in JC Corporation, too.”","“I decide?” Jian Jin’s eyes were filled with helplessness. She could only digress. “If you want me to decide, the Jiang Corporation is not qualified to cooperate with us at all. The problem is that President Jiang is your uncle. That’s why I asked for your opinion.”","The Jiang Corporation was indeed not qualified to cooperate with JC Corporation. She guessed that the other party had only tentatively submitted a cooperation plan.","He didn’t have much hope.","Unfortunately, some people were just lucky. They could lie at home and pick up good luck for nothing.","“President Jiang wrote this plan personally this time. He’s very sincere. What do you think?”","What did she think?","Qiao Nian tapped her fingers on the glass and tilted her head. She narrowed her eyes as if thinking about Jian Jin’s words.","According to her personality, she definitely did not want her personal feelings to be mixed with other benefits. However, she hesitated upon hearing that Jiang Zongnan wanted to cooperate with JC Corporation."]},{"number":1273,"title":"Chapter 1273 - Receiving Father Jiang’s Call","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongnan was neither good nor bad to her. At least, when they acknowledged each other in Rao City, Jiang Zongnan had given her a gold card from Citibank.","There wasn’t much money.","At least he had the heart of an elder.","Although Qiao Nian had returned the money to him later on, she remembered his kindness.","Seeing that Qiao Nian didn’t answer her immediately, Jian Jin smiled again and continued, “It’s just a batch of raw materials, anyway. We can give it to the Jiang Corporation.”","Qiao Nian had a complete diamond extraction line under her. JC Corporation would never lack raw materials. Diamonds would only be mined continuously.","As she had said, this was just a batch of raw materials for them.","With JC Corporation’s status in the jewelry industry, they could work with whomever they wanted. No one dared point fingers at their partners.","On the other hand, if the Jiang family could obtain this batch of raw materials, their status in the industry would definitely rise and take a new step!","This was the reason why the Jiang family still tried their best to win the cooperation with JC Corporation even though they knew that there was not much hope.","JC was one of the largest diamond suppliers in the world today. Who didn’t want to get involved with them?","Qiao Nian frowned and didn’t speak. Her eyes were deep as if she was still considering it.","At this moment, her phone resting on the table suddenly rang.","Qiao Nian glanced at the caller ID.","It was her father.","Pursing her lips, she leaned back and answered lazily. “Hello, Dad. What’s up?”","Jian Jin’s eyebrows twitched when she heard her call him father. She tactfully fell silent and sat opposite her, waiting for Qiao Nian to finish her call.","Jiang Zongjin was still as concerned as ever. He asked her in a low voice, “Nian Nian, where are you?”","“Hmm?”","Qiao Nian looked a little puzzled. She looked at Jian Jin, who was sitting opposite her, and replied patiently, “I’m outside with a friend.”","Jian Jin looked exceptionally valiant in her black tank top. She was drinking a drink when she was suddenly called, and she almost subconsciously called out, “Hello, Uncle.”","But when the words were about to come out of her mouth, she realized that Qiao had not turned on the speaker. Her sudden shout might scare Qiao’s father.","She silently swallowed the words and focused on her juice.","...","Jiang Zongjin heard the girl say in a normal voice that she was playing with her friend outside.","He hesitated, then asked softly, “Are you at the Half Mountain Clubhouse?”","Qiao Nian’s expression was originally relaxed, but her eyes turned slightly cold when he asked this question. She asked concisely, “Who told you that I was at the Half Mountain Clubhouse?”","Between his niece and daughter, Jiang Zongjin stood on Qiao Nian’s side unconditionally. Without any hesitation, he said, “It’s Jiang Yao and the others. Xianrou asked a group of friends out to play to celebrate passing the initial review of Master Cheng’s laboratory. They said that they saw you at the clubhouse. A classmate of yours is also with them. Your classmate said... that you went with a person driving a red sports car.”","A... person in a red sports car?","Qiao Nian’s eyes were quite cold. Although Jiang Zongjin had tactfully not mentioned the gender, she could imagine what the Jiang siblings had said in front of her father.","—She went with a man in a red sports car!"]},{"number":1274,"title":"Chapter 1274 - Sister Nian: Alright, There’s No Need to Cooperate","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian suddenly wanted to laugh. The corners of her mouth curled up into a mocking smile. She was quite frustrated and didn’t explain too much to Jiang Zongjin. She only said, “That’s my friend. I haven’t seen her in a long time. She happened to be in Beijing on business, so we arranged to meet.","“As for Half Mountain Clubhouse...”","Qiao Nian’s tone was dry, suppressing her aggressiveness and coldness. “I’m drinking water with my friend in the clubhouse.”","“I know. I believe you.” Jiang Zongjin could hear the girl’s cold tone on the other end of the phone and quickly said, “I never suspected you. It’s your freedom to play with your friends. I didn’t want to interfere with you. It’s just that Jiang Yao... He called your grandfather. I just wanted to tell you.”","Jiang Zongjin’s tone was helpless. He asked her carefully, “Nian Nian, why don’t you come back first?”","Qiao Nian didn’t speak. The light in her eyes darkened.","Jiang Zongjin was afraid that she would feel uncomfortable, so he quickly explained, “Don’t think too much. Your grandfather and I believe you. It’s just that Jiang Yao has been staying at your grandfather’s place. Your grandfather’s health is not good. If he doesn’t leave, your grandfather won’t be able to rest. I just asked if you have time to come over.","“Nian Nian, don’t worry. Just come back. No one can bully you with daddy here!”","Qiao Nian nodded and hung up. She put down the phone and said to Jian Jin, “That’s all for today. I have to go back.”","“Now?” Jian Jin stood up with her and looked at her worriedly. “What happened at your house?”","Qiao Nian recalled the call. Her good mood seemed to be covered by a layer of frost. Her eyes darkened slightly, and she did not elaborate. “Nothing. It’s just a few clowns causing trouble.”","“How dare a clown cause trouble in front of you?” Jian Jin narrowed her eyes and her expression was cold. “They’re tired of living!”","“I don’t know. They live quite comfortably. I’ll go back and find out what they want.”","Qiao Nian’s face was expressionless and cold. Thinking of something again, she suddenly stopped and turned around. “By the way, there’s no need to discuss the business you just mentioned. We’re not cooperating. There’s no need!”","She might have considered it because Jiang Zongnan was doing well as an elder before Jiang Yao and the others caused trouble.","But there was no need now.","Tang Wanru was right. Since the Jiang family had already split up, they were two families.","She wasn’t a saint to the point of helping people who caused trouble around her day and night for free, and the reason she helped them was only that they were so-called blood-related.","But there was no need if that was how blood relations were used!","“You mean the matter about the cooperation with the Jiang Corporation?”","“Yes, cancel the cooperation.”","Seeing the girl’s cold attitude, Jian Jin realized what was going on and didn’t ask further. Or perhaps this matter wasn’t worth asking. She said directly, “Okay, I’ll go back and inform them that they don’t have to cooperate with the Jiang Corporation anymore...”","...","In a sanatorium in Beijing.","Jiang Zongjin had just finished his call when he bumped into Jiang Yao.","Jiang Yao’s eyes were a little evasive and guilty at first upon seeing him, but he seemed to calm down a moment later. He frowned and blocked Jiang Zongjin’s path. “Uncle, I have something to tell you.”","Jiang Zongjin stopped in his tracks expressionlessly. His expression was cold. “Speak. Hurry up and tell me. I still have to go in and accompany your grandfather.”"]},{"number":1275,"title":"Chapter 1275 - My Daughter Is Not inferior to Anyone!","paragraphs":["Jiang Yao looked at his uncle, who used to favor him, and revealed a helpless expression. He found it difficult to speak. “I’ve asked Jiang Li. Xianrou was in the wrong for the school anniversary. I’ll get her to apologize to Cousin in person.”","Before he could finish, Jiang Zongjin interrupted him calmly. “There’s no need. Nian Nian doesn’t need you to apologize. She doesn’t have to listen if you’re not sincere. This kind of apology is nothing more than a face job. It’ll only waste everyone’s time.”","Jiang Zongjin knew very well that it was impossible for Jiang Xianrou to apologize sincerely to Qiao Nian.","Jiang Yao’s apology was just a formality.","He knew his daughter well. Nian Nian was not the kind of person who needed others to apologize. If Jiang Xianrou was just putting on an act for Jiang Yao to see, why should he force Qiao Nian to listen to their apology?","At this point, Jiang Yao had nothing to say. He could only say, “No matter what, she was in the wrong at the school anniversary. I’ll go back and scold her...”","Jiang Yao changed the topic and suddenly mentioned Qiao Nian. “But Uncle, we did see Qiao Nian at the clubhouse. Her classmate said that she got into a Lamborghini with a foreign license plate. I went to the parking lot to take a look. There was indeed a red sports car parked in the parking lot. I don’t know who Qiao Nian went to the clubhouse to play with.”","Jiang Yao thought that he was doing this for the sake of his younger cousin, whom he had never met before. When it came to Qiao Nian, it was much more natural than him mentioning Jiang Xianrou. “I think she should prioritize her studies at her age. Since Qiao Nian can enter the finals of the World Software Competition, it means that she has a certain talent in computing. She’s so talented and so young. She will definitely have a career in the future as long as she’s nurtured well.”","Jiang Yao rubbed his eyebrows and paused before reluctantly continuing, “I hope she doesn’t take the wrong path.","“The conditions in Rao City are not as prosperous as in Beijing. She has always lived in Rao City in the past and has never come to Beijing. She’ll inevitably be mesmerized when she comes to a new place. I really don’t want her to take the wrong path and ruin her life.”","Jiang Zongjin listened to his “advice” on how to control his daughter word by word, hinting that Qiao Nian had lived in Rao City previously and had not seen the world. Therefore, she had been blinded by the city’s prosperity and was walking on a crooked path. His heart suddenly sank. His gaze was much colder as he looked at Jiang Yao now.","Jiang Zongjin did not answer him directly. Instead, he asked, “Have you seen Nian Nian and understood her?”","Jiang Yao was a little embarrassed by the question. He realized that Jiang Zongjin seemed to be angry at his words. He was a little helpless and embarrassed. “No. I booked a private room in the Imperial Mansion to treat you to a meal. Qiao Nian didn’t have time to come.”","“It’s not that she doesn’t have time to come. She just doesn’t want to eat with you!” Jiang Zongjin was quite impolite. His refined square face was tense and extremely stern. His words were also straightforward. “You haven’t even seen her before, nor do you know her. Just based on the fact that there’s a similar red sports car parked outside the clubhouse, you said that she went astray. Ha, what you saw today was Xianrou eating outside with her friends. Do you still think that she went astray?","“You’re so sure because that person is Nian Nian! Do you think she used to live in Rao City and has never seen the world? That’s why she’s easily tempted to go astray?”","Jiang Zongjin asked him two questions in a row, but his face was stiff. He did not want him to answer. He only said indifferently, “Let me tell you, Nian Nian is better than you think. She’s not inferior to anyone!”"]},{"number":1276,"title":"Chapter 1276 - Qiao, Do You Want Me to Accompany You In?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian arrived at the sanatorium half an hour later.","Jian Jin walked her to the outside of the sanatorium and stopped the car. She watched as the girl unbuckled her seatbelt and whispered, “Qiao, do you want me to accompany you in?”","She felt that there were many troublesome things in Qiao’s biological parents’ house!","Uneasy, Jian Jin added, “Anyway, I’m free tonight. Should I accompany you?”","At this moment, Qiao Nian had already unbuckled her seatbelt. She opened the door and picked up her shoulder bag. She got out of the car first and placed a hand on the door. Standing outside, she said, “No need. Go back first. I’ll just take a look.”","“You really don’t want me to go in with you?” Jian Jin was still worried.","Qiao Nian had already closed the door. Slinging the bag over her shoulder bag, she raised her hand and casually pulled down the brim of her cap. Her eyes were dark and deep like a cold lake. It was impossible to tell her emotions. They were quite cold. She faced the rolled-down car window and restrained her bandit aura. “Go back first. I’ll call you if anything happens!”","Jian Jin could tell that Qiao Nian didn’t want her to get involved in the Jiang family’s matters. She didn’t insist and nodded. Her fair oval face looked ordinary, but her eyes were sharp and cold. “Okay, I’ll go back first. Remember to call me if there’s anything. I live not far from here. I’ll be there in ten minutes.”","The sanatorium chosen by Old Master Jiang had a good environment. This area belonged to the wealthy area of Beijing, and there were many villas scattered around the sanatorium.","Qiao Nian thought that she was staying in a hotel. Suddenly, she realized that she was staying in a nearby villa. There was a hint of surprise in her black eyes.","But she understood in the blink of an eye.","With Jian Jin’s personality, she would definitely choose to stay in a hotel. It was convenient and fast. It was less troublesome.","However, Jian Jin did not come to Beijing alone this time. Lu Zhi was among her companions. He was not someone who could stay in a hotel casually.","Qiao Nian also knew that Lu Zhi was obsessed with cleanliness, and it was quite serious. His residence in the illegal district was always meticulously cleaned. There was no trash on the floor or the sofa. Even the cover of a book was wiped clean by him. He would even put a disposable cushion on the chair in the study.","Qiao Nian understood who lived in the villa nearby. The surprise in her eyes gradually dissipated. She stuffed a hand into her pocket and said arrogantly, “I understand. You can leave first. I’ll go in after you leave.”","As she spoke, she took a step away from the car. Unable to dissuade her, Jian Jin rolled up the window and the red sports car disappeared in the blink of an eye...","Qiao Nian watched as the car was driven away. Only then did she raise her hand and lower her cap again to hide the coldness in her eyes. She then turned around and walked into the sanatorium.","The sanatorium where Old Master Jiang lived was a garden-like scene. There was a neatly trimmed lawn, and a big ginkgo tree was planted on the lawn.","A breeze blew through the treetops, and the leaves swayed with it.","A ripple also appeared on the lake not far away.","The overall environment was quiet. It was very suitable for old people to live here and recuperate.","This was not the first time Qiao Nian had come to the sanatorium. Ever since she had been admitted to Qing University, she would come to the sanatorium from time to time to accompany Old Master Jiang.","She was very familiar with the environment as she crossed the stone path on the lawn with ease and walked all the way to the ward where Old Master Jiang was staying."]},{"number":1277,"title":"Chapter 1277 - There Are a Lot of People in the Ward","paragraphs":["Along the way, she encountered medical personnel in white coats. They couldn’t help but look in her direction.","Qiao Nian was quite polite. If their gazes met hers, she would nod slightly as a greeting. However, her bandit aura could not be restrained. She would still be eye-catching in the eyes of outsiders even if she tried her best to reduce her presence!","She walked all the way to Old Master Jiang’s ward.","She had just arrived when Jiang Zongjin sent her a WeChat message.","Qiao Nian stood at the door of the ward and did not rush in. She first took out her phone and looked down at the message. It was from Jiang Zongjin. His tone was quite gentle. He asked if she had left and told her not to rush over. When she arrived at the sanatorium, he could tell her that he would come out to pick her up.","!!","Qiao Nian read ten lines at a time. She didn’t reply. She put her phone back and opened the door with one hand.","Swoosh!","Several pairs of eyes landed on her.","Qiao Nian raised her hand impatiently, revealing a white wrist that dazzled the eyes. She lowered her cap again.","Her dark eyes swept across the people in the ward, and her red lips curled into a mocking smile.","Tsk! There were quite a few people!","Other than Jiang Weishang, who was lying on the hospital bed, her father, Jiang Xianrou, and a young man were also there.","The young man was probably in his early 20s. He looked a little like Jiang Xianrou, but his facial features were more handsome.","Jiang Xianrou should look more like Tang Wanru.","The young man in front of him looked more like his father, Jiang Zongnan. He had inherited the advantages of the Jiang family and was much better-looking than Jiang Xianrou.","He should be her legendary cheap brother, Jiang Yao.","It was also the person who had called her back this time.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and walked past the two of them. She walked straight in and greeted the old man on the bed and the middle-aged man in front of it. “Grandpa. Dad. I’m here.”","Jiang Zongjin was shocked to see the girl enter. At this moment, his first reaction was to get a chair for the girl to sit on. He said, “Nian Nian, why are you here so quickly? Didn’t you see my message? I even said I would pick you up.”","Qiao Nian did not sit on the chair. She only placed her shoulder bag on it. Her eyes were unrestrained and arrogant, but she tried to look as obedient as possible. “I only saw the message when I arrived at the door. I didn’t reply and came in directly.”","She raised her smooth jawline and looked at the old man in the hospital bed, then asked in a low voice, “Grandpa, how have you been? Have you slept well?”","Old Master Jiang was only filled with guilt and love for his granddaughter. He smiled kindly and immediately replied upon hearing her question, “I’m much better after taking the health supplement you sent the day before yesterday. I slept soundly that night and didn’t dream or wake up overnight.”","Some time ago, he had been waking up from nightmares in the middle of the night for a full month. After waking up, he could not fall asleep. He was completely exhausted during the daytime.","The doctors in the sanatorium could not do anything about his illness. They kept asking him to drink chrysanthemum tea to clear his mind, but the effect was poor.","It was not until the day before yesterday when Qiao Nian came to see him and asked him if he had finished the “health supplements” he usually took that he remembered that he had already finished them for a while. He couldn’t bear to trouble Qiao Nian, and he had not bought any, so he had not taken them.","After that, Qiao Nian gave him another bottle and reminded him to remember to take them.","It was amazing. Old Master Jiang only remembered that after taking the health supplements Qiao Nian had sent over, he was sleepy not long after that day. His body did not feel as tired when he woke up, and he was much more energetic."]},{"number":1278,"title":"Chapter 1278 - Someone Is Always Destroying the Good Atmosphere at an Untimely Time","paragraphs":["However, the weather had been hot for the past two days. He basically stayed in the ward and did not go out much during the day. He would only go out and walk around in the evening when the sun went down.","At this thought, Old Master Jiang couldn’t help but say, “What brand is the health supplement you bought? I think it’s much better than ordinary health supplements. This medicine is really not bad!”","He was not stingy with his praise, but he did not know that these ordinary ‘health supplements’ were hot cakes on the black market. Now, it was difficult to get a single pill!","The bottle Qiao Nian had given him had more than 20 pills. If he sold them on the black market, the entire black market would be in an uproar.","Unfortunately, Old Master Jiang didn’t know that Qiao Nian had given him a small pill from the black market. He thought that she had given him a local health medicine from Rao City.","!!","“That medicine... If only it could be promoted.” Old Master Jiang sighed with emotion.","Qiao Nian walked over and tucked him in. Her eyes darkened when she heard this. She retracted her hand and stood in front of his bed again, then said softly, “That day will come.”","“Is that so?” Old Master Jiang was just mentioning it casually. He just felt that it was a pity that this Traditional Chinese Medicine health supplement was so good that it was only sold in Rao City.","However, he was happy when the girl said that it would be promoted all over the country in the future. A rare smile appeared on his face.","He looked at his little granddaughter and noticed the oranges on the cabinet. He quickly instructed his eldest son, “Why didn’t you peel oranges for Nian Nian? These oranges are very sweet. Peel one for Nian Nian! You only know how to do it when I tell you.”","“Yes, yes, yes. It’s my fault.” Jiang Zongjin seemed to be still a young boy in front of Old Master Jiang. As soon as Old Master Jiang reprimanded him, he immediately went to do it. He picked up the orange and said to Qiao Nian kindly, “Nian Nian, wait a moment. I’ll peel an orange for you. Try it and see if it’s sweet.”","Qiao Nian was like an orange to Jiang Zongjin and Old Master Jiang, but she couldn’t resist their enthusiasm. She nodded and didn’t refuse.","Jiang Xianrou and Jiang Yao were also in the ward. From the moment Qiao Nian entered, she had become the absolute focus.","Not to mention his uncle, even Old Master Jiang had that attitude. Their attitude didn’t seem like they were blaming Qiao Nian, but it was more like they couldn’t wait to dote on her.","Jiang Xianrou was so angry that she laughed. She stood there and looked at the harmonious atmosphere in front of her with ridicule in her almond-shaped eyes.","She couldn’t help but say coldly, “Uncle, have you and Grandpa forgotten something?”","This time, not only Jiang Yao, but even Jiang Zongjin frowned fiercely. His expression turned cold. He looked at her and replied indifferently, “Oh, I forgot something.”","When Jiang Yao saw the expression on his uncle’s face, he recalled that when he went to talk to him in private just now, his uncle had the same expression when he questioned him.","Disappointment, anger, and forbearance.","He seemed to be extremely disappointed in the siblings!","Jiang Yao’s heart ached a little, and he didn’t dare to look into his uncle’s eyes. After hesitating for a moment, he decided to tell him about this.","He pulled Jiang Xianrou and asked her to stop talking. Walking around Jiang Xianrou, he walked to the girl who was full of banditry and greeted her gently, “Nian Nian, right? Hello, I’m Jiang Yao, your big brother.”"]},{"number":1279,"title":"Chapter 1279 - Sister Nian: Why Should I Explain? Are We Familiar With Each Other?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian raised her eyes, hiding the coldness in them. She glanced coldly at his hand, which was stretched out in front of her, and stood there without moving or reacting.","Mostly because she couldn’t be bothered.","If not for the fact that Old Master Jiang and the others were still here, her attitude towards Jiang Yao might be even colder!","Jiang Yao raised his hand in the air for a long time without anyone paying attention to him. He retracted his hand awkwardly and rubbed his temples. As if he had a headache, he said bluntly, “Where were you this afternoon? Did you go to the Half Mountain Clubhouse? Who did you go with?”","He felt that he had already controlled his tone and was only asking Qiao Nian gently. However, Jiang Zongjin’s expression still darkened as he pulled him away sternly. “Jiang Yao, aren’t you interfering too much?! Is this something you should ask? I didn’t even ask. It’s not your turn to ask!”","!!","Old Master Jiang’s face was only a little rosy. Seeing that the scene in the ward had darkened, he did not say anything, but he took a deep breath and seemed to be enduring it. He just did not fall out with him.","Jiang Yao did not look at the others. His handsome face darkened slightly, but he did not move aside. Instead, he said to him, “Uncle, I know you feel sorry for Qiao Nian. I’m doing this for her own good. I don’t want her to take the wrong path and ruin her bright future! You’re not spoiling her for her own good. Instead, you’re leading her astray!”","Jiang Xianrou also said, “Uncle, we’re her blood-related relatives. We won’t harm her. It’s for her own good that we asked clearly. After all, she’s not representing herself but our family.”","She put the phone she had prepared on the table. On the screen was a red sports car. It was Jian Jin’s car.","Jiang Xianrou raised her oval face arrogantly and asked matter-of-factly, “Do you know the car in the photo? Qiao Nian, shouldn’t you explain it to your family?”","Jiang Zongjin frowned and blocked her view of Qiao Nian. He was already regretting calling Qiao Nian over. He whispered irritably, “Nian Nian, don’t worry. Dad will handle it.”","Qiao Nian looked up and walked around him. She picked up her phone from the table and glanced at it, then laughed disdainfully and threw the phone down again. Under the black baseball cap, her eyes were soul-stirring. She looked at her with unconcealed laziness and disdain. “Why should I explain to you? Who are you? Ha, Jiang Xianrou, don’t you think you’re too important?! You think I need to explain to you and report my schedule. The question is, are we familiar with each other?”","Are we familiar with each other?","The girl asked very naturally. Her voice was very soft, but it was extremely embarrassing!","Like Jiang Xianrou, Jiang Yao’s face was burning and he could not react for a moment.","What was Qiao Nian’s reaction?","Jiang Yao frowned and subconsciously pursed his thin lips.","Qiao Nian glanced at him again. “Not to mention that we’re family, even if we are, we’re still of the same generation. It’s not your place to ask me about my matters!”","It was just a Lamborghini sports car, was it worth them coming to her for an explanation with great fanfare?","What explanation did he want?","The cheapest car Jian Jin had ever driven was this Lamborghini. It had only returned to the country because of her. The other cars were in garages in the illegal district and could not be brought back.","Would Jiang Yao and her brother still want her to write a one-thousand-word guarantee if Jian Jin drove the private custom-made ones in her garage today?","Ha, what a joke!"]},{"number":1280,"title":"Chapter 1280 - Sister Nian Has Always Slapped Her Face","paragraphs":["The girl’s beautiful black eyes looked at Jiang Xianrou with hostility. “You kept looking for me to explain myself from the day I arrived in Beijing.","“Jiang Xianrou, have you explained to me about the school anniversary?” Her words were impatient, not leaving Jiang Xianrou any face.","Jiang Xianrou was speechless. She stood rooted to the ground, her fair oval face turning green and white. She pinched her palm. “I...”","“Did you explain what happened on Weibo?”","Qiao Nian had long had enough of the Jiang family’s second branch. From Tang Wanru to Jiang Xianrou to Jiang Yao, who had come out of nowhere, she believed that she had treated them with enough patience. However, reality had proven that enough patience would only make the other party take action!","!!","For example, she had just taken a ride in her friend’s car, but they still dared to make a scene at home and ask her for an explanation.","Tsk, did she look like someone who liked to explain herself?","No one asked her for explanations in the illegal district. But people came to her every day to ask for an explanation in a palm-sized place like the Jiang family.","OK, she would give them an explanation. She wanted to see if they could accept it!","Qiao Nian couldn’t suppress her bloodlust as she asked in a cold voice, “And that junior on the Internet. Her name is Zhao Ruoqi. Have you explained it before?”","“Qiao Nian, don’t change the topic. We’re talking about you, not me!” Jiang Xianrou’s beautiful eyes darkened slightly as her blood rushed to her head. She was completely unprepared for Qiao Nian to mention Weibo.","The girl raised her hand and pulled on her baseball cap again as she looked at her expressionlessly. “Jiang Xianrou, you haven’t even explained yourself. Why are you so aggressive and asking me to explain myself to you? Who are you? The dictionary stipulates that you, Jiang Xianrou, don’t need to explain to anyone, but the others have to revolve around you? Which page is it on? I’ll go read it.”","This was a slap in the face!","Jiang Xianrou’s fingertips trembled. It was unknown if she was angry or embarrassed. Her oval face was red from anger, but she could not say a word.","Jiang Yao looked at his sister and felt a headache coming on. However, he couldn’t raise his head because of Qiao Nian’s words. His handsome face revealed a headache. He first said to Qiao Nian, “Qiao Nian, Xianrou is doing this for your own good.”","He thought that if he mediated, Qiao Nian would give him some face.","Unexpectedly, the girl’s eyes were cold. She raised her chin and looked at him. Her voice was cold. “So you think that as long as it’s ‘for my own good’, you can stand on the moral high ground and guide everyone’s life?”","Jiang Yao was speechless.","The girl didn’t even bother to look at him. “No need,” she said. “I don’t need someone who says it’s ‘for my own good.'”","At this moment, Jiang Zongjin handed over the peeled orange with gentle eyes. Afraid that she would get angry, he changed the topic and said gently, “Nian Nian, eat an orange.”","For a moment, Qiao Nian did not restrain the murderous coldness around her. Fortunately, a round orange was handed to her. She stared at the peeled orange and closed her eyes, suppressing the killing intent in them. Her face was cold as she reached out with her fair wrist and took the orange from Father Jiang. She pursed her lips and stopped talking.","She did not speak, but Jiang Yao could not pretend that nothing had happened. After hesitating again and again, he turned to Jiang Xianrou and said, “Xianrou, apologize to Qiao Nian first.”","Jiang Xianrou suspected that she had heard wrong. “Brother, what are you talking about?!”"]},{"number":1281,"title":"Chapter 1281 - Dont Mess With Me, Im Not to Be Messed With","paragraphs":["They were here to ask Qiao Nian to explain why she was at the clubhouse in the afternoon, who she was with, and who the owner of the sports car was.","Why did it become her apologizing to Qiao Nian?","“Apologize.” Jiang Yao’s handsome face darkened. He was a little oppressive when he was angry.","Seeing that he was angry, Jiang Xianrou pinched her palm and turned her head away. “I don’t know why I’m apologizing.”","“Didn’t you hear what your sister said just now? At your school’s anniversary, you stole someone else’s identity and publicized it online. After that, not only did you not appear to explain, but you also allowed the passers-by on Weibo to attack your sister. One of them was even a junior. Have you apologized to Qiao Nian?”","!!","Jiang Yao put on a fair attitude and demanded forcefully, “Apologize first. Apologize to your sister.”","This was also what he wanted Old Master Jiang and Jiang Zongjin to see. He didn’t want the two elders in the family to think that he was targeting Qiao Nian.","Actually, his original intention was for Qiao Nian’s sake. He was worried that his little cousin would go astray.","After all, Qiao Nian was even more beautiful than Xianrou. As a man, he knew very well how attractive Qiao Nian was.","This kind of beauty was rare in Beijing.","Qiao Nian had never seen the world before and had always stayed in a small city. He was afraid that his little cousin would be deceived.","She was a student now, and students should focus on their studies. He didn’t even approve of Qiao Nian entering the entertainment industry like Jiang Li.","In his opinion, studying was the right way!","Qiao Nian was talented in her studies and should cherish her talent. She shouldn’t live her life in a daze and waste her youth.","“No!” Jiang Yao had thought it through, but Jiang Xianrou was not cooperative. Her beautiful face was so cold that it was like ice. “I have nothing to apologize for. She never told me before that she was Zhui Guang and played me like a monkey. Why should I apologize to her?”","Jiang Yao’s eyebrows moved slightly. He raised his hand as if he was about to attack in anger.","Playing with the orange in her hand, the girl indifferently stopped them upon seeing this scene. “Alright, I don’t need you to apologize. Don’t disturb me in the future! We’ll go our separate ways. You don’t have to greet me when we meet in the future.”","After saying that, her gaze landed on Jiang Xianrou.","Qiao Nian didn’t say much, but she was quite domineering. “Jiang Xianrou, don’t provoke me in the future. I’m not to be trifled with.”","“...” Jiang Xianrou’s eyelids twitched. She didn’t know what she meant, but she felt vaguely uneasy. She had a feeling that Qiao Nian wouldn’t let this go.","Her heart beat faster and her eyes were filled with shock and anger, but she didn’t know what she wanted.","Jiang Xianrou looked at the girl’s deep eyes and felt frustrated and uneasy.","What was Qiao Nian trying to do?!","...","Wangyuan Road, in the building of the Jiang Corporation.","The man in the suit came out of the company conference room after the meeting.","His suit was a designer one, tailored to fit him. He wore a black suit with black pants and looked high-spirited.","“President Jiang.”","“Hello, President Jiang.”","On the way back, Jiang Zongnan was greeted by the employees.","He had been in a good mood recently. Although his personality was relatively reserved, he couldn’t help but nod in response.","He was in such a good mood that anyone could tell.","An employee went to the pantry to get water after he left and asked the person beside him softly, “Hey, do you know what’s been going on recently? I bumped into President Jiang on the way. President Jiang is in a good mood. Did something good happen to the company?”"]},{"number":1282,"title":"Chapter 1282 - Not Even Giving Them a Chance to Apologize","paragraphs":["The female employee tore a bag of instant coffee and poured it into a cup beside him; she was from the secretary’s office. She smiled when she heard this and her red lips curled up. “Isn’t that a good thing? You didn’t hear? Our company might work with the JC Corporation. The cooperation will be done as long as we take this cooperation case.”","“JC Corporation? The very impressive JC Corporation?” The employee looked surprised.","The Jiang Corporation was considered the best in the jewelry industry in the country, but it was not enough internationally.","JC Corporation was different. They were the leader in the industry globally.","Their company was definitely out of their league!","!!","“That’s strange. Why would JC Corporation work with us? Didn’t they only work with a few fixed brands in the past?”","The few brands that JC worked with regularly were all luxury first-tier brands. The Jiang Corporation was far inferior in this aspect. It was not surprising that the employees would be surprised.","A hint of confusion flashed across the female employee’s eyes.","However, she knew the rules of the workplace well. She suppressed all her doubts and stirred her coffee with a spoon, then said casually, “Why do you care about this? You just have to know that our company is about to reach a cooperation with JC Corporation! JC Corporation has already kept our cooperation case. Usually, the possibility of cooperation in such a situation is very high. President Jiang is happy about this these few days. Let’s wait. I won’t talk to you anymore. I’ll go back to my seat. Take your time~”","...","Jiang Zongnan didn’t know that the news that they were about to sign a contract with JC Corporation had already spread throughout the company.","After he returned to his office, he walked straight to his seat and picked up the work that had piled up on his desk. He flipped open one of the folders and was about to sign it.","Unexpectedly, the office door suddenly opened and someone entered in panic.","He frowned and asked in a low voice, “Why are you so flustered?”","His assistant had already walked in quickly. He didn’t look too good. He lowered his head and said, “President Jiang, something bad has happened.”","Jiang Zongnan put down his fountain pen and frowned, then looked at him with a dark expression. “What’s wrong?”","The assistant did not dare to hide it from him and said honestly, “Just now, the people from JC contacted us and said that they rejected our plan. They don’t plan to cooperate with us anymore.”","“What did you say?” Jiang Zongnan suddenly stood up from his chair. The chair hit the bookshelf beside him with a bang.","Shocked, the assistant immediately dared not speak anymore.","Jiang Zongnan took a long time to recover. An anxious expression appeared on his face as he suppressed his emotions and said in a low voice, “Did you ask them why they are not cooperating with us? Didn’t they hint that there was a high chance of cooperation when they left the plan behind previously? Why did JC suddenly change their mind?!”","“This... President Jiang, I’ve asked. But they didn’t say it explicitly. They only said that we caused trouble and provoked their higher-up. This is their decision, and they can’t control it.”","The assistant was also very anxious. “I tried to find out who the higher-up they were talking about was. I said that we were willing to go to their door and apologize to them. However, I couldn’t get anything out of them. They refused to say who they were.”","This was the first time Jiang Zongnan had encountered such a thing. He didn’t even know who the other party was, but JC insisted that they had offended someone at the top.","The other party did not even give him a chance to apologize!"]},{"number":1283,"title":"Chapter 1283 - Take Care of Jiang Yao and the Others","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongnan took a few deep breaths but could not recover from this news. He placed his hand on the desk and his eyes darkened as he instructed, “Contact the JC side again and ask them to reveal who we offended. As long as you get their information, send it to me immediately. I’ll personally go and apologize.”","“OK.”","Jiang Zongnan stopped him again before the assistant left. “Wait a moment.”","The assistant quickly returned and asked him respectfully, “President Jiang, do you have any other arrangements?”","Jiang Zongnan thought for a moment and waved his hand tiredly. “Forget it. That’s all. Go and do it first.”","!!","He wanted to negotiate with the other party at the company level, but after some thought, he felt that he had to find a connection.","JC seemed to have a background in the illegal district. Jiang Yao had been staying in Tian Chen and dealing with the forces in the illegal district. He should be more familiar with JC. He would go home and ask Jiang Yao if he could get someone to figure out the reason!","Who had they offended?","And who was the higher-up the JC people were talking about?","Jiang Zongnan’s heart sank. He supported his forehead with his hand as he felt a splitting headache. “Go out first. Close the door on the way out.”","The assistant was confused and said obediently, “Okay, President Jiang.”","After he left, Jiang Zongnan sat back in the leather chair. After a long time, he moved again. With a solemn expression, he picked up the phone on his desk and prepared to call Jiang Yao.","However, he received a call from Old Master Jiang at this moment.","Jiang Zongnan had always respected his father. Even though he was anxious, he still put down what he was doing and answered Old Master Jiang’s call first.","“Hello, Dad.”","Before he could finish, Old Master Jiang’s tired voice came from the other end of the phone. “You haven’t been back recently?”","“Something happened at the company these past two days.”","Jiang Zongnan had been busy working with JC Corporation for the past few days. He didn’t expect that after he tried to submit the proposal, they would agree to cooperate.","He had been in meetings with the various departments for the past few days and was busy following up on the handover.","The meeting lasted until nine or ten in the evening. Jiang Zongnan simply rested in the company. There was a separate suite in his office, and he slept there at night.","Who knew that the cooperation would be ruined in the blink of an eye?","Jiang Zongnan didn’t want to tell him about the company’s troubles and made Old Master Jiang frustrated with him. So, he pretended to be fine. “Dad, what’s wrong?”","“Go back and accompany Jiang Yao and the others more when you have time. Control them and make sure they don’t find trouble with their sister all day long.”","Old Master Jiang’s voice came from the phone. Jiang Zongnan thought he had heard wrong. “Jiang Yao... who did he find trouble with?”","The sister his father was talking about was definitely not Xianrou.","Jiang Yao had doted on Xianrou the most since he was young. He was just short of cherishing her.","If the Old Master was not talking about Xianrou, then there was only...","Jiang Zongnan’s eyelids twitched, and a person appeared in his mind. “You mean Nian Nian?”","“Yes.” In the ward of the sanatorium, Jiang Weishang sat on the hospital bed with his phone and spoke to him. His face, which had seen many years, was filled with the wisdom given by time.","He looked tired, but his eyes were as sharp as before. They were even sharper than when he was young. He did not say too much to his youngest son and only said earnestly, “If you still want to get along with your brother like before, take care of Jiang Yao and the others. Tell them not to find trouble with Nian Nian anymore. Otherwise, you’ll really be two separate families in the future.”"]},{"number":1284,"title":"Chapter 1284 - Old Master Jiang: Its Not Certain Which Will Benefit From Who in the Future","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongnan immediately felt uneasy.","He got up from his office chair and walked to the floor-to-ceiling window. His phone was placed beside him, and he frowned. He immediately expressed his feelings. “Dad, how could I want to fall out with Big Brother’s family?! Big Brother will always be my big brother, and we’ll always be a family! Including Nian Nian. I’ve always treated her as my daughter and never treated her as an outsider.”","Ever since he had acknowledged her in Rao City, he had never treated Qiao Nian as an outsider. This included the fact that he had given Qiao Nian his bank card as a greeting gift. He sincerely wanted to treat her well.","He did not want to make a mess.","Old Master Jiang still knew his son well. “I know. I didn’t say that you treat Nian Nian as an outsider. I’m just telling you that you can’t ignore Xianrou and the others. If you don’t care, it’s one thing if you want to treat Nian Nian as an outsider or not. It’s another matter if Nian Nian still treats you as family.","!!","“Think about what Xianrou has done during this period of time. What do you think you would do if you were her? Can you be completely honest?”","Jiang Zongnan was speechless. He was already in his 40s, but he was still scolded by his father until he couldn’t raise his head.","Old Master Jiang said earnestly, “Your brother isn’t what you think, including Nian Nian... Just watch. Nian Nian isn’t inferior to Xianrou and Jiang Yao! It’s still uncertain who will benefit from whom in the future. If you do things to the extreme now, it’ll be difficult to go back on your word in the future. I’m not just thinking about your brother’s family. You’re also my son. I’m also planning for you.","“Zongnan, let me give you a piece of advice. Treat your big brother and his family well. Don’t cause a huge ruckus just because you separated from the family and make them seem like enemies. You’ll be the one suffering in the future!","“Think about what I said and think about it yourself!”","Old Master Jiang hung up.","Jiang Zongnan held his phone and was unable to calm down for a long time.","He stood in front of the window for a long time until his assistant entered again and brought him a cup of tea, then carefully called out to him.","Jiang Zongnan came back to his senses and pulled his tie, exhaling the turbid air in his chest.","He returned to his desk, picked up his car keys, and said to his assistant, “Help me postpone my meeting tonight. I’m going home.”","The assistant looked up and saw that he didn’t look good. He mistakenly thought that he was still upset about the JC Corporation suddenly not working with the company.","He immediately lowered his head and did not dare to look at him. He only said humbly, “Okay, President Jiang.”","Jiang Zongnan was distraught as he strode out.","Logically speaking, he should stay behind and contact the JC Corporation as soon as possible to find out which higher-up he had offended.","However, he couldn’t ignore the fire in his own backyard.","Jiang Zongnan suppressed the anger in his heart and only wanted to go back and settle the matters at home. He wanted to go back and ask the siblings what they had done again!","...","On the other side, Jiang Yao and Jiang Xianrou walked out of the sanatorium.","The sanatorium was located in a wealthy district. The environment was quiet, and taxis seldom passed by on the road.","Jiang Yao was the first to break the awkward atmosphere. “Uncle, Qiao Nian, let me send you off.”","He was holding the car keys in his hand. His black Land Rover was parked on the side of the road not far away, looking exceptionally eye-catching."]},{"number":1285,"title":"Chapter 1285 - It Makes Me Uncomfortable","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongjin instinctively frowned and wanted to refuse. Then, he looked at the girl beside him and hesitated.","He had been buried in scientific research all these years and had no interest in anything else. After so many years, he had never gotten a driver’s license.","He was used to taking buses and subways. At worst, he could walk to the station or scan the code and ride a small yellow car. In the past, he had thought that his lifestyle was fine and quite healthy. As long as he was happy, he did not have to care about what others thought.","After that, Lin Xuan took the fish that donghuang Ziyou caught to the river and killed them all. When he returned, he began to cook them as he said, ”","babies, these fish are called black-eyed stingers. The most suitable way to eat them is to cook them in soup. &Quot;","!!","the soup is thick and fragrant. With father’s special spices, it will definitely become an unparalleled delicacy! &Quot;","At first, the girls wanted to roast the black-eyed Stingray, so Lin Xuan explained it to them.","“Oh, oh, so the black-eyed Stingray is the most suitable for making soup!”","“Then hurry up and cook it, father. I want to drink a lot of fish soup!”","The little girls were all looking forward to it.","Since father said that soup is the best, then drink more soup!","Donghuang Ziyou laughed to herself. As expected of a good-for-nothing rich young master, he really had a deep understanding of food.","Under the gazes of the five of them, Lin Xuan finished cooking the black-eyed catfish soup. Before boiling, he sprinkled some special spices into the thick milky-white soup.","Hu ~","A rich and fragrant aroma filled the air within a radius of a thousand feet, causing the little girls to drool.","As donghuang Ziyou only had two heaven and earth Jade plates, the little girls quickly discussed and decided that the four of them would share one Jade plate. Lin Xuan and donghuang Ziyou would also share one.","Lin Xuan had no objections to this. His daughters ‘arrangement was very reasonable.","As the perfect stay-at-home dad, agreeing to their arrangements was also encouraging them to use their brains and improve their ability to deal with things.","Donghuang Ziyou didn’t say much.","It was not the first time she shared utensils with Lin Xuan.","Besides, on that night four years ago, the two of them had exchanged saliva quite a lot.","In front of his daughters, he naturally had to be generous and let them feel that there was no estrangement between his parents.","Just like that, the family of six savored the delicious meat of the black-eyed Spanish mackerel and drank the fish soup one bowl after another.","Although there wasn’t enough utensils, the little girls seemed even happier than before, their eyes full of happiness and joy.","“Although there are fewer things that can be used, our family relationship is even better!”","This little bully sister, Zhi Zhu, quickly concluded this logic.","Lin Xuan and donghuang Ziyou smiled in relief when they heard this.","Unknowingly, his daughter had grown up a little!","He paused and looked at the empty road. There were no cars. He added, “Give me a call if you and Qiao Nian don’t get a car. I’ll come back and pick you up.”"]},{"number":1286,"title":"Chapter 1286 - Master Wang Personally Came to Pick Her Up","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongjin couldn’t be bothered to acknowledge him. After Jiang Yao asked for trouble, he turned around and left.","The black Land Rover parked by the roadside reversed in less than two minutes and drove away, leaving only a plume of car exhaust...","After they left, Jiang Zongjin rubbed his temples as he felt a splitting headache. He took out his phone, looking anxious and guilty. “Nian Nian, don’t be anxious. I’ll call someone to pick us up.”","The research institute he worked at had equipped him with a particular car. However, he had never used it and did not like to stand out.","However, he did not hesitate to use this special treatment now. He couldn’t bear to see Qiao Nian suffer even a little.","!!","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian stopped him, not letting him make the call. She calmly said, “I’ve sent Gu San our location. He’s already on his way to pick us up. They’ll be here in a few minutes. We’ll go for a meal next. After that, I’ll get him to send you back.”","At first, Jiang Zongjin did not realize who she was talking about. Then, he instantly remembered who Gu San was when he came to his senses.","Gu San was Young Master Ye’s right-hand man in Beijing!","Jiang Zongjin still didn’t know that Qiao Nian was living with Ye Wangchuan. No one at home told him. They only said that Qiao Nian lived in Rhine Apartments.","Why did Nian Nian seem to be very familiar with Young Master Ye?","Jiang Zongjin was puzzled, but he subconsciously trusted Qiao Nian, so he had no intention of asking. He only felt a little puzzled.","Qiao Nian didn’t know that he was puzzled.","The girl’s face was exquisite. Her baseball cap was pulled down quite low. Her phone kept ringing, and new messages were sent from time to time.","Qiao Nian replied to Jian Jin and told her that she was fine.","She saw the QQ message from Wen Ruxia next.","She had given Wen Ruxia her phone number, but the latter rarely texted her. She seemed to be used to looking for her on QQ.","Qiao Nian clicked on the message.","Wen Ruxia sent her a few messages in an excited tone.","[Wen Ruxia: I’ve discussed it with the production team. They said that you can learn it at the last minute. You just need to know a few basic movements. It’s very simple. I’ll find a professional teacher to teach you. Big boss, do you have time?]","[Wen Ruxia: Don’t worry. I know you’re busy with the competition. It won’t take you long. This MV will be filmed for a day at most. If you don’t participate, this female lead role might be given to someone else. Compared to Jiang Xianrou, I think your image is more suitable for [Spark]! It would be great if you could appear on the screen.]","[Wen Ruxia: Boss, did you see the message? I hope you can reply to me when you see it. It’s easy for me to arrange it.]","Qiao Nian had only casually skimmed through the messages. Her eyes darkened when she saw the person Wen Ruxia mentioned.","Her finger touched the name.","Jiang Xianrou.","Tsk, Jiang Xianrou wanted to film the MV for [Spark]?","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, looking surprised.","She guessed that Jiang Xianrou probably did not know who the author of this theme song was. Otherwise, with Jiang Xianrou’s personality, she wouldn’t have rushed to grab this opportunity.","However...","Her eyes turned cold, and her gaze was dry and a little arrogant.","She opened the editor and replied to Wen Ruxia.","[QN: I’ll take this MV.]","She did not wait for Wen Ruxia’s reply as she calmly put her phone back into her pocket and chatted with her father."]},{"number":1287,"title":"Chapter 1287 - Cough, An Ugly Wife Will See Her In-Laws Sooner or Later","paragraphs":["Ten minutes later, the black car slowly stopped in front of them.","The window rolled down, and the mesmerizing side profile of the man in the passenger seat appeared.","Gu San greeted Qiao Nian warmly. “Miss Qiao.”","Then, he noticed the person at her side.","Ye Wangchuan also saw him, a middle-aged man. He had seen him before. It was Qiao Nian’s biological father, Jiang Zongjin.","He did not expect Jiang Zongjin to be there. He immediately greeted him politely, “Hello, Uncle Jiang.”","“Uh, okay. Hello.”","Jiang Zongjin seemed to be stepping on cotton and was in a daze. He watched as the girl walked over to open the door and gestured for him to get in. “Dad, get in first.”","“Ah, okay, okay.”","Jiang Zongjin instinctively followed.","After he got into the car, Qiao Nian followed him inside. She closed the door quite naturally and rolled down the window. Her posture was relaxed as she put her elbow on the rolled-down window and said to the person in front of her lazily, “Let’s go. Let’s find a place to eat first. I’m treating my father to a meal.”","Ye Wangchuan was very calm and immediately asked the man, “Does Uncle Jiang like spicy or light food?”","Jiang Zongjin was dumbfounded. He felt uncomfortable in the car and felt that something was wrong. For a moment, his mind was a mess, but he did not realize what was wrong. He replied uncomfortably, “Something lighter.”","“Okay.” Ye Wangchuan nodded and instructed Gu San, “Go to the Imperial Mansion.”","The dishes in the Imperial Mansion were Cantonese. They were light and sweet, suitable for middle-aged and old people.","If Jiang Zongjin’s taste was as spicy as Qiao Nian’s, he would bring him to the hotpot restaurant that they had gone to last time.","“Okay, okay, Master Wang.”","Gu San hurriedly reversed the car and drove in the direction of the Imperial Mansion skillfully. He even looked at Jiang Zongjin’s reaction through the rearview mirror.","He secretly clicked his tongue.","Miss Qiao came suddenly~!","Big boss was big boss. Miss Qiao did not tell them that Father Jiang was also here. Master Wang was forced to meet his parents.","For some reason, a sentence appeared in Gu San’s heart: An ugly daughter-in-law will have to see her in-laws sooner or later.","Why did he feel that Master Wang was the wife who suddenly met his in-laws?","Gu San only thought about it in his heart and did not dare to show it on his face. If Master Wang knew what he was thinking, he reckoned that his name would be in the quota of Continent F!","...","Jiang Yao placed his hand on the steering wheel. While waiting for the traffic light, he looked at his sister sitting in the front passenger seat and said in a low and serious voice, “Xianrou, don’t talk to Uncle like that in the future. Uncle always treated you well. Even if our families have separated, we’re still family with Uncle and the others. Uncle is still an elder we have to respect, understand?”","Jiang Xianrou was distracted. Her eyelashes fluttered as she replied impatiently, “I understand. I didn’t say anything. They were unwilling to ride with us in the first place. It’s not like we weren’t willing to send them back.”","That was the logic!","Jiang Yao always felt that sometimes, her emotions were too written on her face and it was easy to make people uncomfortable.","Jiang Yao could only say tactfully, “Uncle... is a teacher. Qiao Nian doesn’t know many people, but they’re our family, after all. We’re all family. Grandpa handed the company and connections to Dad because he hopes that our family can take care of Uncle and the others in the future. Don’t let Grandpa down.”"]},{"number":1288,"title":"Chapter 1288 - Jiang Xianrou Is Slapped","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou’s beautiful eyes were cold. She did not want to argue with Jiang Yao, so she turned her face away. Her fingers dug into the strap of her bag as she replied coldly, “I understand. Brother, you don’t have to continue.”","Jiang Yao could tell from the expression on her face that she was impatient and did not listen to his words. Jiang Yao couldn’t help but shake his head. He was helpless, but he couldn’t do anything about his sister.","Coincidentally, the red light turned green. He did not say anything else to Jiang Xianrou. He just stepped on the accelerator.","...","At the Jiang residence.","Jiang Zongnan returned home first.","The servant brought him tea. He took off his suit jacket and threw it on the sofa. As he rolled up his sleeves, he asked Mother Wang, “Where’s Madam?”","He glanced up at the second floor. The house was pretty quiet. It didn’t look like anyone was home.","Mother Wang walked over respectfully and picked up the suit he had changed out of. Hearing his question, she looked up and replied softly, “President Jiang, Madam isn’t at home. She went out this morning.”","“Not home again?” Jiang Zongnan frowned reflexively and stopped rolling up his sleeves.","Mother Wang was just a servant at home who was helping the Jiang family.","She immediately lowered her head and stood there, not daring to say anything. She only whispered, “Madam might have gone out with a friend to meet at the beauty salon.”","Jiang Zongnan did not continue asking. He did not expect Mother Wang to know where Tang Wanru had gone.","He just felt that Tang Wanru had been out especially frequently recently. She was often not at home during the day and only came back at night. He didn’t know what she was doing.","However, he had been married to Tang Wanru for more than 20 years and their relationship had always been harmonious. Jiang Zongnan did not think too much about it. He nodded and instructed Mother Wang to get busy first.","He sat down on the sofa himself and took a sip of water from his glass.","He put down the cup again and pressed the space between his eyebrows. Then, he leaned against the sofa for a while before taking out his phone and calling Jiang Yao.","“Hello, where are you and when are you coming back?”","When Jiang Zongnan heard Jiang Yao say that he was with Jiang Xianrou and was on the way home and that they would get here in about 10 minutes, he tugged at his collar and dispersed the hot anger on his body. He said in a low voice, “I’ll wait for you at home. Come back quickly!”","Jiang Zongnan hung up. After hesitating for a moment, he found Jiang Zongjin’s phone number and called him.","The person on the other end said that the number he had dialed was unavailable.","He hung up silently and slowly put down the phone. There was only deep helplessness and exhaustion in his shrewd and wise eyes...","Ten minutes later, Jiang Yao and Jiang Xianrou finally arrived home.","As soon as Jiang Yao entered, he saw his father sitting on the sofa with a cup of tea in front of him. He was not watching television or the newspaper, as if he was waiting for their return.","He changed his shoes to slippers at the entrance and entered. His handsome face was somewhat similar to Jiang Zongnan’s, but compared to the mature and reserved middle-aged man in his 40s, he looked younger and more flamboyant.","“Dad.” Jiang Yao walked to the living room and called out.","“You’re back?” Seeing the siblings entering, Jiang Zongnan threw his phone on the coffee table expressionlessly. He suddenly stood up and ignored Jiang Yao as he walked to Jiang Xianrou and slapped her face.","Bam!","The slap echoed through the living room.","Mother Wang, who had come over to serve them tea, stood rooted to the ground. She covered her mouth and almost cried out.","Why did President Jiang hit Miss Xianrou?"]},{"number":1289,"title":"Chapter 1289 - Still Protecting Jiang Xianrou","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou was also stunned by the sudden slap. She covered her face and did not recover for a long time.","“Dad!” Jiang Yao reacted more strongly than her. He shielded his sister behind him and could not hide his anger. He questioned the man, “Dad, what are you doing?!”","Jiang Zongnan was so angry that his face was ashen. He pointed at him and said, “You still have the cheek to ask me what I’m doing? Move aside! I’ll settle the score with her first before settling the score with you!”","Jiang Yao did not move aside. His 1.8-meter-tall body stood in front of him like a mountain. His handsome face darkened. “You can settle the score with me, but what did Xianrou do wrong for you to hit her?”","“Heh!” Seeing that he was unwilling to move aside, Jiang Zongnan sneered. “What did she do wrong? From the moment Nian Nian was admitted to Qing University, she couldn’t bear to see your sister doing well and targeted Nian Nian everywhere. Previously, when the family held a school promotion banquet for your sister, it was fine if she didn’t come as a member of the family, but she even spread the word in the circle to not let anyone else come. If not for Master Nie and your grandfather’s friends, do you know how embarrassing it would have been that day?”","Jiang Yao had never heard of the school promotion banquet. He instinctively turned around and frowned at Jiang Xianrou. His heart softened again when he saw Jiang Xianrou’s messy hair and slightly swollen cheek.","“...I believe Xianrou didn’t do it on purpose.” Jiang Yao didn’t even have the confidence to say this, and his eyes were weak as he looked away from his father.","Jiang Zongnan’s face darkened. He sneered again and continued, “Alright, she didn’t do this on purpose. Then, how will she explain the school anniversary later?","“She hasn’t apologized to Nian Nian in public about that matter! Do you think that by apologizing to Nian Nian in private, this matter will be as if it never happened?”","Jiang Xianrou had already recovered from the slap. Hearing her father’s words, she bit her lip in extreme humiliation.","The school anniversary again!","All of them refused to let go of the school anniversary. Did they want her to kneel and apologize to Qiao Nian?!","Jiang Yao also recalled that he had forced Jiang Xianrou to apologize at the sanatorium earlier. Although she did not apologize, it was more or less a little embarrassing in front of so many people. Now that his father mentioned the school anniversary, he couldn’t help but stand on Jiang Xianrou’s side and defend her. “...Dad, isn’t this matter already in the past? Let the past be the past. Why are you bringing it up?”","Seeing that he was going to protect Jiang Xianrou no matter what, Jiang Zongnan thought of his attitude towards Qiao Nian and felt an inexplicable chill. He suddenly understood why Old Master Jiang’s tone was so serious when he called him. With their attitude, it would be strange if the old man wasn’t disappointed!","He took a deep breath and lowered his hand. His expression was still extremely ugly. “Alright, I won’t mention the past to you. Then, what happened this time? Why did your grandfather call me and say that you siblings bullied Nian Nian again?”","When Jiang Zongnan mentioned this, it was as if a stick was hitting his head. His head hurt everywhere. “That’s your sister, not your enemy! How many times have I told you? The Jiang family owes Nian Nian’s mother a favor. You can have your current glory because of her. If you can’t repay her, at least don’t bully your sister. Why are you so disobedient?”","He took a deep breath and his face turned cold again. His eyes were fierce and serious. “If you don’t want to listen, get out. I’ll pretend I didn’t give birth to you. Don’t say that you’re from the Jiang family in the future!”","Those words were extraordinarily harsh."]},{"number":1290,"title":"Chapter 1290 - The Owner of That Sports Car Is One of the Big Bosses of the Illegal District","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou suspected that she had heard wrong. “Dad.”","Jiang Zongnan did not even look at her. It was obvious how angry he was this time.","Jiang Yao was stunned for a moment before he reacted. He also felt that his father was making a mountain out of a molehill. He pursed his lips and said with a dark expression, “Dad, this isn’t what you think.”","He then told him about what had happened at the clubhouse and how Qiao Nian’s classmate had seen Qiao Nian get into an unfamiliar sports car.","After Jiang Yao finished speaking, he showed Jiang Zongnan the photo of the sports car he had taken with his phone to prove that he was not lying.","In the end, he said, “Xianrou and I then went to Grandpa’s place. We hoped to remind Uncle to pay more attention to Qiao Nian’s friends.”","Jiang Zongnan looked at the photo carefully.","There was indeed a red sports car in the photo. He recognized the logo. He could afford such a car with his wealth. He knew very well that such a car was not cheap.","Jiang Zongnan fell silent after looking at the photo. He did not reply to Jiang Yao immediately. He just returned the phone and closed his eyes, as if he was deep in thought. After a full minute, he opened his eyes and shook his head at Jiang Yao. He slowly said, “Nian Nian is not such a person.”","Jiang Yao did not expect his father to still choose to protect Qiao Nian in front of the “evidence”. He did not mention that he had slapped Jiang Xianrou.","He was suddenly angry. He understood why his mother and sister did not like his little cousin from Rao City.","Jiang Yao’s face was tense as he retracted his phone. “I’ve already asked Xu Jishen to help me investigate the owner of the car. I believe he’ll send me a message soon.”","Jiang Yao’s thoughts were very simple. As long as he knew who the owner of the car Qiao Nian had taken was, he would know if they had wronged her.","As he spoke, the screen of his phone lit up.","Jiang Yao looked at the caller ID. It was Xu Jishen.","He simply turned his phone on and answered. “Hello.”","Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Xianrou looked at him and held their breaths.","“Hello.” Xu Jishen’s voice came from the other end of the phone after a second. There was nothing unusual about it.","“Have you investigated it?” Jiang Yao was about to ask him about the car.","Unexpectedly, Xu Jishen beat him to it. “I was just about to tell you about this!”","Jiang Yao immediately pursed his lips and waited for him to continue.","Xu Jishen suppressed his surprise and asked with caution, “Are you sure this is the car you saw your cousin riding today?”","Jiang Yao instinctively asked, “What’s wrong with this car? Is there a problem?”","“It’s not a problem, right?” Xu Jishen paused. “Do you know who the owner of this car is?”","“Who is it?”","Jiang Yao felt that he liked to keep people guessing.","It was just a car. Was there a need to keep circling around?","Xu Jishen said, “Jian Jin is the Chairman of JC Corporation and one of the big shots in the illegal district. I saw her at the hotel previously and thought that my eyes were playing tricks on me. I didn’t expect her to come to Beijing. Recently, many people from the illegal district have gathered in Beijing. All of them have powerful backgrounds.”","Jiang Yao thought he had heard wrong and did not speak.","Xu Jishen muttered to himself, “Speaking of which, Jian Jin is awesome. I heard that she has a deep relationship with that mysterious diamond big shot. She has always had the power of a diamond big shot behind her. I didn’t expect your cousin to know such a person... Your cousin is young but has quite a lot of connections.”"]},{"number":1291,"title":"Chapter 1291 - The Jiang Siblings’ Face Was Smashed","paragraphs":["Only a handful of people in the illegal district could be called big shots.","There was Lu Zhi.","As well as Jian Jin.","Even the Jiang family might not be able to reach this height. Their family was not qualified to come into contact with these people. If they had to say who was qualified to play with these people in Beijing, it would be that person from the Ye family!","Xu Jishen couldn’t help but sigh. “Jiang Yao, didn’t you tell me that your cousin came from Rao City? I don’t think so! Miss Jiang might not even know these people!”","The Miss Jiang he was talking about was clearly Jiang Xianrou.","Jiang Xianrou was famous in Beijing for being able to play with Qin Si’s small circle.","Her status was not low.","In the Jiang family, Old Master Jiang and Jiang Zongnan thought highly of her because of this.","Now that someone was pointing at her nose and saying that she wasn’t qualified to know someone Qiao Nian knew, Jiang Xianrou felt an incomparable pain on her face. It was even more painful than being slapped by her father. Her ears were buzzing, and her mind was a mess.","She couldn’t accept it for a moment. “How did Qiao Nian know Jian Jin...”","She did not speak loudly, but Jiang Yao and Jiang Zongnan heard her. Unfortunately, no one else paid attention to her.","Jiang Yao was still in shock. “Young Master Xu, are you mistaken?”","“How could I be wrong?” Xu Jishen said with certainty and confidence. “I can’t be wrong! That’s why I asked you if the sports car your cousin’s schoolmate saw was the car in the photo. If you didn’t take the wrong car, then your cousin knows the big shot in the illegal district. Jiang Yao, your sister is extraordinary~ When you’re free, recommend me to her. I’ll treat you.”","What else could Jiang Yao say? He opened his mouth but could not say a word. He didn’t expect Xu Jishen to find this result from checking the license plate number.","Qiao Nian knew a big shot in the illegal district... He had never associated Qiao Nian with the illegal district!","Jiang Yao hung up on Xu Jishen with an unknown expression.","Before he could digest the news, he saw that his father’s expression was extremely ugly. With a straight face, he said to him seriously, “... The company almost reached a cooperation with JC Corporation previously, but today, JC suddenly informed us that we had offended one of their higher-ups. They terminated their handover to us.”","Jiang Yao originally could not digest the information revealed by Xu Jishen’s call. Upon hearing what his father said, his handsome face became even more solemn and he could not recover for a long time.","Was it really such a coincidence?","However, how could Qiao Nian know someone from the illegal district? And it was someone at Jian Jin’s level. It had to be known that he and Xu Jishen had yet to come into contact with someone at that level.","Qiao Nian had been living in Rao City and had only come to Beijing recently. How could such an ordinary girl come into contact with these people?","And the mysterious diamond big shot behind Jian Jin...","Jiang Yao felt like he was trapped by an invisible net. He vaguely grasped some information, but it flashed past in an instant.","He had no time to investigate.","Jiang Yao said, “I’ll call Qiao Nian.”","...","In a private room on the second floor of the Imperial Mansion.","The girl was sitting in a seat by the window. Her exquisite eyes were wrapped in clarity. Her shoulder bag was beside her hand, and her phone was on the table.","The dishes had just been served when her phone rang.","Qiao Nian hung up and put the phone back when she saw that the call was from Jiang Yao."]},{"number":1292,"title":"Chapter 1292 - Sister Nian: Oh, a Harassment Call","paragraphs":["However, Jiang Yao was clearly persistent. Jiang Yao called again just as she hung up the first call.","He would continue calling if she did not answer!","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, the corners of her mouth twitching. She licked her lips and took the cell phone back. Without hesitation, she hung up and simply blacklisted Jiang Yao’s number.","The private room fell silent.","Qiao Nian tossed the cell phone back onto the table, picked up the cup of bitter tea on the table with her clean hand, and took a sip. She took her time, her exquisite face expressionless.","Jiang Zongjin only saw her hanging up the phone twice before putting it back. He broke the silence in the room and asked her curiously, “Nian Nian, who called?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him with her dark eyes. She put down her cup and placed her hand casually on her lap. “A harassment call.”","“Oh.”","Jiang Zongjin did not know that those harassment calls would never be able to reach Qiao Nian’s private phone. He automatically assumed that Jiang Yao’s calls were those harassment calls from marketing companies and did not ask further.","It just so happened that the waiter served all the dishes at this time.","The waiter stepped aside and placed his hand in front of him, then said respectfully, “Hello, your dishes are served. Please enjoy.”","Ye Wangchuan finally moved. Like Qiao Nian, he lazily picked up the cup of bitter tea and lowered his head to take a sip. He then put down the teacup and said to the waiter, “You may go. And close the door.”","The waiter did not dare to delay. He immediately responded and quietly went out, closing the door on his way out.","After the waiter left, Ye Wangchuan looked up, his eyes bright and clear. He looked at the middle-aged man sitting opposite him and said politely, “Uncle Jiang, the Jade Salmon in front of you is not bad. Try it.”","“Ah, okay, okay.” Jiang Zongjin did not expect him to be so enthusiastic and even invited him to taste the dishes. He felt a little uncomfortable for a moment. He grabbed the chopsticks in front of him and picked up a piece of fish.","The meat of the salmon itself was more tender than other fish. The culinary skills of the chef in Imperial Mansion were not to be trifled with! The steamed salmon slices were sprinkled with green seasoning. The color was clear and bright. The fish slices tasted sweet. There was a hint of spiciness to the dish as well, but it happened to be a rather light flavor that Jiang Zongjin liked.","Jiang Zongjin’s brows couldn’t help but relax after eating the dishes that suited his taste. He felt much more relaxed and his back was not as tense as before.","Ye Wangchuan recommended a few more dishes to him.","Jiang Zongjin tried them one by one.","He realized that Ye Wangchuan seemed to know his taste very well. Every dish he recommended happened to hit his spot. It was completely to his liking.","In a short period of time, Jiang Zongjin already had a good impression of him.","They were not as polite and distant as before as they talked now. “How did Young Master Ye get so familiar with Nian Nian? Nian Nian said that she called you to pick us up. I was a little surprised. I didn’t expect it to really be you.”","The Jiang family had a good relationship with the Ye family.","It was mainly because of their relationship shared among the older generation. However, the younger generation did not interact often. He almost had no interaction with Ye Lan.","With Ye Wangchuan, who was a generation younger than him, it was needless to say that they interacted even less.","The only time they met was a year ago in Rao City. Jiang Zongjin still felt emotional when he thought about it.","That was the first time he had seen Qiao Nian.","They were also eating at a Chinese restaurant called Waterside Loft. Ye Wangchuan was there at the time."]},{"number":1293,"title":"Chapter 1293 - Dad, He’s My Boyfriend","paragraphs":["At this thought, Jiang Zongjin looked at Qiao Nian.","The girl had her head down, chopsticks in hand, and was focused on eating.","Perhaps it was because she was quite relaxed at this moment, but her cool and overly-independent aura was gone. Her eyelashes covered her beautiful black eyes.","The girl had fair skin and looked exceptionally obedient.","Jiang Zongjin’s heart suddenly softened and his eyes followed as if there was a spring breeze. He turned his head and said to the man, “No matter what, thank you, Young Master Ye, for driving over to pick us up this time. I’ll treat you to lunch today. Don’t stand on ceremony with me!”","The others in the Jiang family all thought that he was teaching at Qing University and did not have much money on his account. Actually, Jiang Zongjin had received a lot of scientific research bonuses over the years.","He usually lived a frugal life and did not use much, so he saved all his money. Now, he had saved a considerable amount of money in his bank account.","The interest from the bank alone was enough for ordinary households to spend for several years.","Therefore, he could still afford to treat them to a meal.","Ye Wangchuan did not give him the chance. He said in a hoarse and polite voice, “Uncle Jiang, you’re too polite. I said that I’ll treat you to lunch. How can I let you pay?”","“But...” Jiang Zongjin didn’t want Qiao Nian to owe her friend a favor and was about to refuse.","Ye Wangchuan was very sensible and gave him a compromise suggestion. “Uncle Jiang, Nian Nian and I are... good friends. As a junior, I should be the one paying today. If you don’t think it’s good, we can meet again another day. I won’t fight over it with you next time you want to pay, okay?”","The corners of Qiao Nian’s mouth twitched when she heard him tell her father that they were ‘good friends’. She slowly put down her chopsticks, wiped her mouth, and said, “Dad.”","“Huh?” Jiang Zongjin was still thinking about the feasibility of Ye Wangchuan’s suggestion when his daughter suddenly called out to him. He instinctively responded to his daughter first. “Nian Nian, what is it?”","Qiao Nian leaned back in her chair. “Let him treat us. It’s only right, anyway.”","Jiang Zongjin was speechless.","How was it ‘only right’ of him to treat them?","He couldn’t let others treat him even if they were friends.","He was an elder and the oldest person at the table. What if his daughter’s friend looked down on him?","Moreover, Ye Wangchuan’s circle was... quite proud.","Even Jiang Xianrou had to please them if she wanted to get in touch with that circle.","Jiang Zongjin did not want Qiao Nian to be looked down upon by outsiders.","To his surprise, he frowned, still trying to figure out how to say it. “That’s... not a good idea.”","The girl said quite naturally, “There’s nothing wrong with that.”","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her hand. Her eyes were dark but bright as she said casually, “Dad, let me introduce you. He’s my boyfriend.”","The entire room fell silent the moment the word ‘boyfriend’ was spoken.","This was the first time Gu San had witnessed such a scene. He was so frightened that he did not dare to say a word. He shrunk his neck and tried his best to reduce his presence.","F*ck, he did not expect Miss Qiao to come out so suddenly and directly admit Master Wang’s identity to Uncle Jiang. This...","Gu San subconsciously looked at the middle-aged man.","As expected.","Jiang Zongjin’s jaw almost dropped. He felt as if he had been struck by lightning and could not react for a long time. He even suspected that he was hearing things.","“Nian Nian, you said that Young Master Ye is your...”","Qiao Nian admitted frankly, “Ah, he’s my boyfriend.”"]},{"number":1294,"title":"Chapter 1294 - Master Wang: My Girlfriend Is","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongjin retracted his chin a little, but he was also shocked by this news in his heart. He couldn’t accept it.","The Ye and Jiang families had always had a marriage arrangement, but only he and the old man knew about this.","Whether it was the old man or him, they had never taken the verbal engagement between the two families to heart. They both felt that Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan were not compatible.","Who knew...","Jiang Zongjin really could not accept it.","However, he couldn’t bear to tell his precious daughter off. He subconsciously looked at the young man opposite him and frowned. The favorable impression he had previously almost disappeared. “What? When did this happen?”","“Recently.” Qiao Nian tilted her head, her eyes dark and beautiful. “Yes... the probation period has just expired.”","“Probation period??? What do you mean?” Jiang Zongjin felt that he couldn’t keep up with the young people.","There was a probation period for love? What was that?","He thought of how Ye Wangchuan had been staying in Rao City previously, and his heart sank. A thought popped up in his mind. Could they have dated during Nian Nian’s college entrance examination?","Ye Wangchuan was too insensible!","And Jiang Li. Why had he never mentioned this to him?","Jiang Zongjin’s mind was a mess. He couldn’t figure out what was going on for a moment amidst his mixed feelings. The next moment, he felt guilty that he was busy with scientific research and did not care about his daughter. He couldn’t accept that his precious daughter, whom he had just found, had been stolen under his nose.","This was the first time he had experienced the bitterness and frustration of being a father! Jiang Zongjin was completely dumbfounded and did not know how to deal with the sudden situation in front of him.","“Uncle Jiang.” Ye Wangchuan did not expect Qiao Nian to admit his identity. There was a faint light in his eyes, and his thin lips were very pale. His gentlemanly smile was polite. “I was not considerate enough in my thinking and didn’t tell you in advance.”","He looked at Qiao Nian with gentle eyes.","His aura was reserved, but it couldn’t hide his nobility and upbringing. “Nian Nian is very outstanding. She’s more outstanding than all the people I’ve met. That’s why I can’t help but be attracted to her. The more I understand her, the more I realize that she has many brilliant points... Uncle Jiang, Qiao Nian really is the most outstanding girl I’ve ever seen. She’s impeccable in all aspects! I might still have many shortcomings, but I’ll work hard to be a good man who can shelter her from the wind and rain.”","Jiang Zongjin was speechless. It was mainly because he did not expect Ye Wangchuan to lower himself so much. It was so low that even he, her father, had nothing to say. “You... don’t have to say that.”","Ye Wangchuan was the most outstanding person among the younger generation in Beijing. No one would deny his excellence.","Even though Jiang Zongjin did not like that Ye Wangchuan had taken his precious girl, he couldn’t say that he was not worthy of her.","Putting everything else aside, Ye Wangchuan was actually an outstanding young man. He wouldn’t have such a big reaction if not for his high status.","“You’re quite outstanding, too,” Jiang Zongjin said with some unpleasantness.","Ye Wangchuan looked at him and smiled seriously. “Uncle Jiang, I’m serious about everything I say. Nian Nian is the best girl I’ve ever seen.”","Jiang Zongjin was stunned and did not reply for a moment. However, his initial dissatisfaction had mostly disappeared, and he inexplicably began to accept this matter.","The main reason was that Ye Wangchuan’s attitude was too humble. There was also one thing that he was especially satisfied with—everyone felt that Qiao Nian was inferior to Jiang Xianrou, or even many people in Beijing. However, every word Ye Wangchuan said was that his daughter was very outstanding. She was not inferior to anyone!"]},{"number":1295,"title":"Chapter 1295 - Removing Jiang Xianrou from the Recruitment List","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan took the opportunity to pour him a glass of wine and toast him, then continued to tell him some interesting stories about Qiao Nian’s time in Rao City.","The tension in the private room disappeared.","Qiao Nian watched as a certain someone coaxed her father into a daze with just a few words. She drank one glass after another with him. The corners of her mouth twitched. She placed her hand on the dining table and tapped twice, then picked up her chopsticks again and did not disturb them. Letting them chat, she lowered her head to continue eating.","She ate without being pretentious.","She would eat and drink what she wanted, and would not bother to restrain herself just because she was out.","Qiao Nian enjoyed the meal to her heart’s content. After finishing the plate of spicy chicken in front of her, she slowly put down her chopsticks.","Seeing that the two of them were still drinking, she raised her hand and pulled down the brim of her cap. “Are you done eating?” she asked rather irritably. “It’s almost time to go back.”","She had a design to draw tonight.","Aunt Yuan was waiting for her to hand in her draft.","It would be almost 10 PM when she arrived home. She would take another shower. If everything went well, she could sleep at one o’clock. Otherwise, she might have to stay up late again.","Qiao Nian had been staying up late recently and had not had a good night’s sleep in a long time. She wanted to sleep early tonight.","“Dad, let’s go.”","Jiang Zongjin’s fair face was flushed from drinking. It was rare for him to be so happy. However, since Qiao Nian called him, he immediately stopped drinking. He put down the cup and said to Ye Wangchuan, “Let’s meet again next time.”","“Okay.”","The man looked quite normal. He had also drunk a lot of white wine, but it did not show on his face. His handsome face did not look abnormal at all. If it weren’t for the pinkish skin that was revealed from the side of the collar of his shirt, he would have looked like nothing had happened. “Uncle Jiang, let’s exchange numbers.”","Jiang Zongjin thought of his relationship with Qiao Nian and felt a little startled. However, his nature made him admire the young man in front of him very much. After a short hesitation, he exchanged numbers with Ye Wangchuan.","Gu San sent Jiang Zongjin back to the school dormitory near Qing University before driving back to Rhine Apartments.","As soon as she got home, Qiao Nian changed into her slippers and said succinctly, “I still have something to do. I’ll go back to my room first.”","Ye Wangchuan nodded. “Go ahead. I’ll make you a cup of tea later. What tea do you want?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him lazily. “I’ll drink plain water. Just get my bottle of mineral water.” Ye Wangchuan smiled, his eyes filled with affection. “Okay.”","She went up.","Only then did the man put away the gentleness in his eyes. He narrowed his eyes and walked towards the living room. As he walked, he said in a low and hoarse voice, “I heard that Jiang Xianrou went to the Ninth Branch today and passed Master Cheng’s laboratory’s recruitment trial? Who passed her?”","Gu San followed behind him and thought for a moment before answering, “I think it’s... Young Master Bo.”","He immediately explained, “Young Master Bo doesn’t know about the grudge between Miss Jiang and Miss Qiao. He thought that Miss Jiang was the same as before.”","In the past, Jiang Xianrou was the center of attention in their small circle. It wasn’t that she was of the highest status, but she was the only girl and Jiang Li’s sister. The others more or less took care of her.","Bo Jingxing did the same.","“Mm.” Ye Wangchuan hummed. His voice was calm and emotionless. “Tell Bo Jingxing to remove Jiang Xianrou from the recruitment list.”"]},{"number":1296,"title":"Chapter 1296 - Everyone in Beijing Has to Know That Jiang Xianrou Has Been Excluded From the Small Circle","paragraphs":["“Master Wang??” Gu San looked up at him in surprise. His tongue was tied. “You said to remove Miss Jiang’s name from the recruitment list...”","“Remove her.”","The collar of Ye Wangchuan’s white shirt was slightly open. He walked to the refrigerator, opened the door, and took out a bottle of mineral water.","He had an attractive face and a high nose bridge.","When he spoke, he always exuded a relaxed and lazy aura, but his eyes contained sharp darkness.","Extremely serious.","He was like an eagle in the night, cold, arrogant, and lonely, yet domineering. He exuded a domineering aura that looked down at the world.","Gu San was almost stunned. It took him a full second to react. The gears in his mind spun slightly and he stopped asking. “I’ll call Young Master Bo and tell him.”","“Okay.”","Ye Wangchuan ignored this matter and went upstairs with the mineral water.","Gu San looked at his departing figure and couldn’t help but click his tongue. Miss Jiang had really kicked a steel plate this time.","Initially, no matter how Miss Jiang caused trouble in the past, Master Wang did not do anything to her because of Young Master Jiang. She could have provoked anyone and gotten away with it, but she had to provoke Miss Qiao.","Losing Master Cheng’s recruitment spot this time was nothing. The key was that after this matter, everyone in the Beijing circle would know that Master Wang had fallen out with her!","It would probably be difficult for Miss Jiang to rely on Master Wang’s connections to do whatever she wanted in Beijing in the future.","Of course, Young Master Qin did not bring her along to play anymore ever since she played tricks at Miss Qiao’s school promotion banquet.","Their relationship had long since faded.","It was just hanging by a thread!","Now, he wondered how Miss Jiang would feel after knowing that she had been removed from the recruitment list. Would she regret what she had done?","...","On the second floor.","Qiao Nian took a shower before changing into a new T-shirt. The T-shirt was very long, and the hem covered her thighs. It was September, and the weather was hot. It was still stuffy at night. She did not wear long pants and instead wore a pair of sports shorts under the T-shirt.","At a glance, it was as if she was not wearing any bottoms under her shirt. Her long and straight legs were faintly discernible under her T-shirt, making one’s nose bleed.","Qiao Nian had not blow-dried her hair. Her black hair was wet and draped over her shoulders, but she couldn’t be bothered. She dragged away the stool in front of the desk and sat down. Her long legs were crossed arrogantly, and one of her feet swayed restlessly.","She stared at the white drawing paper in front of her with a pencil in her mouth...","She had been sitting in front of the draft paper for half an hour, but no inspiration hit her.","This time, the theme of the new SEVEN series was “An unrealistic rosy view”. Yuan Yongqin hoped that she could come up with a few designs related to this theme.","Qiao Nian held a 2B pencil in her fair hand and drew a circle on the draft paper. It was a few messy strokes. Soon, she crossed it out with a pen. She was not satisfied with the prototype design on the draft paper.","A piece of paper was torn out, crumpled into a ball, and thrown into a nearby trash can.","There was a knock on the door at that moment.","She leaned back in her chair and dropped her pencil. “Come in,” she said lazily.","Sure enough, the door was opened.","The man’s tall and straight figure walked in from outside. The smell of white wine from dinner still lingered on his body. It was faint and inconspicuous, dissipating in the air.","Seeing him enter, Qiao Nian put down her crossed legs and changed her posture. She sat up straighter than before, but even so, she still looked a little sloppy. “You didn’t take a shower?”"]},{"number":1297,"title":"Chapter 1297 - Are You Free Tomorrow? Meet","paragraphs":["She knew that Ye Wangchuan was more or less a clean freak.","He would definitely shower when he returned after going out.","After drinking with her father tonight, he actually did not go to his room to take a shower first.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect Qiao Nian to ask him about this. He was stunned for a moment before smiling. He walked over and handed the water to the girl. “I’ll go right away. I wanted to bring the water to you first. I’ll go take a shower now.”","Qiao Nian hummed and took the mineral water from him. With her dark eyelashes lowered, she unscrewed the cap with one hand.","She did not manage to drink when the man spoke, as if he was doing it on purpose, “You dislike the smell of alcohol on me?”","Qiao Nian stopped twisting the lid. For some reason, her heart felt like it had been brushed by a feather. It was itchy, hot, and dry.","She pursed her lips and looked over with dark eyes. She said slowly, “Not really... It’s just a little strange. I asked casually.”","“I’ll try to drink less wine in the future if you don’t like it.” Ye Wangchuan was very natural and followed her words. There was a hint of helplessness between his eyebrows. He raised his hand and pinched the bridge of his nose, his eyes deep and bright. “Today is an exception. Uncle Jiang was there, so I wanted to drink with him.”","The main reason was that he had not expected Qiao Nian to introduce him directly in front of Father Jiang. At first, he had said that they were friends.","Since Qiao Nian had admitted his identity, as a junior, he should drink with Father Jiang.","Although it had happened suddenly, etiquette could not be lacking. He couldn’t embarrass her.","“God, was my performance today satisfying?” Ye Wangchuan’s eyes instantly softened when he thought of this, as if he had crushed a pool of stars.","Qiao Nian didn’t say anything at first. Seeing that he was still explaining to her, she couldn’t help but feel a wave of heat in her heart. It was very hot, but she couldn’t tell where it was hot. Her cheeks and earlobes seemed to be burning. She looked away and held the bottle of mineral water in her hand. “Ahem, you were alright.”","“Nian Nian, I was just alright?” Ye Wangchuan was clearly not satisfied with this answer. However, Young Master Ye was clearly not as anxious as other men. He still acted calm even when it came to such matters. His voice was hoarse and seductive. “Then, I’ll continue to work hard next time.”","“Ahem.”","Qiao Nian really choked on her own saliva this time.","Fortunately, she reacted quickly. She pinched the cap and tilted her head to drink water, hiding her embarrassment.","Ye Wangchuan knew her personality too well. He knew when to stop. He went to the bathroom and got a towel. Then, he stood behind her and naturally and skillfully dried her wet hair. At the same time, he prevented Qiao Nian from tensing up as he cleverly changed the topic. “Are you free tomorrow morning?”","Qiao Nian’s attention was all on her back. Her body instinctively made her wary of everything on her back, but the faint minty fragrance on Ye Wangchuan made her relax her guard.","With someone drying her hair, Qiao Nian’s shoulders couldn’t help but relax. She narrowed her eyes like a lazy cat and said lazily, “Oh, tomorrow? I don’t think there’s anything else.”","“Will you accompany me to meet someone tomorrow?” Ye Wangchuan dried her hair. His fingers ran through the girl’s shoulder-length ink-like hair lightly. Gu San’s jaw would probably drop if he saw this scene.","Master Wang personally served someone???","How much face did this person have?","The temperature in the room was warm. Qiao Nian was already a little sleepy. She yawned and asked him concisely, “What time?”"]},{"number":1298,"title":"Chapter 1298 - Offended Ye Wangchuan of All People","paragraphs":["“10 AM,” Ye Wangchuan said gently. He thought about her schedule and added, “Let’s see what time you can get up.”","Qiao Nian’s eyelids began to flutter. Her upper eyelids were about to stick to her eyelids. She hummed softly, as if she had heard but not heard clearly.","She was too sleepy. Behind her, Ye Wangchuan was drying her hair gently and slowly. It was clearly just drying her hair, but it made her sleepy.","When he finished helping her dry her hair, she was so sleepy that she could barely open her eyes.","She forced herself to wake up and supported her chin with her hand, then asked again, “What does your friend want?”","Ye Wangchuan did not hide it from her. He placed the towel on the table beside him and tied her hair up with a hair tie before saying, “Yes, he wants to investigate someone.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She was a little interested and no longer wanted to sleep. “Who?”","“A man who’s been smuggling and selling drugs internationally for years. I don’t know his name. People in the black market call him by his nickname, Eagle Eye.”","Ye Wangchuan spoke casually as if that person was just a small character.","However, this person with the code name Eagle Eye actually gave the FBI a headache because he was extremely cunning and ruthless.","He knew many people in the illegal district. He used his powerful network to get wind of it and escape before the police could carry out the arrest.","Qiao Nian had heard this name before. She rested her cold fingers on her lap and looked up at him. “How did he provoke you?”","Eagle Eye could have provoked anyone, but he provoked Ye Wangchuan...","She wasn’t sure what other forces this man had, but she knew that Ye Wangchuan definitely had more than just the Ninth Branch.","From Ye Wangchuan’s tone, even if Eagle Eye did not die this time, he would lose a layer of skin!","The collar of Ye Wangchuan’s white shirt was slightly open, and his sleeves were rolled up to his elbows, revealing his cold white skin.","His eyes were deep and spirited, his nose bridge was high, and his thin lips were sexy and thin. When he smiled, his eyes were cold, like a lion in the night. He exuded a domineering aura as he stood alone. “A month ago, he appeared in the country to conduct a drug transaction. Later, he was locked down by the police. He killed a family of three in order to escape.","“The child he killed was only six years old. He stabbed him a dozen times before he died. He could have avoided killing, but he was afraid that the family would say that they had seen him. Just in case, he would rather kill them than let three innocent people go.”","Qiao Nian was silent for a second. The corners of her eyes raised, and a murderous look appeared on her face. Her voice turned cold. “Heh, he does deserve to die.”","Then, she said, “I have time tomorrow morning. You guys want to check his location, right?”","“Yes. From what we know so far, we can roughly confirm that he’s hiding in a port in the country. Just as we were tracking his exact location, he got someone to hide his whereabouts. We can’t confirm his exact location now. The police can’t mobilize to arrest him without his precise location.” Ye Wangchuan didn’t hide anything from her. “The police are quite anxious. Eagle Eye is cunning and good at pretending. Once he gets a fake identity, he’s very likely to escape abroad. It’ll be difficult to catch him again.”","If not for this, he would never have thought of asking Qiao Nian for help.","After all, these things were not something an 18-year-old girl should be involved in."]},{"number":1299,"title":"Chapter 1299 - The Point Is That The Other Party Is Too Young!!","paragraphs":["However, Bo Jingxing’s uncle had come to him for help. Other than Qiao Nian, he couldn’t think of anyone else who had the ability to find Eagle Eye.","Of course, he could also make a move. However, the enemy would be alerted if he did.","In the Ninth Branch, Luo Qing and the others did not have the ability... Overall, only Qiao Nian could help with this.","Qiao Nian nodded and didn’t say anything else. She just said impatiently, “10 AM, right? Got it.”","The next day.","10 AM.","Qiao Nian woke up early in the morning and took a photo of the design drawing for Yuan Yongqin before sending it to her email.","Someone had already arrived in the private room.","Bo Zheng casually drank the water in his cup.","He was used to not touching coffee or other refreshing drinks. He only drank plain water. He would only touch a little wine and tea occasionally during the holidays. Most of the time, even in a place like a cafe, he only wanted a cup of plain water.","He had an appointment with Ye Wangchuan at 10 o’clock.","But he had come early. He had arrived at the meeting place an hour early and had been waiting here.","He was accompanied by the deputy captain. The deputy captain was younger than him, and youthful exuberance of youth exuded between his brows.","In terms of personality, he clearly had the unique problem of being young. He was not so calm!","The deputy captain looked at his watch almost every few minutes, unable to hide the anxiety on his tanned face. Finally, he couldn’t suppress his anxiety and said anxiously, “Captain Bo, is the person you’re waiting for not here yet?”","Bo Zheng was calmer and more imposing than him. He put down the water cup unhurriedly and said, “I made an appointment with him at ten. It’s not time yet, is it?”","“I know, but this is urgent. I’m afraid if we delay any longer, Eagle Eye will get away.” He kept the impatience out of his voice. It was obvious he’d been holding back.","Bo Zheng asked him casually, “What’s the use of being anxious? Eagle Eye won’t escape? As long as we can’t find his exact location, it’s useless even if you’re anxious. We can’t catch him!”","This was reasonable, and his deputy captain understood this. However, he couldn’t help but feel anxious and angry. He wished he knew computers. He could find the criminal’s location with a few taps on the keyboard and immediately bring people to arrest him!","After all, this Eagle Eye was too vicious. It wouldn’t be enough for the commoners to be angry if they did not catch him!","The deputy captain knew that his superior had a point. He could only suppress his anger for the time being and wait for the other party to bring experts.","At ten o’clock, a black car with a red flag was parked on the road outside.","Bo Zheng saw the car stop through the glass window of the private room and said in a low voice, “He’s here.”","“They’re here?” Deputy Captain Luo’s eyes lit up. He immediately stood up and craned his neck to look out. He immediately saw the parked car.","Then, he saw two people get out of the car. One was a young man he did not know.","The other one was even more ridiculous—a girl. She was wearing a sweater with gray letters on the top and denim bitter on the bottom. Her jeans were slightly tucked in at the waist and clung to her waist, showing off her figure. The girl stood sideways to him, her legs straight and long under her jeans.","That was not even the point.","The key was that even from so far away, Deputy Captain Luo was certain that the other party was extremely young."]},{"number":1300,"title":"Chapter 1300 - Can They Do It?","paragraphs":["Deputy Captain Luo only glanced at the man and woman outside. He was slightly stunned before looking away from the road, hoping that someone else was coming.","The coffee shop Bo Zheng chose was located in the downtown area of Beijing, but the location was exquisite. It was a quiet geographical environment.","Although there was a road outside the coffee shop, it was a one-way street near a residential area. Tall sycamores were planted on both sides of the road.","Usually, only people who lived nearby could be seen pushing small carts for groceries on the sidewalk. Very few cars drove in.","Other than the black car he had seen at the beginning, no other car had entered.","Deputy Captain Luo was clearly a little surprised. After craning his neck and looking around, he turned back and whispered to the man, “Captain Bo, are you mistaken? Why don’t I see anyone coming?”","At this moment, Bo Zheng was looking at Ye Wangchuan, who was walking towards them, through the glass window. His thick black eyebrows were raised, and his eyes were dignified. He also showed surprise, but he was a little better than Deputy Captain Luo. “No. He’s coming over.”","“Captain Bo, are you talking about the young man who got out of the car just now?” Deputy Captain Luo did not want to ask this. This was undoubtedly the worst outcome for him.","What the hell!","Forget about that man. Although he looked young, he was at least an adult who had entered society.","The key was the girl with him. That girl... Did she graduate from high school yet? Deputy Captain Luo was not sure. He just subconsciously thought that their Captain Bo had been shrewd for a lifetime and was muddle-headed for a moment. He had said that he would find an expert to locate Eagle Eye. Why did he find two young hotheads? Wasn’t this ridiculous?","If anyone could find Eagle Eye, how could so many of their core members of the criminal police team have tracked him down all night to no avail?","What their technicians could not do, Captain Bo could find two young people to solve?","Deputy Captain Luo couldn’t help but ask, “Can they do it?”","“Didn’t I teach you not to judge a person’s ability from their appearance? Especially in our line of work, you can’t judge a book by its cover. You follow me on cases and don’t notice that the more vicious the criminal, the more timid and honest they look daily. If they look honest in life, does that mean they aren’t murderers?”","Bo Zheng took out a pack of cigarettes from his pocket, took one out, lit it, and bit it. His thin lips touched, and he leaned back. His eyes narrowed slightly as he continued, “It’s the same now. You haven’t come into contact with them yet. How do you know they can’t do it?”","Deputy Captain Luo was speechless. Although he couldn’t refute his words, it was right for him to not acknowledge him.","“Prisoners are prisoners. They’re them. How can you compare these two things? I’m not saying to judge them by their looks. I just think they’re... too young!","“Especially that girl. Captain Bo, did you see that girl outside? I think she just graduated from high school. How can she be an expert in IP tracking at such a young age? Isn’t that nonsense? It’s not that I don’t believe it. I just think it’s too much.”","How could Bo Zheng not be surprised that Ye Wangchuan would bring him such a young ‘expert’? He thought that the other party would at least choose a team leader from the Ninth Branch, such as Luo Qing, who was more famous in this aspect, or Chen Zhu, who had recently risen to prominence."]}]);
